#: ./legacy.json
msgid "reanimated augmented soldier"
msgid_plural "reanimated augmented soldiers"
msgstr[0] "蘇生した強化兵士"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'reanimated augmented soldier'}
#: ./legacy.json
msgid ""
"An advanced, well-equipped member of the military that still succumbed to "
"the cataclysm.  This one has no sign of its signature weaponry and its armor"
" is in tatters, yet it still marches on with unnerving confidence and speed."
msgstr ""
"高度な装備を備えた軍の精鋭でありながら、大変動には抗えなかった一体だ。象徴的な武装の痕跡はなく、鎧はぼろぼろだが、それでも不気味なほどの自信と速さで進み続けている。"

#: ./modinfo.json
msgid "<color_light_green>Cataclysm++</color>"
msgstr "<color_light_green>Cataclysm++</color>"

#. ~ Description for <color_light_green>Cataclysm++</color>
#: ./modinfo.json
msgid ""
"The unofficial expansion mod for Cataclysm: Bright Nights.\n"
"\n"
"The gigantic jabberwock of a mod that adds a lot of content to the game: new items, buildings, scenarios, monsters, etc. It also reworks and adds alternatives to many things from recipes to scenarios. It also adds a pseudo-story and lore on the works.\n"
"\n"
"The Bio-Weapon, Super Soldier, Commandeers, Slave Fighters and the Old World Prepper NPC factions join the world.\n"
"\n"
"Seek the Bio-weapons, find loot, take down new monsters and invest in skills for new craftable items."
msgstr ""
"Cataclysm: Bright Nights 用の非公式拡張MODだ。\n"
"\n"
"ゲームに大量のコンテンツを追加する、巨大な怪物のようなMODである。新規アイテム、建造物、シナリオ、モンスターなどに加え、レシピからシナリオまで多くの要素を作り直し、代替案を追加する。さらに、疑似的なストーリーとロアも加わる。\n"
"\n"
"生物兵器、スーパーソルジャー、コマンディア、奴隷闘士、旧世界のプレッパーといったNPC勢力が世界に加わる。\n"
"\n"
"生物兵器を探し、戦利品を見つけ、新たなモンスターを倒し、新しいクラフト可能なアイテムのためにスキルへ投資しよう。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Failed Bio-Weapon"
msgstr "失敗作の生物兵器"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Failed Bio-Weapon"
msgstr "失敗作の生物兵器"

#. ~ Profession (male Failed Bio-Weapon) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"From the moment you opened your eyes you knew you were a failure, a reject."
"  Destined to be something great but many a mistake took that away from you."
"  You awoke in a world of monsters, but you're determined to prove you "
"aren't one of them."
msgstr ""
"目を開いた瞬間から、自分が失敗作であり、はじかれた存在だと分かっていた。偉大な何かになるはずだったが、数々の過ちがそれを奪い去った。目覚めた先はモンスターの世界だったが、自分はモンスターの一体ではないと証明すると心に決めている。"

#. ~ Profession (female Failed Bio-Weapon) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"From the moment you opened your eyes you knew you were a failure, a reject."
"  Destined to be something great but many a mistake took that away from you."
"  You awoke in a world of monsters, but you're determined to prove you "
"aren't one of them."
msgstr ""
"目を開いた瞬間から、自分が失敗作であり、はじかれた存在だと分かっていた。偉大な何かになるはずだったが、数々の過ちがそれを奪い去った。目覚めた先はモンスターの世界だったが、自分はモンスターの一体ではないと証明すると心に決めている。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
