msgid ""
"Assimilation process is complete, incorporation and modification of biology "
"and bionics into our system was successful.  Protection of our new domain "
"and brethren is our current objective.  Inability to remove previous DNA "
"marker is but a minor setback."
msgstr ""
"同化プロセスは完了した。生体機能とバイオニクスの我々のシステムへの統合・改変は成功した。新たな領域と同胞の防衛が、現在の目標である。以前のDNAマーカーを除去できないことは、些細な支障に過ぎない。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bio-Weapon Alpha"
msgstr "生物兵器アルファ"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bio-Weapon Alpha"
msgstr "生物兵器アルファ"

#. ~ Profession (male Bio-Weapon Alpha) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"'The Predator'.  You were the first, the Alpha.  Created to sow chaos behind"
" enemy lines, driven by hunger.  You awoke into the unknown with an appetite"
" - good thing the world is full of prey to devour!"
msgstr ""
"『捕食者』。最初に生み出された個体、アルファ。敵陣の背後に混沌をもたらすべく、飢えに突き動かされて創られた存在だ。見知らぬ世界に食欲を抱えて目覚めたが、幸い、この世界は貪り食う獲物に満ちている!"

#. ~ Profession (female Bio-Weapon Alpha) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"'The Predator'.  You were the first, the Alpha.  Created to sow chaos behind"
" enemy lines, driven by hunger.  You awoke into the unknown with an appetite"
" - good thing the world is full of prey to devour!"
msgstr ""
"『捕食者』。最初に生み出された個体、アルファ。敵陣の背後に混沌をもたらすべく、飢えに突き動かされて創られた存在だ。見知らぬ世界に食欲を抱えて目覚めたが、幸い、この世界は貪り食う獲物に満ちている!"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bio-Weapon Delta"
msgstr "生物兵器デルタ"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bio-Weapon Delta"
msgstr "生物兵器デルタ"

#. ~ Profession (male Bio-Weapon Delta) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"'The Infiltrator', created to infiltrate, scout, spy and assassinate.  "
"Capable of taking down enemies from afar, exploring enemy territory and "
"integrating into the local populace.  You awoke to chaos, and you plan to "
"eliminate whoever caused it."
msgstr ""
"『潜入者』。浸透、偵察、諜報、暗殺のために創られた存在だ。遠距離から敵を仕留め、敵地を探り、現地住民に紛れ込むことができる。混沌の中で目覚めたが、それを引き起こした者を排除するつもりでいる。"

#. ~ Profession (female Bio-Weapon Delta) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"'The Infiltrator', created to infiltrate, scout, spy and assassinate.  "
"Capable of taking down enemies from afar, exploring enemy territory and "
"integrating into the local populace.  You awoke to chaos, and you plan to "
"eliminate whoever caused it."
msgstr ""
"『潜入者』。浸透、偵察、諜報、暗殺のために創られた存在だ。遠距離から敵を仕留め、敵地を探り、現地住民に紛れ込むことができる。混沌の中で目覚めたが、それを引き起こした者を排除するつもりでいる。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bio-Weapon Beta"
msgstr "生物兵器ベータ"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bio-Weapon Beta"
msgstr "生物兵器ベータ"

#. ~ Profession (male Bio-Weapon Beta) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"'The Immortal', designed to be a one-man army.  Your body is a lethal "
"weapon, finely tuned arms and defenses ready to destroy anything standing in"
" your way.  You awoke to a horde of enemies, so now you take them all on."
msgstr ""
"『不死身』。一人で軍隊に匹敵するよう設計された存在だ。その身体そのものが必殺の兵器であり、精密に調整された攻防の力は行く手を阻むものすべてを打ち砕く。目覚めた先には敵の大群がいたが、その全てを相手にするまでだ。"

#. ~ Profession (female Bio-Weapon Beta) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"'The Immortal', designed to be a one-man army.  Your body is a lethal "
"weapon, finely tuned arms and defenses ready to destroy anything standing in"
" your way.  You awoke to a horde of enemies, so now you take them all on."
msgstr ""
"『不死身』。一人で軍隊に匹敵するよう設計された存在だ。その身体そのものが必殺の兵器であり、精密に調整された攻防の力は行く手を阻むものすべてを打ち砕く。目覚めた先には敵の大群がいたが、その全てを相手にするまでだ。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bio-Weapon Gamma"
msgstr "生物兵器ガンマ"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bio-Weapon Gamma"
msgstr "生物兵器ガンマ"

#. ~ Profession (male Bio-Weapon Gamma) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"'The Mechanic', created to sabotage, destroy, assimilate or repair bio-"
"technology.  You are a walking, adaptive repair machine.  You awoke to the "
"sounds of machines fighting abominations.  You could help them, or destroy "
"them, if they get in your way."
msgstr ""
"『機械工』。バイオテクノロジーの破壊工作、破壊、同化、修理のために創られた存在だ。歩く、適応型の修理機械そのものである。目覚めた先では、機械が忌まわしき怪物たちと戦う音が響いていた。それらを助けることも、行く手を阻むなら叩き潰すこともできる。"

#. ~ Profession (female Bio-Weapon Gamma) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"'The Mechanic', created to sabotage, destroy, assimilate or repair bio-"
"technology.  You are a walking, adaptive repair machine.  You awoke to the "
"sounds of machines fighting abominations.  You could help them, or destroy "
"them, if they get in your way."
msgstr ""
"『機械工』。バイオテクノロジーの破壊工作、破壊、同化、修理のために創られた存在だ。歩く、適応型の修理機械そのものである。目覚めた先では、機械が忌まわしき怪物たちと戦う音が響いていた。それらを助けることも、行く手を阻むなら叩き潰すこともできる。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
