#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Super Soldier"
msgstr "スーパーソルジャー"

#. ~ Profession (male Super Soldier) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The infantry of the Super Soldier project.  You are one of many augmented "
"soldiers to be deployed into a battle field to ensure victory.  With range "
"and melee capabilities, you engage enemies en masse."
msgstr ""
"スーパーソルジャー計画の歩兵だ。勝利を確実にするため戦場へ投入される、数多くの強化兵士の一人である。遠近両方の戦闘能力を備え、敵を大量に相手取る。"

#. ~ Profession (female Super Soldier) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The infantry of the Super Soldier project.  You are one of many augmented "
"soldiers to be deployed into a battle field to ensure victory.  With range "
"and melee capabilities, you engage enemies en masse."
msgstr ""
"スーパーソルジャー計画の歩兵だ。勝利を確実にするため戦場へ投入される、数多くの強化兵士の一人である。遠近両方の戦闘能力を備え、敵を大量に相手取る。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Super Scout"
msgstr "スーパースカウト"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Super Scout"
msgstr "スーパースカウト"

#. ~ Profession (male Super Scout) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The sniper of the Super Soldier project.  You are one of a few augmented "
"soldiers to be used for reconnaissance and V.I.P assassinations.  With your "
"weapons and skills, you can eliminate key targets after living for weeks in "
"enemy territory."
msgstr ""
"スーパーソルジャー計画の狙撃兵だ。偵察及び要人暗殺に用いられる、数少ない強化兵士の一人である。武器と技術を駆使し、数週間にわたり敵地に潜伏した後、重要目標を排除できる。"

#. ~ Profession (female Super Scout) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The sniper of the Super Soldier project.  You are one of a few augmented "
"soldiers to be used for reconnaissance and V.I.P assassinations.  With your "
"weapons and skills, you can eliminate key targets after living for weeks in "
"enemy territory."
msgstr ""
"スーパーソルジャー計画の狙撃兵だ。偵察及び要人暗殺に用いられる、数少ない強化兵士の一人である。武器と技術を駆使し、数週間にわたり敵地に潜伏した後、重要目標を排除できる。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Super Bio-engineer"
msgstr "スーパーバイオエンジニア"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Super Bio-engineer"
msgstr "スーパーバイオエンジニア"

#. ~ Profession (male Super Bio-engineer) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Biological and mechanical repair unit, the combat engineer of the Super "
"Soldier project.  You are one of many augmented military mechanics to be "
"used as a repair module.  With repair, medical and general electronic "
"capabilities, you can maybe fix the world."
msgstr ""
"生体と機械の両方を修理するユニットであり、スーパーソルジャー計画における戦闘工兵にあたる。修理モジュールとして運用される、数多くの強化軍用整備兵の一人だ。修理・医療・汎用電子機器の能力を備え、この世界を直せるかもしれない。"

#. ~ Profession (female Super Bio-engineer) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Biological and mechanical repair unit, the combat engineer of the Super "
"Soldier project.  You are one of many augmented military mechanics to be "
"used as a repair module.  With repair, medical and general electronic "
"capabilities, you can maybe fix the world."
msgstr ""
"生体と機械の両方を修理するユニットであり、スーパーソルジャー計画における戦闘工兵にあたる。修理モジュールとして運用される、数多くの強化軍用整備兵の一人だ。修理・医療・汎用電子機器の能力を備え、この世界を直せるかもしれない。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Super Juggernaut"
msgstr "スーパージャガーノート"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Super Juggernaut"
msgstr "スーパージャガーノート"

#. ~ Profession (male Super Juggernaut) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
