msgid ""
"The tank of the Super Soldier project.  You are one of a few augmented "
"soldiers to be used as a heavy support to infantry.  With ranged, armor and "
"regenerative capabilities, you can endure heavy damage and return it in "
"kind."
msgstr ""
"スーパーソルジャー計画のタンク役だ。歩兵部隊への重火力支援として使われる、数少ない強化兵士の一人にあたる。遠隔攻撃・装甲・再生能力を備え、大きな損傷に耐えながら同等の反撃を返せる。"

#. ~ Profession (female Super Juggernaut) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
