#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Slave Fighter (Blade)"
msgstr "奴隷闘士（ブレード）"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Slave Fighter (Blade)"
msgstr "奴隷闘士（ブレード）"

#. ~ Profession (male Slave Fighter (Blade)) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were kidnapped for some sort of underground bloodsport, augmented with a"
" blade and enhancements to your speed and reaction time.  Forced through "
"rudimentary training as a novelty fighter, you were expected to be able to "
"be down opponents with ease."
msgstr ""
"何らかの地下闘技場に拉致され、ブレードと、速度・反応速度を高める強化手術を施された。物珍しさで客を呼ぶ闘士として簡単な訓練を受けさせられ、いともたやすく相手を叩きのめすことを期待されていた。"

#. ~ Profession (female Slave Fighter (Blade)) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were kidnapped for some sort of underground bloodsport, augmented with a"
" blade and enhancements to your speed and reaction time.  Forced through "
"rudimentary training as a novelty fighter, you were expected to be able to "
"be down opponents with ease."
msgstr ""
