msgid "Slave Fighter (Shocker)"
msgstr "奴隷闘士（ショッカー）"

#. ~ Profession (male Slave Fighter (Shocker)) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were kidnapped for some sort of underground bloodsport, augmented with "
"electrical generation and protection bionics.  It was expected that you'd be"
" a living tesla coil in the ring, frying victims until they roll over and "
"die."
msgstr ""
"何らかの地下闘技場に拉致され、電撃を発生させるバイオニックと防御用バイオニックを埋め込まれた。リングの上で生きたテスラコイルとなり、相手が息絶えるまで感電させ続けることを期待されていた。"

#. ~ Profession (female Slave Fighter (Shocker)) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were kidnapped for some sort of underground bloodsport, augmented with "
"electrical generation and protection bionics.  It was expected that you'd be"
" a living tesla coil in the ring, frying victims until they roll over and "
"die."
msgstr ""
"何らかの地下闘技場に拉致され、電撃を発生させるバイオニックと防御用バイオニックを埋め込まれた。リングの上で生きたテスラコイルとなり、相手が息絶えるまで感電させ続けることを期待されていた。"

