#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Feral Bio-Weapon"
msgstr "野生化生物兵器"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Feral Bio-Weapon"
msgstr "野生化生物兵器"

#. ~ Profession (male Feral Bio-Weapon) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"From the moment you opened your eyes you knew you were a failure, a reject."
"  Destined to be something great but many a mistake took that away from you."
"  You awoke in a world of monsters, so only fitting that you're a monster "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"目を開けたその瞬間から、自分が失敗作であり、除け者だと分かっていた。偉大な何かになるはずだったが、数々の過ちがそれを奪い去った。目覚めた先はモンスターだらけの世界であり、自分自身もまたモンスターであるというのは、ある意味当然のことだった。"

#. ~ Profession (female Feral Bio-Weapon) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"From the moment you opened your eyes you knew you were a failure, a reject."
"  Destined to be something great but many a mistake took that away from you."
"  You awoke in a world of monsters, so only fitting that you're a monster "
"yourself."
