msgid "Feral Super Soldier"
msgstr "野生化スーパーソルジャー"

#. ~ Profession (male Feral Super Soldier) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of many augmented soldiers to be deployed into a battle field "
"to ensure victory, as part of the of the Super Soldier project.  Now there's"
" nothing left but more targets to be put down."
msgstr ""
"スーパーソルジャー計画の一環として、勝利を確実にするために戦場へ投入された、数多くの強化兵士の一人だった。今となっては、始末すべき標的が増えていくだけだ。"

#. ~ Profession (female Feral Super Soldier) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were one of many augmented soldiers to be deployed into a battle field "
"to ensure victory, as part of the of the Super Soldier project.  Now there's"
" nothing left but more targets to be put down."
