#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Feral Slave Fighter"
msgstr "野生化奴隷闘士"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Feral Slave Fighter"
msgstr "野生化奴隷闘士"

#. ~ Profession (male Feral Slave Fighter) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were augmented and used as part of an underground blood sport.  You "
"survived, a lot of fresh meat didn't.  Your handlers didn't either, and now "
"you've free once more, free and a lot hungrier than before you were "
"kidnapped."
msgstr ""
"強化手術を施され、地下闘技場の一部として利用されていた。生き延びたが、新入りの多くはそうはならなかった。調教師たちも同様だ。今、再び自由の身となった――拉致される前よりもずっと飢えた自由の身に。"

#. ~ Profession (female Feral Slave Fighter) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_bw.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were augmented and used as part of an underground blood sport.  You "
"survived, a lot of fresh meat didn't.  Your handlers didn't either, and now "
"you've free once more, free and a lot hungrier than before you were "
"kidnapped."
msgstr ""
"強化手術を施され、地下闘技場の一部として利用されていた。生き延びたが、新入りの多くはそうはならなかった。調教師たちも同様だ。今、再び自由の身となった――拉致される前よりもずっと飢えた自由の身に。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Prepper"
msgstr "プレッパー"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Prepper"
msgstr "プレッパー"

#. ~ Profession (male Prepper) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were paranoid about the world ending so you jumped on the prepper "
"bandwagon.  You read a book on survival and got yourself a gun pack and some"
" gear.  The cataclysm was not what you expected."
msgstr ""
"世界の終わりに怯えるあまり、プレッパーの流行に乗った。サバイバルの本を読み、銃一式と装備をひととおり揃えた。だが大変動は、想像していたものとは違っていた。"

#. ~ Profession (female Prepper) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were paranoid about the world ending so you jumped on the prepper "
"bandwagon.  You read a book on survival and got yourself a gun pack and some"
" gear.  The cataclysm was not what you expected."
msgstr ""
"世界の終わりに怯えるあまり、プレッパーの流行に乗った。サバイバルの本を読み、銃一式と装備をひととおり揃えた。だが大変動は、想像していたものとは違っていた。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Wasteland Drifter"
msgstr "荒野の漂流者"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Wasteland Drifter"
msgstr "荒野の漂流者"

#. ~ Profession (male Wasteland Drifter) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the end of the world, you found yourself wandering from town to town, "
"scavenging and learning as you go.  Sleeping under the stars, scraping by "
"one meal and one bullet at a time, you've taken to this new life like a duck"
" takes to water."
msgstr ""
"世界が終わり、気づけば町から町へとさすらい、物資を漁りながら経験を積んでいた。星空の下で眠り、一食ごと、一発の弾ごとに何とか食いつないでいく――そんな新しい生活に、水を得た魚のように馴染んでいった。"

#. ~ Profession (female Wasteland Drifter) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the end of the world, you found yourself wandering from town to town, "
"scavenging and learning as you go.  Sleeping under the stars, scraping by "
"one meal and one bullet at a time, you've taken to this new life like a duck"
" takes to water."
msgstr ""
"世界が終わり、気づけば町から町へとさすらい、物資を漁りながら経験を積んでいた。星空の下で眠り、一食ごと、一発の弾ごとに何とか食いつないでいく――そんな新しい生活に、水を得た魚のように馴染んでいった。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Wasteland Knight-Errant"
msgstr "荒野の遍歴騎士"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Wasteland Knight-Errant"
msgstr "荒野の遍歴騎士"

#. ~ Profession (male Wasteland Knight-Errant) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the world ended, you decided you would live by the sword.  By good "
"fortune or by dedication, you lived long enough to earn your steel."
msgstr "世界が終わったとき、剣に生きると心に決めた。幸運によるものか、それとも鍛錬のたまものか、自らの鋼を手にするまで生き延びてきた。"

#. ~ Profession (female Wasteland Knight-Errant) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the world ended, you decided you would live by the sword.  By good "
"fortune or by dedication, you lived long enough to earn your steel."
msgstr "世界が終わったとき、剣に生きると心に決めた。幸運によるものか、それとも鍛錬のたまものか、自らの鋼を手にするまで生き延びてきた。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Wasteland Techno-Barbarian"
msgstr "荒野のテクノ蛮族"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Wasteland Techno-Barbarian"
msgstr "荒野のテクノ蛮族"

#. ~ Profession (male Wasteland Techno-Barbarian) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The end of the world brings out the best and worst in everyone.  For you, it"
" was a chance to channel your pre-Cataclysm expertise into something more "
"primal.  Whether you have the might to use such armament remains to be seen."
msgstr ""
"世界の終わりは、誰の中にある最良のものも最悪のものも引きずり出す。自分にとってそれは、大変動以前に培った専門知識を、より原始的な何かへと注ぎ込む機会だった。そのような武装を使いこなすだけの力があるかどうかは、まだ分からない。"

#. ~ Profession (female Wasteland Techno-Barbarian) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The end of the world brings out the best and worst in everyone.  For you, it"
" was a chance to channel your pre-Cataclysm expertise into something more "
"primal.  Whether you have the might to use such armament remains to be seen."
msgstr ""
"世界の終わりは、誰の中にある最良のものも最悪のものも引きずり出す。自分にとってそれは、大変動以前に培った専門知識を、より原始的な何かへと注ぎ込む機会だった。そのような武装を使いこなすだけの力があるかどうかは、まだ分からない。"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Silencer"
msgstr "バイオニック・サイレンサー"

#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Silencer"
msgstr "バイオニック・サイレンサー"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Silencer) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were trained and equipped for infiltrating secure facilities for your "
"mysterious backers, to secure specific objects of interest and silence high-"
"value targets.  Now that they've gone silent themselves, you'll have to use "
"your gifts for simple survival."
msgstr ""
"正体不明の後援者のために、厳重警備の施設へ侵入する訓練と装備を与えられていた――目的の物品を確保し、価値の高い標的を“沈黙”させるために。だが今やその後援者自身が沈黙してしまった以上、その才能はただ生き延びるためだけに使うほかない。"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Silencer) description
#: ./Char_creation/c_classes_r.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were trained and equipped for infiltrating secure facilities for your "
"mysterious backers, to secure specific objects of interest and silence high-"
"value targets.  Now that they've gone silent themselves, you'll have to use "
"your gifts for simple survival."
msgstr ""
