#. ~ Name for scenario 'Prepper Safehouse' for a male character
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Prepper Safehouse"
msgstr "プレッパーの隠れ家"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Prepper Safehouse' for a female character
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Prepper Safehouse"
msgstr "プレッパーの隠れ家"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Prepper Safehouse' for a male character.
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You knew something was coming, so you made connections with like-minded "
"survivors beforehand to establish safe refuge.  You've made your plans, now "
"that you've weathered the first few months it's time for the next steps."
msgstr ""
"何かが起きると分かっていたため、事前に同じ考えを持つ生存者たちとつながりを作り、安全な避難所を築いておいた。計画は済ませてあり、最初の数か月を乗り切った今、次の段階に進むときが来た。"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Prepper Safehouse' for a female character.
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
