#. ~ Name for scenario 'Slave Fighter's Freedom' for a male character
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Slave Fighter's Freedom"
msgstr "奴隷闘士の自由"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Slave Fighter's Freedom' for a female character
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Slave Fighter's Freedom"
msgstr "奴隷闘士の自由"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Slave Fighter's Freedom' for a male character.
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"All your life, you have been experimented on and forced to fight others for "
"the amusement of your masters.  Never having seen the sun or the outside, "
"the cataclysm gave you a chance at freedom.  Now you just have to escape "
"from your fellow combatants…"
msgstr ""
"生まれてからずっと実験体にされ、主人たちの娯楽のために他者と戦わされてきた。太陽も外の世界も見たことがなかったが、大変動が自由への機会を与えてくれた。あとは同じ闘士たちの手から逃げ延びるだけだ……"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Slave Fighter's Freedom' for a female
#. character.
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"All your life, you have been experimented on and forced to fight others for "
"the amusement of your masters.  Never having seen the sun or the outside, "
"the cataclysm gave you a chance at freedom.  Now you just have to escape "
"from your fellow combatants…"
msgstr ""
"生まれてからずっと実験体にされ、主人たちの娯楽のために他者と戦わされてきた。太陽も外の世界も見たことがなかったが、大変動が自由への機会を与えてくれた。あとは同じ闘士たちの手から逃げ延びるだけだ……"

#. ~ Starting location for scenario 'Slave Fighter's Freedom'.
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Sketchy Cabin"
msgstr "怪しげな小屋"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Experimental Soldier Start' for a male character
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Experimental Soldier Start"
msgstr "実験兵士の始まり"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Experimental Soldier Start' for a female character
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Experimental Soldier Start"
msgstr "実験兵士の始まり"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Experimental Soldier Start' for a male
#. character.
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were part of a an advanced infantry unit, deployed to one of several "
"'priority sites' as part of a last-ditch effort to get the situation under "
"control.  Delays, casualties and having to fight your way through the chaos "
"led to you being the only one left by the time you reached the objective, "
"and with you being so hurt, things aren't looking any better."
msgstr ""
"先進的な歩兵部隊の一員として、事態を収拾するための最後の手段の一環で、複数の『最優先拠点』のひとつに派遣された。遅延や死傷者を出しながら混乱の中を戦い抜くうちに、目標地点へたどり着いた頃には生き残っているのは自分だけになっていた。深手を負った今、状況はまったく好転しそうにない。"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Experimental Soldier Start' for a female
#. character.
#: ./Char_creation/c_scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were part of a an advanced infantry unit, deployed to one of several "
"'priority sites' as part of a last-ditch effort to get the situation under "
"control.  Delays, casualties and having to fight your way through the chaos "
"led to you being the only one left by the time you reached the objective, "
"and with you being so hurt, things aren't looking any better."
msgstr ""
"先進的な歩兵部隊の一員として、事態を収拾するための最後の手段の一環で、複数の『最優先拠点』のひとつに派遣された。遅延や死傷者を出しながら混乱の中を戦い抜くうちに、目標地点へたどり着いた頃には生き残っているのは自分だけになっていた。深手を負った今、状況はまったく好転しそうにない。"

