#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bio-Weapon Apophis'}
#: ./Monsters/c_monsters.json
msgid ""
"The ultimate bionic mutant.  Only God knows why it exists.  With incredible "
"power, armor and bionics on its side, victory won't come easy."
msgstr "究極のバイオニック変異体だ。なぜ存在するのか、知るのは神のみぞ知る。驚異的な力と装甲、バイオニクスを備えており、勝利は容易ではない。"

