#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie augmented soldier'}
#: ./Monsters/c_monsters.json
msgid ""
"An advanced, well-equipped member of the military that still succumbed to "
"the cataclysm.  It staggers with an unsteady mechanical gait, as though "
"hindered by its augmentations."
msgstr ""
"高度に装備された軍の兵士だったが、それでも大変動に屈した。強化によって動きを阻害されているかのように、不安定な機械的足取りでよろめいている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'zombie augmented soldier'}
