msgid "Failed Bio-Weapon"
msgstr "失敗作の生物兵器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Failed Bio-Weapon'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"This DNA marker serves as a reminder of what you are - another failure in "
"this world.  It identifies you as a Failed Bio-Weapon."
msgstr ""
"このDNAマーカーは、自らが何者か——この世界におけるもう一つの失敗作であることを思い出させるものだ。失敗作の生物兵器であることを示している。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Super Soldier Marker"
msgstr "スーパーソルジャー・マーカー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Super Soldier Marker'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"This is a DNA marker identifying you as part of the Super Soldier Project.  "
"It was used to give you clearances to biometric scanners and special weapons"
" but now a days it seems useless."
msgstr ""
"これはスーパーソルジャー計画の一員であることを示すDNAマーカーだ。かつては生体認証スキャナーや特殊武器へのアクセス権を与えるために使われていたが、今となっては役に立たないようだ。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Natural Armor"
msgstr "天然装甲"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Natural Armor'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your skin and underlying muscles are hard as stone.  You have innate "
"resistance to all forms of physical damage and are less likely to suffer "
"bleeding, but you also suffer extra encumbrance."
msgstr "皮膚とその下の筋肉は石のように硬い。あらゆる物理ダメージに対して生まれつきの耐性を持ち、出血もしにくくなるが、代わりに動きの妨げが増える。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Metabolic Instability"
msgstr "代謝不安定"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Metabolic Instability'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your body requires more resources than normal, burning calories and "
"requiring more food in exchange for warming you up more easily.  You can "
"also better tolerate mutant toxins."
msgstr "体はより多くの資源を必要とし、カロリーを消費して多くの食料を必要とする代わりに、体が温まりやすくなる。また変異毒素への耐性も高まる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Neural Degeneration"
msgstr "神経退化"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Neural Degeneration'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"You suffer from a form of artificially-induced atavism.  Reading is much "
"slower, and crafting is more difficult.  Persuading NPCs will be more "
"difficult, but threatening them will be easier."
msgstr ""
"人工的に引き起こされた先祖返りの一種に苦しんでいる。読書は大幅に遅くなり、製作もより困難になる。NPCの説得は難しくなるが、脅迫はしやすくなる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Neural Augmentation"
msgstr "神経強化"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Neural Augmentation'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your brain has been basically rewired to handle technical tasks more easily."
"  You can read much faster, and find it easier to craft.  However, this "
"increased activity makes you require much more sleep as well."
msgstr ""
"脳は技術的な作業をこなしやすくするよう、根本的に配線し直されている。読書は大幅に速くなり、製作も容易になる。ただし、この活動の増加により、睡眠も大幅に多く必要とする。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Pain Mitigation"
msgstr "疼痛緩和"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Pain Mitigation'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your body is conditioned to easily shrug off pain.  Any aches and pains you "
"accumulate will steadily fade away."
msgstr "体は痛みを容易に振り払うよう調整されている。蓄積した痛みは着実に薄れていく。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Unsteady Footwork"
msgstr "不安定な足運び"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Unsteady Footwork'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"It's far easier for someone of your stature to simply stand there and take "
"it.  Your movement across flat terrain and in water is 10% slower, your "
"movement in rough terrain is 30% slower, and you suffer a severe penalty to "
"dodging."
msgstr ""
"これほどの体格の持ち主には、その場に立って耐える方がはるかに楽だ。平坦な地形や水中での移動速度が10%低下し、荒れた地形では30%低下する上、回避に大きなペナルティを受ける。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Machine Empathy"
msgstr "機械への共感"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Machine Empathy'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Something they did to you seems to confound facial recognition software.  "
"Most of the haywire robots out there will be slower to identify you as a "
"threat."
msgstr "彼らが施した何らかの処置により、顔認識ソフトウェアが誤作動を起こすようだ。暴走したロボットの多くは、脅威として認識するのが遅くなる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Augmented Healing"
msgstr "強化治癒"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Augmented Healing'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your body recovers from injury much quicker than normal, especially when "
"you're awake and active."
msgstr "体は通常よりはるかに早く負傷から回復する。特に目覚めて活動している間は顕著だ。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Navigator"
msgstr "ナビゲーター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Navigator'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your mental conditioning makes it easier to handle the outdoors, and to find"
" your way.  Your sight radius on the overmap is increased, and you suffer "
"reduced wet penalties."
msgstr ""
"精神的な訓練により、野外での活動や道を見つけることが容易になっている。オーバーマップでの視界範囲が拡大し、濡れによるペナルティも軽減される。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Metabolic Stasis"
msgstr "代謝停滞"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Metabolic Stasis'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your body is tuned to operate at a much slower pace to conserve energy.  You"
" need less food, water, and sleep than normal people, but your stamina "
"regenerates much more slowly, and you heal slower too."
msgstr ""
"体はエネルギーを節約するため、はるかに遅いペースで動くよう調整されている。通常の人間より食料・水・睡眠を必要としないが、スタミナの回復ははるかに遅く、傷の治りも遅くなる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Hunter-Killer"
msgstr "ハンターキラー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hunter-Killer'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your reflexes and agility have been greatly augmented.  You move faster "
"overall, attack much faster, and can find it easier to dodge attacks.  "
"What's more, your instincts have been honed to make combat skills easier to "
"learn, and you find killing easier on the mind."
msgstr ""
"反射神経と敏捷性が大幅に強化されている。全体的な移動速度が上がり、攻撃も大幅に速くなり、攻撃を回避しやすくなる。さらに本能が研ぎ澄まされ、戦闘技能の習得が容易になり、殺しに対する精神的な抵抗も薄れている。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Cardioefficiency"
msgstr "心肺効率化"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Cardioefficiency'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"You find it easier than normal to recover from physical exertion, gaining "
"increased stamina regeneration."
msgstr "通常より肉体的疲労から回復しやすくなり、スタミナ回復量が増加する。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Subtlety"
msgstr "隠密"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Subtlety'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your innate conditioning makes it much easier to slip past undetected and "
"manipulate others.  You're harder to spot and your movement is more quiet, "
"plus it's much easier to persuade and lie to NPCs."
msgstr ""
"生まれ持った訓練により、気付かれずにすり抜けたり他者を操ったりすることがはるかに容易になっている。発見されにくく、移動音も静かになる上、NPCの説得や欺瞞もずっとしやすくなる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Unyielding Frame"
msgstr "不屈の体躯"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Unyielding Frame'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your durability and resilience are overall far beyond normal humans, and "
"your form is larger than a normal human.  You gain a flat +50 to all hit "
"points, +15% carry weight, plus your maximum stamina and stamina "
"regeneration is 30% higher than normal."
msgstr ""
"耐久力と回復力は総じて通常の人間をはるかに超えており、体格も通常の人間より大きい。全ての体力に一律+50、携行重量に+15%のボーナスを得る上、最大スタミナとスタミナ回復量も通常より30%高くなる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Vulnerable"
msgstr "脆弱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Vulnerable'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Your body is much less resilient overall. Your maximum HP is 50% lower than "
"normal, and you suffer increased phyiscal damage."
msgstr "体は全体的に通常よりはるかにもろい。最大HPは通常より50%低く、物理ダメージも受けやすくなる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "Survivor Combatives"
msgstr "生存者格闘術"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Survivor Combatives'}
#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Survivor Combatives'}'
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You learned how to handle yourself in the cataclysm.  Whether armed or "
"unarmed, you know how to use your wits to stay alive.  Survival is of the "
"highest priority."
msgstr "大変動の中で身の処し方を学んだ。武器の有無にかかわらず、知恵を使って生き延びる術を知っている。生存こそが最優先事項だ。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Bionic Combatives"
msgstr "バイオニック格闘術"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Bionic Combatives'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"You start with the Bionic Combatives style.  A modern combat style for the "
"post-modern human.  Nicknamed \"Biojutsu\", Bionic Combatives combines "
"integrated weaponry, armor and augments into an consolidated fighting "
"discipline."
msgstr ""
"バイオニック格闘術のスタイルを最初から習得している。ポストモダンの人類のための現代的な格闘スタイルだ。通称「バイオジュツ」と呼ばれるこのバイオニック格闘術は、内蔵武器・防具・拡張機能を一つの統合された格闘体系にまとめ上げたものだ。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "Post-Human Combatives"
msgstr "ポストヒューマン格闘術"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Post-Human Combatives'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"You start with the Post-Human Combatives style.  You've learned a number of "
"tricks to take advantage of the potential that abandoning your humanity can "
"offer.  Focused on heavy, powerful weapons or mutant limbs, a supernaturally"
" strong post-human can use their abilities to great effect."
msgstr ""
"ポストヒューマン格闘術のスタイルを最初から習得している。人間性を捨てることで得られる可能性を活かす、数々の技を身につけている。重く強力な武器や変異した四肢を軸とし、超人的な力を持つポストヒューマンはその能力を存分に発揮できる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Survivor Story"
msgstr "生存者の物語"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Survivor Story'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "This NPC could tell you about how they survived the Cataclysm"
msgstr "このNPCは、大変動をどう生き延びたかを語ってくれるかもしれない"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Gladiator"
msgstr "剣闘士"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Gladiator'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"You were kidnapped and forced into an underground blood sport, augmented and"
" forced to fight others like you for the amusement of wealthy clients.  You "
"may not be the only one lucky enough to have survived that without being "
"broken."
msgstr ""
"誘拐され、地下の見世物の殺し合いに強制的に参加させられた。肉体を強化され、裕福な客たちの娯楽のために同じ境遇の者たちと戦わされた。その経験を経ても壊れずに生き延びられた幸運な者は、自分だけではないかもしれない。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid "Prepper Holdout"
msgstr "プレッパーの立てこもり"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Prepper Holdout'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation.json
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you had been a member of a local community of like-"
"minded survivalists, occasionally meeting to discuss preparations and "
"contribute to preparing and stocking safehouses.  Now that the world's "
"ended, you might be able to count on any of your friends out there who are "
"still alive."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前、同じ志を持つサバイバリストたちの地域コミュニティに所属していた。時折集まっては備えについて話し合い、避難所の準備や備蓄に協力していた。世界が終わった今、生き残っている仲間の誰かを頼れるかもしれない。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Bio-Weapon mutagen_message
#. ~ Mutation class: Bio-Weapon iv_message
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_category.json
msgid "This is a bug, report to Noctifer if you see this."
msgstr "これはバグだ。見かけた場合はNoctiferに報告してほしい。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Bio-Weapon Male memorial messsage
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "All your enhancements came short of immortality."
msgstr "数々の強化をもってしても、不死には届かなかった。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Bio-Weapon Female memorial messsage
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "All your enhancements came short of immortality."
msgstr "数々の強化をもってしても、不死には届かなかった。"

#. ~ Description for Bio-Weapon
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_category.json
msgid ""
"You are not human.  You can't even remember anymore, whether you were ever "
"human to begin with.  What matters is that now, you are more than human."
msgstr "もはや人間ではない。そもそも人間であったことがあるのかどうかさえ、もう思い出せない。重要なのは、今や人間を超えた存在だということだ。"

#. ~ Mutation class name
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_category.json
msgid "Sentinel"
msgstr "センチネル"

#. ~ Mutation class: Sentinel mutagen_message
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_category.json
msgid "Seeing this is probably a bug."
msgstr "これが表示されているなら、恐らくバグだ。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Sentinel iv_message
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_category.json
msgid ""
"You're left reeling as the chemicals make your biology reach new heights."
msgstr "薬剤が生体を新たな高みへ押し上げ、めまいに襲われる。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Sentinel Male memorial messsage
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "You found your comrades and regrouped in hell."
msgstr "地獄で戦友たちと再会し、共に集結した。"

#. ~ Mutation class: Sentinel Female memorial messsage
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_category.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "You found your comrades and regrouped in hell."
msgstr "地獄で戦友たちと再会し、共に集結した。"

#. ~ Description for Sentinel
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_category.json
msgid ""
"You have transcended your humanity in both mind and body; your biology freed"
" from the shackles of living flesh.  Now a warrior with battle running "
"through your veins, you are what humanity would consider the next step in "
"evolution."
msgstr ""
"精神においても肉体においても、人としての限界を超えた。生体は生きた肉の枷から解き放たれている。今や血脈に戦いが流れる戦士となり、人類が次なる進化の段階と呼ぶべき存在となった。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Physicality I"
msgstr "センチネル体格I"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Physicality I'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Targeted mutagenic treatment has improved your muscular development.  Your "
"maximum stamina, stamina regeneration, and maximum weight carried is 25% "
"greater, and you heal slightly faster.  In exchange, your metabolism and "
"thirst is slightly increased, and your body runs a bit warm."
msgstr ""
"的を絞った変異原処置により、筋肉の発達が促進された。最大スタミナ、スタミナ回復速度、最大所持重量が25%増加し、回復もやや速くなる。その代償として、代謝と渇きがやや増加し、体温もわずかに高くなる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Physicality II"
msgstr "センチネル体格II"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Physicality II'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Targeted mutagenic treatment has improved your muscular development.  Your "
"maximum stamina, stamina regeneration, and maximum weight carried is 50% "
"greater, and you heal faster.  In exchange, your metabolism and thirst is "
"increased, and your body runs slightly hotter."
msgstr ""
"的を絞った変異原処置により、筋肉の発達が促進された。最大スタミナ、スタミナ回復速度、最大所持重量が50%増加し、回復も速くなる。その代償として、代謝と渇きが増加し、体温もやや高くなる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Physicality III"
msgstr "センチネル体格III"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Physicality III'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Targeted mutagenic treatment has improved your muscular development.  Your "
"maximum stamina, stamina regeneration, and maximum weight carried is "
"doubled, and you heal much faster.  In exchange, your metabolism and thirst "
"is further increased, and your body runs hotter."
msgstr ""
"的を絞った変異原処置により、筋肉の発達が促進された。最大スタミナ、スタミナ回復速度、最大所持重量が2倍になり、回復も大幅に速くなる。その代償として、代謝と渇きがさらに増加し、体温も高くなる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Strength I"
msgstr "センチネル筋力I"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Strength I'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Your strength has been increased slightly by your physical alterations, "
"relative to your natural physique.  Strength +2."
msgstr "身体的な改造により、地の体格に比して筋力がわずかに増加した。筋力+2。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Strength II"
msgstr "センチネル筋力II"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Strength II'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Your strength has been increased somewhat by your physical alterations, "
"relative to your natural physique.  Strength +4."
msgstr "身体的な改造により、地の体格に比して筋力がやや増加した。筋力+4。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Strength III"
msgstr "センチネル筋力III"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Strength III'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Your strength has been increased by your physical alterations, relative to "
"your natural physique.  Strength +6."
msgstr "身体的な改造により、地の体格に比して筋力が増加した。筋力+6。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Strength IV"
msgstr "センチネル筋力IV"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Strength IV'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Your strength has been greatly increased by your physical alterations, "
"relative to your natural physique.  Strength +8."
msgstr "身体的な改造により、地の体格に比して筋力が大幅に増加した。筋力+8。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Strength V"
msgstr "センチネル筋力V"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Strength V'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Your strength has been massively increased by your physical alterations, "
"relative to your natural physique.  Strength +10."
msgstr "身体的な改造により、地の体格に比して筋力が劇的に増加した。筋力+10。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Reflexes I"
msgstr "センチネル反射神経I"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Reflexes I'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Targeted mutagenic treatment has sharpened your reflexes.  You can move and "
"attack a bit faster, and your dodging is improved slightly.  In exchange, "
"you need slightly more rest than normal, and are slightly more sensitive to "
"electrical discharges."
msgstr ""
"的を絞った変異原処置により、反射神経が研ぎ澄まされた。移動と攻撃がやや速くなり、回避もわずかに向上する。その代償として、通常よりやや多くの休息が必要になり、放電に対してもやや過敏になる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Reflexes II"
msgstr "センチネル反射神経II"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Reflexes II'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Targeted mutagenic treatment has sharpened your reflexes.  You can move and "
"attack faster, and your dodging is improved.  In exchange, you need more "
"rest than normal, and are more sensitive to electrical discharges."
msgstr ""
"的を絞った変異原処置により、反射神経が研ぎ澄まされた。移動と攻撃が速くなり、回避も向上する。その代償として、通常より多くの休息が必要になり、放電に対しても過敏になる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Reflexes III"
msgstr "センチネル反射神経III"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Reflexes III'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Targeted mutagenic treatment has sharpened your reflexes.  You can move and "
"attack much faster, and your dodging is greatly improved.  In exchange, you "
"need much more rest than normal, and are much more sensitive to electrical "
"discharges."
msgstr ""
"的を絞った変異原処置により、反射神経が研ぎ澄まされた。移動と攻撃が大幅に速くなり、回避も大きく向上する。その代償として、通常よりはるかに多くの休息が必要になり、放電に対しても著しく過敏になる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Dexterity I"
msgstr "センチネル器用I"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Dexterity I'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Your dexterity has been increased slightly by your physical alterations, "
"relative to your natural agility.  Dexterity +2."
msgstr "身体的な改造により、地の敏捷性に比して器用がわずかに増加した。器用+2。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Dexterity II"
msgstr "センチネル器用II"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Dexterity II'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Your dexterity has been increased somewhat by your physical alterations, "
"relative to your natural agility.  Dexterity +4."
msgstr "身体的な改造により、地の敏捷性に比して器用がやや増加した。器用+4。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Dexterity III"
msgstr "センチネル器用III"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Dexterity III'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Your dexterity has been increased by your physical alterations, relative to "
