#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Synapse I"
msgstr "センチネルシナプスI"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Synapse I'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Targeted mutagenic treatment has altered your neurology.  You find it a bit "
"easier to handle the death of your enemies, combat skills develop somewhat "
"faster, and you find technical skills slightly easier.  In exchange, you "
"find learning from books a bit slower, and it is slightly harder to persuade"
" or deceive others."
msgstr ""
"的を絞った変異原処置により、神経系に変化が生じた。敵を殺めることへの抵抗がわずかに薄れ、戦闘技能の習得がやや速まり、技術系の技能もわずかに習得しやすくなる。その代償として、本からの学習がやや遅くなり、説得や欺きがわずかに難しくなる。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Synapse II"
msgstr "センチネルシナプスII"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Synapse II'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
