#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Conditioning: Physical"
msgstr "センチネル調整：身体"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Conditioning: Physical'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Your physical genetic conditioning has reached its peak, beyond all human "
"limits.  Your body is hardened against physical damage slightly and your "
"figure is more intimidating, but you've also developed an immunity to most "
"toxins, as well as depressant and painkilling drugs.  Your metabolism also "
"processes radioactive contaminants faster, and you recover from pain "
"quickly."
msgstr ""
"肉体面の遺伝子調整はその限界に達し、人間の限界を超えた。体はわずかに物理ダメージに対して硬化し、体格もより威圧的になったが、それだけでなくほとんどの毒物、さらには鎮静剤や鎮痛剤に対しても耐性を獲得している。代謝も放射性汚染物質をより速く処理するようになり、痛みからの回復も早い。"

#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid "Sentinel Conditioning: Mental"
msgstr "センチネル・コンディショニング：精神"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Conditioning: Mental'}
#: ./Mutations/c_bio_mutation_super_soldier.json
msgid ""
"Your mental genetic conditioning has reached its peak, beyond all human "
"limits.  You don't mind the rain as much and you need less sleep.  You've "
"also developed an immunity to various mind-altering and neurological "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"精神面の遺伝子調整はその限界に達し、人間の限界を超えた。雨もあまり気にならなくなり、必要な睡眠時間も短くなった。さらに、様々な精神作用物質や神経系への影響に対する耐性も獲得している。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BFF.json
msgid "What's up?  Whenever you feel like hitting the road, I'm with you."
msgstr "調子はどうだ？出発したくなったらいつでも言ってくれ、ついていくよ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BFF.json
msgid ""
"Holy shit man, you're still alive?!  I'm glad, I thought I was going to have"
" to deal with all this alone.  We've got shelter and supplies at least.  "
"Whenever you want to head out, I'll follow your lead."
msgstr ""
"マジかよ、まだ生きてたのか?!良かった、てっきりこの状況を一人で乗り切るしかないと思ってた。とりあえず避難所と物資はある。出発したくなったらいつでも言ってくれ、お前についていく。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BFF.json
msgid ""
"Holy shit girl, you're still alive?!  I'm glad, I thought I was going to "
"have to deal with all this alone.  We've got shelter and supplies at least."
"  Whenever you want to head out, I'll follow your lead."
msgstr ""
"マジかよ、まだ生きてたのか?!良かった、てっきりこの状況を一人で乗り切るしかないと思ってた。とりあえず避難所と物資はある。出発したくなったらいつでも言ってくれ、お前についていく。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BFF.json
msgid ""
"Greetings.  Damn, I was hoping to run into somebody else… at least we're "
"both still in one piece, I guess."
msgstr "よう。ちくしょう、他の誰かと会えることを願ってたんだが……とりあえずお互い無事なだけマシか。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BFF.json
msgid "Another survivor!  We should travel together."
msgstr "また生存者か！一緒に行動しよう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BFF.json
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "何してるんだ？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BFF.json
msgid "Care to trade?"
msgstr "交換しないか？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BFF.json
msgid "Sure, let's head out!"
msgstr "ああ、出発しよう！"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BFF.json
msgid "See you later."
msgstr "またな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "That thing you are wearing… a Bio-Weapon Badge…"
msgstr "お前が着けてるそれ……生物兵器バッジか……"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Hey you, are you also after the Bio-Weapons?"
msgstr "おい、お前も生物兵器を追ってるのか？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "[MISSION] Are you the one who triggered the security here?"
msgstr "[任務] ここの警備を作動させたのはお前か？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Yeah, I am one of them."
msgstr "ああ、俺もその一人だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Part of the Super Soldier project, actually."
msgstr "正確には、スーパーソルジャー計画の一員だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Bio-Weapon?"
msgstr "生物兵器？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "What's going on out here?"
msgstr "ここで何が起きてる？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "ここで何をしてる？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "What should we do?"
msgstr "どうすればいい？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Anything I can do for you?"
msgstr "何か手伝えることは？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid "Well, bye."
msgstr "じゃあな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"My friends and I were investigating this place to try and find some answers,"
" that could've done it I suppose.  Either that or those things outside that "
"attacked a while after we showed up.  Who sent you?"
msgstr ""
"仲間たちとここを調べて答えを探してたんだが、それが引き金になったのかもな。それか、俺たちが来てしばらくして襲ってきた外のあいつらのせいか。お前は誰の差し金だ？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I was asked to investigate a security breach by a scientist involved in "
"this."
msgstr "この件に関わってた研究者に頼まれて、警備システムの異常を調べに来た。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Well there's a surprise.  I was searching for exactly that, to see if anyone"
" was left that might know more about this project.  So they're not only "
"still around but have some help, based on the badge you're wearing.  I'd be "
"willing to assist them with intel if you'd let me tag along."
msgstr ""
"そりゃ驚いた。俺もまさにそれを探してたんだ、この計画について何か知ってる奴が残ってないかとな。そのバッジを見る限り、生き残ってるだけじゃなく助っ人までいるみたいだな。連れてってくれるなら、俺の情報で力になるぜ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I was searching for exactly that, to see if anyone was left that might know "
"more about this project.  Glad to hear they're still alive out there.  I'd "
"be willing to assist them with intel if you'd let me tag along."
msgstr ""
"俺もまさにそれを探してたんだ、この計画について何か知ってる奴が残ってないかとな。まだ生きてるって聞けて何よりだ。連れてってくれるなら、俺の情報で力になるぜ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Alright, I'll lead the way."
msgstr "よし、案内するぜ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "I'd like to ask you some other questions first."
msgstr "その前に、いくつか聞きたいことがある。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I'll follow along and hopefully working together will help "
"improve the situation."
msgstr "ありがとう。一緒に行くよ、協力すれば状況もマシになるはずだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "Let's go."
msgstr "行くぞ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Not good.  I had another person with me when I arrived, and he was guarding "
"the vehicle when those things showed up.  Luckily they seemed reluctant to "
"barge into the bunker, and things are getting hectic out there as it seems "
"my buddy took a couple of them out before he bit it, and they started "
"getting back up…"
msgstr ""
"まずいな。ここに来たときは連れがもう一人いて、あいつらが現れたとき車両を見張ってた。幸い奴らはこの地下壕には踏み込みたがらないらしいが、外は大変なことになってる……相棒は死ぬ前に何体か仕留めたみたいだが、そいつらがまた起き上がり始めてな……"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "What are those things?"
msgstr "あいつらは一体何なんだ？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "I see."
msgstr "そうか。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Those augmented abominations, the notes I found tied them to a thing called "
"the Bio-Weapon Project.  You look like you're in the same shape as them, "
"though you're not trying to kill me at least.  Can I trust you?"
msgstr ""
"あの改造された化け物ども、見つけたメモには生物兵器計画とかいう代物と結び付けられてた。お前も奴らと似たような体をしてるみたいだが、少なくとも俺を殺そうとはしてない。信用していいのか？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Bio-Weapons, that's what the notes in this lab called those things outside."
"  At least they were supposed to be.  I don't know what went wrong or who's "
"ordering them around, but they seem hell-bent on destroying everything "
"connected to the project."
msgstr ""
"生物兵器、この研究所のメモには外のあいつらがそう書かれてた。少なくとも、そういう建前だったんだろう。何がどう狂ったのか、誰が指図してるのかは知らないが、奴らはこの計画に関わるものを片っ端から潰そうとしてるらしい。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "I'm not one of them.  You can trust me."
msgstr "俺はあいつらの仲間じゃない。信用してくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I don't want to end up like those things.  I don't want to become a monster,"
" please…"
msgstr "あんな風にはなりたくない。化け物になんてなりたくない、頼むから……"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"It's alright.  I'm not going to hurt you.  I'll trust you, and you can trust"
" me as well."
msgstr "大丈夫だ。お前を傷つけたりしない。俺はお前を信じる、お前も俺を信じてくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "ありがとう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Well I'll be damned!  How do I know you didn't just find that somewhere?  Oh"
" well, it doesn't really matter. The fact that you have it means you at "
"least met one.  If you need anything, I can help you out."
msgstr ""
"こいつは驚いた！どこかで拾っただけじゃないってどう分かる？まあいい、大した問題じゃない。それを持ってるってことは、少なくとも一人には会ったってことだ。何か必要なら、力になるぜ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Suuuure, right.  You don't even have the badge.  Try and be careful who you "
"lie to next time."
msgstr "はいはい、そうかよ。そもそもバッジすら持ってないじゃないか。今度嘘をつく相手はちゃんと選ぶんだな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I can prove it.  If I can recall… Project Mesektet, First Series, external "
"designation RD-Z-01."
msgstr "証明できる。確か……メセケト計画、第一シリーズ、外部指定名RD-Z-01。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Look at me again, and tell me I'm lying."
msgstr "もう一度俺を見て、それでも嘘だと言えるか？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "I'm not wearing mine."
msgstr "俺は着けてない。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "…"
msgstr "……"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Is that so?  How do I know for sure you aren't just some random scavenger?  "
"Then again, if you made it here then you can take care of yourself, guess "
"that's a good sign."
msgstr ""
"そうか？ただの漁り屋じゃないって、どう確かめりゃいい？とはいえ、ここまで来られたってことは、自分の身くらい守れるってことだ。悪くない兆候かもな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "You don't recognize this aug configuration, Hunter?"
msgstr "この拡張構成に見覚えはないか、ハンター？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Good enough, I suppose."
msgstr "まあ十分だろうな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Project… you're right.  Between that and your augmentations, it's hard to "
"deny the evidence right in front of me.  Sorry I doubted you."
msgstr "計画……たしかにそうだ。それとその拡張を見りゃ、目の前の証拠を否定するのは難しいな。疑って悪かった。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "It's fine."
msgstr "気にするな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Alright, you're right.  Looks like they really did a number on you.  I'm "
"sorry they did this to you."
msgstr "分かった、その通りだ。奴らにひどい目に遭わされたみたいだな。すまない、こんなことをされて。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Shit.  Seems it's harder to hide than I thought.  They sent me to "
"investigate what happened to these installations, re-establish contact with "
"any remaining personnel or bio-weapons that haven't gone rogue, then see "
"what can be done from there.  I don't know what your last orders were or why"
" you're here, but maybe we have a common goal."
msgstr ""
"くそ、思ってたより隠し通すのは難しいみたいだな。俺はこの施設に何が起きたのか調べて、まだ暴走していない職員や生物兵器と連絡を取り直し、それからどうするか考えろって送り込まれたんだ。お前の最後の命令が何だったのか、ここで何をしてるのかは知らないが、目的は同じかもしれないな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "We'll see."
msgstr "さあ、どうかな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I'd say you're full of shit, but looking at you, those are some heavy-duty "
"augs.  I don't know if you decided not to wear it, or if you lost yours, but"
" either way I appreciate your honesty."
msgstr ""
"デタラメ言ってるって言いたいところだが、その拡張を見りゃ本格的なもんだ。着けないことにしたのか、無くしたのかは知らないが、どっちにしろ正直に話してくれたのはありがたい。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"You're kidding, right?  You really don't know?  Is that badge actually "
"yours…? Maybe that mindwipe rumor was true after all…"
msgstr "冗談だろ？本当に知らないのか？そのバッジ、本当にお前のものなのか……？あの記憶消去の噂、本当だったのかもな……"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"So you don't know about them, huh?  Maybe I'm wasting my time… but you did "
"find this place, so you probably know what you're doing."
msgstr ""
"つまり奴らのことを知らないってわけか。時間の無駄かもしれないが……まあ、ここを見つけたんだ、自分が何をしてるかくらいは分かってるんだろうな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Could you explain it to me?"
msgstr "説明してくれないか？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Whatever it is, I really don't care."
msgstr "何であろうと、正直どうでもいい。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I guess memory wipe makes sense.  Alright, I will explain.  Some time ago, "
"the military launched a joint research project with an end goal of creating "
"artificial combatants, made to perform various specific tasks - basically, "
"living weapons.  They wanted them to be as low-maintenance as possible.  So "
"to accomplish that, the research team used resources from already ongoing "
"projects to first mutate and then cybernetically enhance humans, focusing on"
" developing whatever qualities the military needed at the time.  You are one"
" them, a Bio-Weapon they called it.  This is the lab where you were created."
msgstr ""
"記憶消去ってのも納得だな。よし、説明してやる。少し前、軍はある共同研究計画を立ち上げた。目的は人工の戦闘員を作ること――特定の任務をこなすための、要するに生きた兵器だ。できるだけ手間のかからないものにしたかったらしい。それを実現するため、研究チームはすでに進んでいた他の計画のリソースを使い、まず人間を変異させ、それからサイボーグ化した。その時々で軍が必要としてた性質を重点的に伸ばしてな。お前はその一人だ、連中が生物兵器と呼んだやつだよ。ここはお前が作られた研究所だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Let me give you the basics.  Some time ago, the military launched a joint "
"research project with an end goal of creating artificial combatants, made to"
" perform various specific tasks - basically, living weapons.  They wanted "
"them to be as low-maintenance as possible.  So to accomplish that, the "
"research team used resources from already ongoing projects to first mutate "
"and then cybernetically enhance humans, focusing on developing whatever "
"qualities the military needed at the time.  This lab is one of several "
"places in which the actual modifications were performed."
msgstr ""
"基本だけ教えてやる。少し前、軍はある共同研究計画を立ち上げた。目的は人工の戦闘員を作ること――特定の任務をこなすための、要するに生きた兵器だ。できるだけ手間のかからないものにしたかったらしい。それを実現するため、研究チームはすでに進んでいた他の計画のリソースを使い、まず人間を変異させ、それからサイボーグ化した。その時々で軍が必要としてた性質を重点的に伸ばしてな。この研究所は、実際に改造が行われた施設のひとつだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "I'll be damned…"
msgstr "こいつは驚いたな……"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "How did you learn all this?"
msgstr "それ全部、どうやって知ったんだ？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I was under orders to investigate this place and find any survivors.  "
"Between that and having been a computer hacker during my college days, it "
"wasn't too hard to follow the trail.  The hard part was scavenging supplies "
"and staying alive."
msgstr ""
"この場所を調査して生存者を探せって命令されてたんだ。それに大学時代はコンピューターハッカーをやってたから、痕跡を追うのはそう難しくなかった。大変だったのは物資を漁って生き延びることの方だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I used to be a computer hacker before the world went to hell.  After it did,"
" when I wasn't looking for food and gear or fighting for my life, I was "
"following leads to this place.  The military weren't all that good at "
"keeping their secrets."
msgstr ""
"世界がこんなことになる前は、コンピューターハッカーをやってた。こうなってからは、食料や装備を探したり、生き延びるために戦ったりしてない時は、ここへの手がかりを追ってたんだ。軍は秘密を守るのがそんなに得意じゃなかったらしいな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "You seem rather well-equipped for a mere hacker."
msgstr "ただのハッカーにしちゃ、ずいぶん装備がいいな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Right.  Research Directive Z-12 ring a bell to you, Hunter?"
msgstr "そうだ。研究指令Z-12、聞き覚えはあるか、ハンター？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"You're right.  I'd rather not talk too much about the details, but I'm on a "
"mission to find out what happened and get in touch with anyone still alive."
msgstr "その通りだ。詳しい話はあまりしたくないが、何が起きたのかを突き止めて、生き残ってる奴らと連絡を取るのが俺の任務だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "分かった。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Scavenged the kit along the way.  I wouldn't still be alive if I wasn't both"
" resourceful and lucky.  I'd rather not talk about what I've had to go "
"through to survive, at least not right now.  Okay?"
msgstr "道中で装備を漁ってきたんだ。要領が良くて運も良くなきゃ、とっくに死んでる。生き延びるために何をやってきたかは、今は話したくない。いいか？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "Okay…"
msgstr "分かった……"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"You already asked me about it not that long ago.  I'd really prefer not to "
"discuss it."
msgstr "その話はついさっき聞いただろ。本当に話したくないんだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Figures.  You're either a fake or just don't care about what you are.  "
"Still, you must be pretty capable to make it here."
msgstr "だろうな。偽者か、自分が何なのか気にしてないかのどっちかだ。それでもここまで来られたんだから、それなりの腕はあるんだろう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Well, then what are you doing here?  Did you stumble into this place by "
"accident?  You still seem to handle yourself pretty well."
msgstr "じゃあ、ここで何をしてるんだ？偶然迷い込んだのか？それにしちゃ、自分の身の振り方は心得てるみたいだが。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "I guess you are right."
msgstr "たしかにその通りだな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I came here to see if I could find anything on the research they were doing "
"here.  How about yourself?"
msgstr "ここで行われてた研究について、何か手がかりがないか探しに来た。お前はどうなんだ？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I don't have any orders, and don't remember much from before I woke up.  Had"
" anything in mind?"
msgstr "命令なんて何もない、目覚める前のことも大して覚えてないんだ。何か考えでもあるのか？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Sounds like a good start, don't have any other standing orders to follow.  "
"What have you got for me?"
msgstr "悪くない出だしだな、他に従うべき命令もないし。何を持ってきてくれた？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "I don't know what to do with myself.  What do you need done?"
msgstr "自分でも何をすればいいのか分からない。何をすればいい？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "I have no idea."
msgstr "見当もつかない。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"Now that you've told me where to look, we should probably get out of this "
"place and get going soon.  Search the area if you need any supplies or gear,"
" but be careful.  Might still be some of the things that attacked us nearby."
msgstr ""
"どこを探せばいいか教えてもらったし、そろそろここを出て動き出した方が良さそうだ。物資や装備が要るなら周りを探しとけ、ただし気をつけろよ。俺たちを襲ってきたあいつらが、まだ近くにいるかもしれない。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid ""
"I'm trying to reach a hideout built by former scientists who worked on the "
"Bio-Weapon Project.  Rumor has it they live somewhere in the woods.  Maybe "
"you could help me find it…"
msgstr ""
"生物兵器計画に関わってた元研究者たちが作った隠れ家に向かおうとしてるんだ。森のどこかに住んでるって噂がある。見つけるのを手伝ってくれないか……"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BHUNTER.json
msgid "We'll see then."
msgstr "そのときになったら分かるさ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "I really hope that badge belongs to you…"
msgstr "そのバッジが、本当にお前のものであることを願う……"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "Hey visitor, anything exciting out there?"
msgstr "よう、来訪者。外で何か面白いことでもあったか？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid "It says you're a Bio-Weapon?"
msgstr "それによれば、お前は生物兵器なのか？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "Kinda boring here huh?"
msgstr "ここは退屈だろう？"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"[MISSION] Router suggested that I talk to you about joining the hunt for "
"Apophis."
msgstr "[任務] ルーターから、アポフィス狩りに加わる件でお前と話すよう言われた。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "How are you holding up?  Router asked that I check on you."
msgstr "調子はどうだ？ルーターに、お前の様子を見てくるよう言われた。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, same augmentation project your badge labels you as, assuming that "
"belongs to you.  Router found me passed out and told me about everything.  I"
" don't remember anything before that.  Guess I just have to trust him for "
"now."
msgstr ""
"ああ、そのバッジが本当にお前のものなら、同じ拡張計画の出だ。ルーターが気を失ってる俺を見つけて、何もかも教えてくれた。それより前のことは何も覚えていない。今のところは、あいつを信じるしかないんだろうな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"That's what the label says, it's a sorta augmentation project.  You seem to "
"know your stuff, guess one doesn't simply find this place by accident.  "
"Router told me what I am.  I am stuck here until further notice."
msgstr ""
"ラベルにはそう書いてある。ある種の強化計画ってやつだ。詳しそうだな、偶然この場所に辿り着いたわけじゃなさそうだ。俺が何なのかは、ルーターが教えてくれた。当分はここに足止めだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "I'm in the same boat, it seems."
msgstr "どうやら俺も似たようなもんだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "I'm one of the super soldiers, in fact."
msgstr "実を言うと、俺はスーパーソルジャーの一人だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid "Well, damn."
msgstr "うわ、マジかよ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Looks about right.  Can be hard to tell for sure if that's your badge or "
"not, but they contracted the work out to all sorts of weirdos, and they made"
" all sorts of crazy shit.  They could slap the Bio-Weapon label on a zombie "
"swinging around a sword and it still wouldn't be the strangest thing out "
"there."
msgstr ""
"妥当なとこだろうな。それが本当にお前のバッジかどうかは判じ難いが、奴らはありとあらゆる変わり者に仕事を委託して、とんでもない代物を量産してた。ゾンビが剣を振り回してるのに生物兵器のラベルを貼ったって、そう驚くようなことでもない。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm not sure whether to believe you or not, without the badge and all.  But "
"whatever, no telling whether you lost yours or maybe you decided on not "
"advertising it for everyone to see.  Given those bastards cranked out "
"everything from super soldiers to a giant cat Bio-Weapon to fucking Apophis,"
" nothing would surprise me at this point."
msgstr ""
"バッジもないのに信じていいものかね。まあいい、失くしたのか、それとも人目につかせたくないだけなのか知らんが。あのクソ野郎どもはスーパーソルジャーからでかい猫の生物兵器、果てはあのアポフィスまで量産してたんだ。今更何が出てきても驚きゃしない。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Heh, they started passing out the badges to you kids too?  I'm guessing you "
"got your hands on it the hard way, from one of the bastards hunting us down."
"  We're in the same boat, like it or not."
msgstr ""
"へっ、お前みたいなガキにまでバッジを配り始めたのか。どうせ俺たちを狩ってる奴らの誰かから、力ずくで奪い取ったんだろうよ。好むと好まざるとにかかわらず、俺たちは同じ穴の狢だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"If that's true, pleasant surprise to see another of you stopping by.  I'm "
"willing to bet Router needs all the help he can get, might be useful working"
" together.  We'll see, I guess…"
msgstr ""
"それが本当なら、お前みたいなのに出くわすとは嬉しい誤算だ。ルーターは猫の手も借りたいはずだ、力を合わせりゃ役に立つだろう。まあ、様子を見てみるさ…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Well I'll be damned.  At this rate I was starting to think we'd just wait "
"for that thing to come find us.  And with one of ours leading the charge, "
"even.  Assuming you've earned that badge, at least.  I'm with you."
msgstr ""
"こいつは驚いた。このままじゃ、あいつが向こうから見つけに来るのを待つだけになると思い始めてたところだ。しかも先陣を切るのは仲間の一人ときた。そのバッジを本当に勝ち取ったんならの話だがな。俺も乗った。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, I was starting to think I'd never get to join the hunt.  If you've got"
" what it takes, we might come out of it in one piece.  I'm with you."
msgstr ""
"俺は、この狩りに加われる日など来ないんじゃないかと思い始めてたところだ。お前にその器があるなら、無事に生き延びられるかもしれん。俺も乗った。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid "Let's go, then."
msgstr "なら、行くか。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Tell me about it.  I am a weapon, made to kill and destroy.  I'm stuck here,"
" nothing left to kill or destroy.  Wish there was something I could do…"
msgstr "分かるとも。俺は殺し、破壊するために作られた兵器だ。だがここに縛られて、殺すものも壊すものもない。何かできることがあればいいんだが…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Tell me about it.  I am a weapon, made to kill and destroy.  I am stuck "
"here, hiding from something I can't kill or destroy.  Wish there was "
"something I could do…"
msgstr ""
"分かるとも。俺は殺し、破壊するために作られた兵器だ。だがここに縛られて、殺すことも壊すこともできない何かから隠れている。何かできることがあればいいんだが…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "Must be tough…"
msgstr "大変だな…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Router gets worried about stuff too easily.  He's like an overprotective "
"parent.  Though I guess he sorta IS that, since he was the project lead for "
"our batch.  Aside from dying of boredom, I think I'll be alright."
msgstr ""
"ルーターはすぐ心配性になる。過保護な親みたいなもんだ。まあ、俺たちのバッチの計画責任者だったんだから、ある意味それも当然か。退屈死しそうなこと以外は、たぶん大丈夫だろうよ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Could be out there doing what we do best.  What do you say?  It's what we "
"were made for."
msgstr "外に出て、俺たちの得意分野をやってもいいんじゃないか。どうだ?俺たちはそのために作られたんだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"If a bionic reject like me can find a purpose out there, so can you.  How "
"about it?"
msgstr "俺みたいなバイオニックの出来損ないでも外で目的を見つけられたんだ、お前にもできるはずだ。どうだ?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"I wouldn't mind having one of the original models fighting alongside me."
msgstr "オリジナルモデルの一人が一緒に戦ってくれるなら、悪くない話だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "Why not join me?"
msgstr "俺と組まないか?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"You know, I like the sound of that.  This is what we were made for.  Lead "
"the way."
msgstr "ああ、悪くない話だ。俺たちはそのために作られたんだからな。案内してくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Heh, badge or no badge, I can tell in your voice you're one of them.  Just "
"like me.  Got that same fighting spirit too.  Alright, take the lead."
msgstr "へっ、バッジがあろうがなかろうが、声を聞きゃ分かる。お前も奴らの一人だ。俺と同じでな。その闘志も本物だ。よし、先に立ってくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"What, like going out there, killing zombies, protecting the innocent?  Is "
"that what the sappy motivational speech is for?  Well, reject or not, I see "
"that same fire in your eye that any bio-weapon has.  I think you've got a "
"point.  Let's see where this goes."
msgstr ""
"何だ、外に出てゾンビを殺して、罪のない連中を守れってことか?その安っぽい激励はそのためか。まあ、出来損ないだろうが何だろうが、お前の目には生物兵器と同じ炎が見える。一理あるな。どうなるか見てみるとしよう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Eh?  Wait, I get it now.  So that's what you're on about.  I would've "
"mistaken you for just some civilian cyberjunkie, but you're one of us.  And "
"you just might have a point.  We'll see how it goes."
msgstr ""
"あ?待て、分かったぞ。そういうことか。てっきりただのサイバー中毒の一般人かと思ってたが、お前も俺たちの仲間だ。それに一理あるかもしれん。どうなるか見てみよう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"One of the diluted batches, right?  No mutagenic package, probably recruited"
" from the army kids assigned to guard the labs… still one of us, close "
"enough at least.  You want the real deal, then so be it.  I'll follow your "
"lead."
msgstr ""
"薄められたバッチの一人ってところか?変異原パッケージなし、おおかた研究所警備に回された軍のガキから徴用されたクチだろう…それでも俺たちの仲間には違いない、まあ似たようなもんだ。お前が本物を望むなら、それでいい。ついて行こう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"Sure, why not.  I have nothing better to do anyway, and if I'm lucky I can "
"trust you not to get us both killed."
msgstr "ああ、構わんさ。どうせ他にやることもない。運が良けりゃ、二人揃って死なずに済むと信じられるだろうしな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid "I'm not so sure that'd be the best way to put my skills to use…"
msgstr "それが俺の力を活かす一番の方法とは思えんが…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_1.json
msgid ""
"You just asked me not that long ago.  I'd rather not deal with this at the "
"moment."
msgstr "さっき聞かれたばかりだろう。今はそういう話は勘弁してくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "What's with the badge?  A Bio-Weapon, it says?"
msgstr "そのバッジは何だ?生物兵器と書いてあるが?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"Military augmentation project, same people handing out the badge you're "
"wearing.  Guessing you know enough about it if you have one yourself.  Don't"
" remember much up until Router found me and took me in, same deal as Sigma."
msgstr ""
"軍の強化計画だ、お前が着けてるバッジを配ってたのと同じ連中さ。自分でそれを持ってるなら、大体のことは知ってるんだろう。ルーターに見つけられて引き取られるまでのことは、あまり覚えちゃいない。シグマと同じだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"A military augmentation project.  Not that sort of bio-weapon if that's what"
" you're thinking, it's not contagious.  More like we're living weapons "
"basically.  Guess you already know a bit for you to have made it here.  Not "
"much else I can tell you, just stuck here waiting."
msgstr ""
"軍の強化計画だ。お前が思ってるような生物兵器じゃない、伝染するようなもんじゃないんでな。基本的には、俺たちは生きた兵器みたいなもんだ。ここまで来られたんなら、もう少しは知ってるんだろう。他に話せることはあまりない、ただここで待たされてるだけだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "I see…"
msgstr "そうか…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "Guess that explains where you got the badge."
msgstr "それでそのバッジを手に入れたわけか。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"I'm not sure whether to believe you or not, without the badge and all.  But "
"whatever, no telling whether you lost yours or maybe you decided on not "
"advertising it for everyone to see.  Given those bastards cranked out "
"everything from super soldiers to a giant cat Bio-Weapon to fucking Apophis,"
" nothing would suprise me at this point."
msgstr ""
"バッジもないのに信じていいものかね。まあいい、失くしたのか、それとも人目につかせたくないだけなのか知らんが。あのクソ野郎どもはスーパーソルジャーからでかい猫の生物兵器、果てはあのアポフィスまで量産してたんだ。今更何が出てきても驚きゃしない。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"Guess would explain your presence here.  We'll see if you turn out useful "
"like the other two who survived the trip, or if you'll end up stuck sitting "
"around with nothing to do like I've been."
msgstr ""
"それでここにいる理由も分かるってもんだ。あの旅を生き延びた他の二人みたいに役に立つのか、それとも俺みたいに何もせずここで燻ることになるのか、見てみるとしよう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"It's about time someone made a move on that beast.  It'll be a pleasure to "
"join the fight.  Lead on!"
msgstr "そろそろあの化け物に手を出す奴が出てきてもいい頃だ。喜んで戦いに加わろう。先導してくれ!"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "Heh.  Sure hope you know what you're doing.  Lead on…"
msgstr "へっ。分かってやってるんだろうな。先導してくれ…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "Alright, let's go."
msgstr "よし、行くぞ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"Tell me about it.  I am a weapon, made to kill and destroy. I am stuck here,"
" nothing left to kill or destroy.  Wish there was something I could do…"
msgstr "分かるとも。俺は殺し、破壊するために作られた兵器だ。だがここに縛られて、殺すものも壊すものもない。何かできることがあればいいんだが…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"Tell me about it.  I am a weapon, made to kill and destroy. I am stuck here,"
" hiding from something I can't kill or destroy.  Wish there was something I "
"could do…"
msgstr ""
"分かるとも。俺は殺し、破壊するために作られた兵器だ。だがここに縛られて、殺すことも壊すこともできない何かから隠れている。何かできることがあればいいんだが…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"I appreciate the thought, but there's not much to say.  Things are stable at"
" least, if a bit boring.  I'd like to find some way to put my skills to good"
" use, but I'm not sure what."
msgstr ""
"気にかけてくれてありがたいが、大して話すこともない。少なくとも安定はしてる、退屈ではあるがな。自分の力を何かに活かせればいいんだが、それが何なのか分からずにいる。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"We're Bio-Weapons.  We're meant to be out there, kicking ass, taking names, "
"and saving the world.  Why not come along and do exactly that?"
msgstr "俺たちは生物兵器だ。外に出て暴れ回り、名を上げて、世界を救ってこそ本分ってもんだろう。一緒に来て、まさにそれをやらないか?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"I found a purpose out there, bionic reject or not.  It'd be better than "
"doing nothing… if you want to come with?"
msgstr "出来損ないだろうが何だろうが、俺は外で目的を見つけた。何もしないよりはマシだろう…お前も来るか?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"You're one of the original models.  Wouldn't mind having you on the team."
msgstr "お前はオリジナルモデルの一人だ。チームに加わってくれるなら悪くない。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"That's the fucking spirit!  You're making me want to go out there and save "
"the world or some over-the-top bullshit like that.  You've got yourself a "
"deal."
msgstr "その意気だ!お前のせいで、外に出て世界を救うだの何だのクソ大げさなことをやりたくなってきたぞ。よし、乗った。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"Those are words you don't hear from just any random punk.  Makes me feel "
"like this planet isn't quite circling the drain just yet.  Fuck it, why not?"
"  I'm ready if you are."
msgstr ""
"そんな台詞、そこらのならず者からは聞けやしない。まだこの星もどん底ってわけじゃないと思えてくるな。ええい、いいだろう。お前がその気なら俺もいつでもいいぞ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"Hey, you don't have to beat yourself up over it.  And don't give me the "
"puppy-dog eyes either.  I wouldn't mind finding something constructive to "
"do… when you're ready, I guess."
msgstr ""
"おい、そう自分を責めなくていい。それに、そんな捨てられた子犬みたいな目で見るな。何か建設的なことを見つけるのも悪くない…お前の準備ができたらでいいさ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"Guessing you're a bio-weapon too.  Badge or not, \"reject\" or not.  Don't "
"beat yourself up over it.  I suppose you're suggesting I tag along, and to "
"be honest I might as well.  Lead the way."
msgstr ""
"お前も生物兵器ってわけか。バッジがあろうがなかろうが、「出来損ない」だろうがなんだろうが。自分を責めるな。俺についてこいって言いたいんだろう、正直なところ、それも悪くない。案内してくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"Original model?  I'm not sure if I should take that as a compliment or not."
"  I guess it'd be better than doing nothing and wasting time here.  Ready "
"when you are."
msgstr ""
"オリジナルモデルだと?褒められてるのかどうか分からんな。まあ、ここで何もせず時間を無駄にするよりはマシだろう。お前の準備ができ次第、いつでもいいぞ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid ""
"You've got guts, suggesting I follow along just out of boredom.  You seem "
"competent enough at least, so why not… lead on!"
msgstr "退屈だからってだけで俺についてこいと言うとは、大した度胸だ。まあ腕は立ちそうだし、いいだろう…先導しろ!"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "Yeah, I don't think so."
msgstr "いや、遠慮しとく。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_BIO_2.json
msgid "You just asked me that."
msgstr "さっき聞かれたばかりだろう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid "Heh, another one caught in this mess, huh?"
msgstr "へっ、またこの騒動に巻き込まれた一人か。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid "Hey.  Anything I can help you with, visitor?"
msgstr "よう。何か用か、訪問者?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr "ここは何だ?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json
msgid "Can I have some directions?"
msgstr "道案内してくれるか?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json
msgid "How are things here?"
msgstr "ここの様子はどうだ?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Can I stay here?"
msgstr "ここに留まってもいいか?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid ""
"It's a refuge, made for the Bio-Weapon research team.  I happened to be one "
"of the guards of the project.  It turned into a mess real quick.  Only one "
"of the original scientists is still here."
msgstr ""
"生物兵器の研究チームのために作られた避難所だ。俺はたまたまこの計画の警備の一人だった。あっという間にひどいことになったよ。元々の科学者で今も残ってるのは一人だけだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid "Bio-weapons?"
msgstr "生物兵器?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid ""
"Sure!  This is the recreation room and lobby, and the kitchen is next to it."
"  Down there is the main hallway.  First door on the left is the dormitory, "
"the Bio-Weapons are usually there.  Across from that is just a bunch of junk"
" metal.  Down the hall you have the restroom on the right, then the research"
" room on the left.  Our leader, Router, is there.  He can be a weirdo but he"
" keeps us safe.  Go talk to people if you need anything."
msgstr ""
"もちろんだ。ここが娯楽室兼ロビーで、隣が台所だ。あっちがメインの廊下になっている。左側の最初のドアが寮で、たいてい生物兵器たちはそこにいる。その向かいはただのスクラップの山だ。廊下を進むと右手に便所、左手に研究室がある。俺たちのリーダー、ルーターはそこにいる。変わり者だが、俺たちを守ってくれている。何か必要なら誰かに話しかけてくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid "Will do."
msgstr "そうする。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid ""
"Thought you'd know from the badge you're wearing.  They've got augs like I "
"do, but also some mutations and other changes to make them perform better as"
" soldiers.  Living weapons, basically.  Whatever you ran into out there, "
"don't worry.  We're all on the same side here, for all their enhancements "
"they act more like two bored teenagers than military experiments."
msgstr ""
"そのバッジを着けてるんだから知ってるかと思ったが。奴らは俺と同じ強化手術に加えて、兵士としての性能を上げるための変異やらなんやらも施されてる。要は生きた兵器だ。外で何に出くわしたか知らんが、心配するな。ここでは俺たちみんな同じ側だ。あれだけ強化されてても、軍事実験というより退屈した十代のガキ二人って感じだけどな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid ""
"Living weapons in a sense, but they're still as human as you or me.  All "
"cyborged up and injected full of mutagenic treatments, doc says they lost a "
"lot of their memories but they don't really act too much like the killing "
"machines those eggheads wanted…"
msgstr ""
"ある意味生きた兵器だが、それでもお前や俺と同じ人間には違いない。サイボーグ化されて変異原の処置を打ち込まれまくって、記憶の大半を失ったと先生は言ってたが、あの学者どもが望んだような殺人マシーンって感じにはあまり見えないな…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid ""
"Can't complain.  We are safe, have food, water, and weapons.  Router keeps "
"working on something he says is important.  Life isn't bad."
msgstr "文句は言えないな。安全だし、食料も水も武器もある。ルーターは何か重要だってものにずっと取り組んでる。生活は悪くない。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid "Good to hear."
msgstr "何よりだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json
msgid "It's not really up to me.  Go ask Router what he thinks."
msgstr "俺が決めることじゃない。ルーターに聞いてみてくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD1.json ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "ありがとう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json
msgid "Hello there, hotshot, try not to break anything, ok?"
msgstr "よう、やり手さん。何も壊さないでくれよ、いいな?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json
msgid "Welcome.  Try not to cause any trouble and things will be just fine."
msgstr "ようこそ。面倒を起こさなければ、万事うまくいく。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Bye."
msgstr "またな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json
msgid ""
"Used to be an old lab bunker.  We had the lower level gutted and remodeled "
"to make it livable.  Better than nothing at least."
msgstr "元は古い研究施設の地下壕だった。下層を解体して改装し、住めるようにしたんだ。何もないよりはマシだろう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json
msgid ""
"You want the grand tour, ask the guard that's usually lounging around in the"
" rec room, downstairs.  My duty's up here, and there's not much to see "
"topside.  Just some fields tilled and a shed for storage.  All the "
"interesting stuff is downstairs."
msgstr ""
"案内が欲しいなら、いつも下の娯楽室でくつろいでる警備に聞いてくれ。俺の持ち場はここで、地上には大して見るものもない。耕した畑と物置小屋くらいだ。面白いものは全部地下にある。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Oh, okay."
msgstr "ああ、分かった。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json
msgid ""
"Good enough.  Stand here, keep an eye on things, sometimes take potshots at "
"anything that shambles up to the fence.  At least it isn't as boring when "
"that happens."
msgstr "まあまあだな。ここに立って周りを見張って、たまにフェンスまでよろめいてきた奴に一発かます。そういうことがあるだけ、まだ退屈しのぎになる。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json
msgid "Alright."
msgstr "了解。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json
msgid "Go ask Router.  He's down below with the others."
msgstr "ルーターに聞いてくれ。下で他の連中と一緒にいる。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_CGUARD2.json
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "分かった。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Huh, where'd the guard go…"
msgstr "おい、看守はどこ行った…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Grab a weapon, we might have a chance to bust out of here."
msgstr "武器を取れ、ここから抜け出せるかもしれねえぞ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Not a good time for this, fresh meat.  What's wrong?"
msgstr "今はそれどころじゃねえ、新入り。どうした?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "You sure we have time to talk?  What is it?"
msgstr "話してる暇なんかあるのか?何だ?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "I don't know what's going on, but we might be able to get out of here."
msgstr "何が起きてるのかわからねえが、ここから出られるかもしれねえ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "I don't know what you're here for, but you've got good timing."
msgstr "お前が何しに来たのか知らねえが、いいタイミングだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Hey you!  You've got to help us, please…"
msgstr "おい、お前!頼む、俺たちを助けてくれ…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"You're not one of the guards, don't look like one of their so-called clients"
" either.  What are you here for?"
msgstr "お前は看守じゃねえし、奴らの言う『客』にも見えねえ。何しに来た?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Hey, you're not one of them …can you help us?"
msgstr "おい、お前は奴らの仲間じゃねえな…助けてくれるか?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "You've got to get us out of here!"
msgstr "俺たちをここから出してくれ!"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr "何が起きてる?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Why are the others attacking us?"
msgstr "なんで他の連中が俺たちを襲ってくる?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Follow my lead, I'll get us out of here."
msgstr "俺について来い、ここから出してやる。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "I'll help get you out of here."
msgstr "ここから出す手伝いをしてやる。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"Guard set the cells to unlock themselves and left.  Something's going on, "
"and we might be able to escape."
msgstr "看守が独房を自動解錠に設定して出てった。何かが起きてる、逃げられるかもしれねえ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"Fucking riot or something, bastards cut both cell blocks loose.  If we don't"
" get eaten alive by the others we might be able to escape."
msgstr "暴動か何かだ、くそったれどもが両方の監房棟を解き放ちやがった。他の連中に喰い殺されなきゃ、逃げられるかもしれねえ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"I'm not sure, but what matters is the fact they let the other animals out "
"too."
msgstr "よくわからねえが、重要なのは奴らが他の『獣』どもも放したってことだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"We've been stuck down here for months fighting for the amusement of a bunch "
"of sick fucks.  Guard running the place remotely unlocked all of our cells "
"and abandoned us."
msgstr ""
"俺たちはここに何か月も閉じ込められて、イカれた野郎どもの娯楽のために戦わされてきた。この場所を遠隔で仕切ってた看守が、独房を全部解錠して俺たちを見捨てやがった。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"I don't know.  We've been stuck down here for so long, but if we can get out"
" …maybe you help us?"
msgstr "わからねえ。ずっとここに閉じ込められてきた、でももし出られるなら…助けてくれるか?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"Are you with the police?  Please, they've had us trapped down here for their"
" fucking pit fights."
msgstr "警察の人間か?頼む、奴らはくそったれの見世物試合のために俺たちをここに閉じ込めてきたんだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"That's why you should be glad you're fresh meat.  They move you to Red Team "
"if you survive long enough, and the shit they do to you afterward turns you "
"into an animal."
msgstr "だからお前は新入りでよかったと思うんだな。十分生き延びりゃレッドチームに回される、その後にされることで人は『獣』になっちまう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"They're little better than animals, after all the shit they do to people "
"survive enough fights."
msgstr "あいつらは獣とほとんど変わらねえ。十分な数の試合を生き延びた人間にあれこれされた結果がそれだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"They stage these fights pitting one cell block against the other, eventually"
" the ones that snap get used to trying to kill anyone else not on their "
"side…"
msgstr "奴らは監房棟同士を戦わせる試合を仕組んでやがる。最後にはブチ切れた連中が、自分の側じゃない奴を片っ端から殺そうとするようになる…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"They're the ones that have been held captive long enough to get used to "
"being a fucking pit dog."
msgstr "あいつらは、くそったれの闘犬に成り下がるほど長く囚われてきた連中だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"They're the other team in the fucking death matches these assholes would "
"stage for their amusement.  They're the ones that've been here long enough "
"to actually get into it…"
msgstr "あいつらは、このクソ野郎どもが娯楽のために仕組む死の試合のもう一方のチームだ。ここに長くいすぎて、本当にのめり込んじまった連中さ…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"They've been running this blood sport long enough that some of us can't even"
" remember the surface."
msgstr "奴らはもう長いことこの血の見世物を続けてきた。俺たちの中には地上のことすら思い出せねえ奴もいる。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Oh."
msgstr "そうか。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid ""
"Alright.  Let's give Red Team their final rest and see if we can escape…"
msgstr "よし。レッドチームに引導を渡して、逃げられるか試してみよう…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "To glory and death."
msgstr "栄光と死に。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "There has to be a way out of here.  Lead the way."
msgstr "ここから出る道があるはずだ。先導してくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Fine by me.  Let's go."
msgstr "構わねえ。行くぞ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Thank you!  I'll follow your lead."
msgstr "ありがとう!ついていく。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Alright.  Watch out for the others from Red Team."
msgstr "わかった。レッドチームの連中に気をつけろ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Any place has to be better than this.  Lead on!"
msgstr "どこだってここよりマシだ。先導してくれ!"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "You're really getting me out of here?  Thank you…"
msgstr "本当にここから出してくれるのか?ありがとう…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_GLADIATOR.json
msgid "Let's go!"
msgstr "行くぞ!"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "You've got the badge, huh?  I am listening."
msgstr "バッジを持っているのか。話を聞こう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Hey there!  Welcome to the Command Center."
msgstr "やあ、司令部へようこそ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "お前は誰だ?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "So now what are you going to do?"
msgstr "それで、これからどうするつもりだ?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Anything I can help with?"
msgstr "何か手伝えることは?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "So, what can I help you with?"
msgstr "さて、何を手伝えばいい?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Any advice for dealing with a bio-weapon?"
msgstr "生物兵器への対処法について、何か助言は?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Farewell."
msgstr "さらばだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Survival, and eventually research.  We'll manage given time.  Keep an eye on"
" Sigma and Lambda while you're at it… talk to them maybe?  I've been busy "
"working on repairs almost constantly, and they're both likely to go stir-"
"crazy if they have nothing to do but sit around all day.  Might help them "
"figure out for themselves what to do."
msgstr ""
"生存、そしていずれは研究だ。時間さえあれば何とかなるだろう。ついでにシグマとラムダにも目を配ってくれ…話しかけてやってもいい。私はほとんどずっと修理にかかりきりで、あの二人は一日中座っているだけでは気が滅入るだろうからな。何をすべきか、自分で見出す助けになるかもしれん。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "We'll see what I can do."
msgstr "何ができるか見てみよう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"I don't have any jobs for you, I'm afraid.  If you see Sigma or Lambda, "
"maybe speak with them.  I've been busy working on repairs almost constantly,"
" and they're both likely to go stir-crazy if they have nothing to do but sit"
" around all day.  Might help them figure out for themselves what to do."
msgstr ""
"すまないが、今頼める仕事はない。シグマかラムダを見かけたら、話しかけてやってくれ。私はほとんどずっと修理にかかりきりで、あの二人は一日中座っているだけでは気が滅入るだろうからな。何をすべきか、自分で見出す助けになるかもしれん。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"If you have access to any sort of protection against electricity, use it.  "
"Most of them have electric discharge weaponry implanted in them, and those "
"that don't have been known to mutilate their power generation augmentations "
"to improvise."
msgstr ""
"電気への防護手段が何かあるなら、使うといい。奴らの大半は放電兵器を体内に埋め込まれているし、それを持たない個体でも発電用の増設器官を自ら傷つけて即席の武器にすることが知られている。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Even with how much they've been through, their medical implants are usually "
"still operational.  If you commit to an attack, keep up the pressure.  If "
"you have to break contact, they'll have likely regenerated by the time you "
"next run into them."
msgstr ""
"あれだけの目に遭っていても、奴らの医療用インプラントはたいてい今も機能している。攻撃を仕掛けるなら、圧力をかけ続けろ。離脱せざるを得なくなれば、次に出くわす頃には再生し終えているだろう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"I'd recommend against taking them on in close combat, unless you're likewise"
" fairly well-enhanced.  Keep a safe distance and pour a high volume of fire "
"into them.  Only a few of the completed bio-weapons had any integrated "
"ranged weaponry, so it'll be safer than going toe-to-toe with them."
msgstr ""
"よほど強化されていない限り、近接戦は勧めない。安全な距離を保って、大量の銃撃を浴びせるといい。完成した生物兵器で遠距離武器を内蔵しているのはごく一部だ、正面から殴り合うよりは安全だろう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"If you can deliver effective fire with something high-caliber, or even "
"explosive, you should have good odds of taking one out in a single shot.  Be"
" prepared for the chance they might limp away from it though, these things "
"are tougher than they look."
msgstr ""
"高口径の火器、あるいは爆発物で有効射撃ができれば、一撃で仕留められる見込みは十分ある。もっとも、傷を負ってよろめきながら逃げられる可能性も覚悟しておけ。見た目以上に頑丈な連中だからな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"It's a bit like fighting some of the nastier undead out there, if you get "
"caught in close combat with more than one of them, you're not going to last "
"long.  Be careful too, even with all those bionic malfunctions they might "
"outpace you."
msgstr ""
"外にいる厄介な不死者と戦うのに少し似ている。複数を相手に近接戦に持ち込まれたら、長くは持たないだろう。それに、バイオニックの不調を抱えていても、お前より速い可能性がある、気をつけることだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"I'm sure they can tell the living apart from the dead, but that doesn't make"
" them any friend of the zombies.  The undead seem to regard them with the "
"same hostility as any other living human."
msgstr ""
"生者と死者の区別はついているはずだが、だからといって奴らがゾンビの味方になるわけではない。不死者は奴らを、他の生きた人間と同じように敵視しているようだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"There's a lot to deal with, first I'd like for you to go scout out a small "
"lab installation, associated what they called the Bio-Weapon Project.  "
"Recently there was a security breach logged on what's left of the laboratory"
" network, and I have reason to believe that a number of renegade former "
"experiments, what locals have come to label augmented abominations, might be"
" responsible.  I'd like to ask you to investigate."
msgstr ""
"片付けるべきことは山ほどあるが、まずは小さな研究施設を偵察してきてほしい。かつて『生物兵器計画』と呼ばれていたものに関連する施設だ。最近、研究所ネットワークの残骸に不正侵入の記録が残っていてな、地元の連中が『強化異形』と呼ぶようになった、反乱を起こした元実験体どもの仕業だと考える理由がある。調査を頼みたい。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Security breach at a Bio-Weapon lab… that might've been Evelynn actually, "
"not just the creatures that were there."
msgstr "生物兵器研究所への不正侵入…それは実際、そこにいた生物どもだけでなく、エヴェリンの仕業だったのかもしれない。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Like the place I woke up in?  Some members of the Super Soldier project had "
"been there, then the place came under attack by the renegades you mentioned."
msgstr "俺が目覚めた場所みたいなところか?スーパーソルジャー計画の一員が何人かそこにいて、そこがあんたの言う反乱者たちに襲撃されたんだな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "I found an item like that already, is this what you're talking about?"
msgstr "そういうものならもう見つけてある、これのことか?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "I'll do it.  What am I looking for?"
msgstr "やろう。何を探せばいい?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Er, maybe another time."
msgstr "いや、また今度にしよう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Maybe another time.  Bye."
msgstr "また今度にしよう。じゃあな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"I see, so that means you already confirmed what I suspected, and made an "
"attempt to lead her here.  Hope things turned out alright.  If you think you"
" can handle yourself, I still have other missions for you."
msgstr ""
"なるほど、つまり私の疑念はすでに裏付けられていて、彼女をここへ導こうとしたわけか。うまくいっていることを願おう。自分の身をこなせると思うなら、まだ他にも頼みたい任務がある。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"So that explains a lot, triggering the alarms probably caused a power "
"failure in the systems keeping you locked up there.  I'm glad you made it "
"out of there in one piece.  Come see me when you're ready."
msgstr ""
"それで色々と合点がいく。警報を作動させたことで、お前を閉じ込めていたシステムに停電が起きたんだろう。無事に脱出できて何よりだ。準備ができたら会いに来てくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"I see, hadn't expected that since you weren't wearing the badge.  Triggering"
" the alarms probably caused a power failure in the systems keeping you "
"locked up there.  I'm glad you made it out of there in one piece.  Come see "
"me when you're ready."
msgstr ""
"そうか、バッジを身に着けていなかったから予想外だったが。警報を作動させたことで、お前を閉じ込めていたシステムに停電が起きたんだろう。無事に脱出できて何よりだ。準備ができたら会いに来てくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Alright then."
msgstr "それなら結構。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"How the hell… well that's good luck on our part I suppose.  You survived "
"whatever was there at least, let me see.  So I was right, the Super Soldier "
"project made it at least past Zero Day.  I hope there were other survivors "
"there.  In any case, come see me when you're ready, there's much to be done."
msgstr ""
"一体どうやって…まあ、こちらにとっては幸運だったということか。少なくともそこで何があったにせよ、お前は生き延びた、そうか。つまり私の読みは正しかった、スーパーソルジャー計画はゼロデイを少なくとも乗り越えたわけだ。他にも生存者がいてくれるといいのだが。とにかく、準備ができたら会いに来てくれ、やるべきことは山ほどある。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Someone was logged by security having used an RFID access badge.  It looks "
"similar to the silver bio-weapon badges the creatures wear.  If you find any"
" survivors then talk to them, otherwise bring the access badge back with "
"you.  I'll mark the location on your map, but be careful.  Those things "
"might be present, and they're not easy to take down.  If things get too "
"hectic, break contact and try not to get in over your head."
msgstr ""
"警備記録に、RFID方式の入館バッジを使った何者かの記録が残っている。あの生物どもが着けている銀色の生物兵器バッジに似たものだ。生存者を見つけたら話をしてくれ、そうでなければその入館バッジを持ち帰ってくれ。場所は地図に印を付けておく、だが気をつけろ。あの連中がいるかもしれないし、倒すのは容易ではない。手に負えなくなったら、離脱して深入りしないようにしろ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Not a problem."
msgstr "問題ない。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Got any advice?"
msgstr "何か助言はあるか?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "I'll be back soon!"
msgstr "すぐに戻る!"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"If whoever opened that place up is non-hostile, they might be looking for "
"us, and we could use all the help we can get.  Be ready for anything though,"
" there might be augmented abominations or undead present.  I feel bad enough"
" sending you off on a mission like this as it is, but we'll need people who "
"can handle far bigger threats.  So please, don't get yourself killed."
msgstr ""
"あの場所を開けた者が敵意を持っていないなら、こちらを探している可能性がある、猫の手も借りたいところだ。とはいえ何が起きても対応できるようにしておけ、強化異形や不死者がいるかもしれない。こんな任務に送り出すのは心苦しくもあるが、もっと大きな脅威に対処できる人材が必要になる。だから頼むから、死なないでくれ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Alright, before I go though…"
msgstr "わかった、行く前に一つ…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "I'll be back soon then."
msgstr "それなら、すぐに戻る。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"This a refuge for the former scientists of the Bio-Weapon Project.  We "
"settled here in the woods and tried to make a living.  We allow people to "
"stay here, as long as they contribute something.  We even managed to find a "
"couple of stray Bio-Weapons!"
msgstr ""
"ここは生物兵器計画の元研究者たちの避難所だ。この森に腰を落ち着けて、生計を立てようとしている。何か貢献してくれるなら、誰でも滞在を許可している。はぐれの生物兵器を二体、見つけ出すことさえできたぞ!"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Seems like you got it good here."
msgstr "ここでは上手くやってるみたいだな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Who are these Bio-Weapons here?"
msgstr "ここにいる生物兵器というのは誰なんだ?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"That would be Sigma and Lambda.  They are very confused.  They awoke with "
"their memory gone and only knew they were 'different'.  I found them and "
"they helped to scavenge and build this place.  They were built for combat, I"
" can tell they're bored out of their minds…"
msgstr ""
"それはシグマとラムダのことだ。二人ともひどく混乱している。記憶を失った状態で目覚め、自分たちが『違う』ということだけはわかっていた。私が見つけて、この場所を建てるための物資集めを手伝ってもらった。戦闘用に造られた存在だから、退屈で頭がおかしくなりそうなのは見ればわかる…"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "I'll keep on eye out for them."
msgstr "気にかけておこう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"I am the leader of this place.  I go by Router.  Before the cataclysm I used"
" to be the second lead scientist in the Bio-Weapon Project.  I designed "
"Sigma and Lambda and saw them being stored away.  I now dedicate myself to "
"upgrading this place, basic survival and finding more info on the project I "
"worked on."
msgstr ""
"私がここの指導者だ。ルーターと呼んでくれ。大変動の前は生物兵器計画で次席主任研究員をしていた。シグマとラムダを設計し、彼らが保管されるのをこの目で見た。今はこの場所の改良、基本的な生存、そして自分が関わっていた計画についての情報収集に専念している。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Seems like you've got a lot on your plate."
msgstr "抱えてるものが色々ありそうだな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Well, the main reason we were hiding here was Apophis…  It was a Bio-Weapon "
"specifically designed to eliminate every other Bio-Weapon and Bio-Weapon "
"scientist.  Now we can try to get things fixed up eventually, and work on "
"research that might benefit others out there."
msgstr ""
"さて、私たちがここに隠れていた主な理由はアポフィスだった…他のあらゆる生物兵器と生物兵器研究者を排除するために特別に設計された生物兵器だ。今なら、いずれこの場所を立て直し、外の他の人々の役に立つかもしれない研究に取り組んでいけるだろう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Well, the main reason we are hiding here is Apophis…  It is a Bio-Weapon "
"specifically designed to eliminate every other Bio-Weapon and Bio-Weapon "
"scientist.  Currently we don't have anything that could stand a decent "
"chance against it, so we're trying to create our own Bio-Weapon to counter "
"Apophis. Sigma and Lambda have expressed interest in going after it, but "
"they won't be able to take it out on their own."
msgstr ""
"さて、私たちがここに隠れている主な理由はアポフィスだ…他のあらゆる生物兵器と生物兵器研究者を排除するために特別に設計された生物兵器でね。今のところ、こちらにはそれとまともに渡り合えるものが何もない、だから対抗するための独自の生物兵器を作ろうとしている。シグマとラムダはそれを追う気があるようだが、二人だけでは仕留めきれないだろう。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Oh, good luck, I suppose."
msgstr "ああ、幸運を祈る、としか言えないな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "What exactly is Apophis and is it really that dangerous?"
msgstr "アポフィスとは一体何だ、本当にそれほど危険なのか?"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"You have that badge, you should know how powerful those things are.  Apophis"
" could take them all at once.  Have you seen a zombie hulk?  They couldn't "
"even scratch it.  Worse still, there are some rejects from the Bio-Weapon "
"program that have sided with him, the abominations as they've come to be "
"known.  This is why we are hiding here."
msgstr ""
"そのバッジを持っているのなら、奴らがどれほど強いか分かっているはずだ。アポフィスはあれを全部一度に相手取れる。ゾンビハルクを見たことは?あんなものでは傷一つつけられない。さらに厄介なことに、生物兵器計画の落伍者の中にはあいつの側についた者もいる――いわゆる『忌まわしき者たち』だ。だからこそ我々はここに身を潜めている。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Ha!  You really have no idea, do you?  Have you ever fought an augmented "
"abomination?  How about the ones that've succumbed to undeath?  Tough, "
"right?  They have nothing on Apophis.  It's incredibly durable thanks to its"
" armor and its heavy weaponry is a step above the rest of the Project.  "
"Apophis is far more dangerous than any ordinary enemy."
msgstr ""
"ハッ、本当に何も分かっていないようだな。強化された忌まわしき者と戦ったことは?不死と化した連中はどうだ?手強いだろう?だがアポフィスに比べれば話にならない。装甲のおかげで恐ろしく頑丈な上、重武装は計画の他の個体を一段上回っている。アポフィスは並みの敵とは比較にならないほど危険だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"I'm one of the originals it seems.  It's going to come after me anyway, so "
"why not fight it?"
msgstr "どうやら私はオリジナルの一体らしい。どのみち奴に狙われるのなら、いっそ戦ってやろうじゃないか。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "I'm not one of those monsters.  There has to be something I can do."
msgstr "私はあの化け物どもとは違う。何かできることがあるはずだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid "Dealing with this mess is what I was created for."
msgstr "この惨状を片付けるために、私は作られたのだから。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"That you may be, but while you've been stuck in stasis, the other research "
"teams had been poring over every last scrap of data they could get out of "
"your production.  Even if it was two steps forward, one step back, Apophis "
"is the culmination of all that research.  I know you might be eager to "
"fight, but we need to prepare ourselves."
msgstr ""
"それはそうかもしれない。だが君が冷凍保存されている間、他の研究チームは君の製造から得られるデータを一片残らず洗い出していた。二歩進んで一歩下がる、そんな有様だったとしても、アポフィスはその研究すべての集大成なのだ。戦いたい気持ちは分かるが、我々にはまず備えが必要だ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Maybe I was wrong about judging you based on your lack of a badge.  If you "
"are who you claim to be, then know this.  Apophis is the culmination of all "
"the research that came from your creation.  I know you might be eager to "
"fight, but we need to be ready."
msgstr ""
"バッジを持っていないというだけで君を判断したのは、間違いだったのかもしれん。君が名乗る通りの者なら、これだけは知っておいてくれ。アポフィスは君の誕生から得られた研究すべての集大成だ。戦いたい気持ちは分かるが、我々には備えが必要なのだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"I know you're eager to prove yourself, but that doesn't require throwing "
"your life away.  That thing is tailor-made to kill Bio-Weapons and anyone "
"else that gets in his way.  You don't have to prove yourself just because "
"others have joined him.  I know I can trust you."
msgstr ""
"自分を証明したい気持ちは分かるが、それは命を投げ出すことを意味しない。あれは生物兵器と、行く手を阻む者すべてを殺すために作られたものだ。他の者たちが奴の側についたからといって、君まで自分を証明する必要はない。君のことは信頼できると分かっている。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Huh.  Maybe that's why you're not wearing the badge.  I think I can trust "
"you.  I wish the others had been given the same chance you have now, and "
"that Apophis hadn't gotten to them first.  But if you take him on "
"unprepared, you'll just be throwing your life away needlessly."
msgstr ""
"ふむ。だからバッジを着けていないのかもしれんな。君のことは信頼できると思う。他の者たちにも今の君と同じ機会が与えられ、アポフィスに先を越されなければよかったのだが。だが、備えのないまま奴に挑めば、無駄に命を投げ出すだけだ。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"And that thing was created to kill you, the original Bio-Weapons, and "
"anything else that gets in the way.  That's why it got the designation "
"Apophis, pretty much opened ourselves up for that when we went with Project "
"Mesektet for the codename."
msgstr ""
"そしてあれは、君たちオリジナルの生物兵器と、行く手を阻むあらゆるものを殺すために作られた。だからこそ『アポフィス』という呼称が与えられたのだ――コードネームに『プロジェクト・メセケト』を選んだ時点で、こうなることは自分たちで招いたようなものだがな。"

#: ./Npc/TALK_MSCI.json
msgid ""
"Sure, just clean up after yourself and try to not piss anyone off.  Help is "
"appreciated, if you have the time."
msgstr "ああ、構わない。後片付けだけはちゃんとして、誰にも喧嘩を売らないようにしてくれ。手伝ってもらえるなら、時間がある時で構わない。"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "<BGSS_intro_question>"
msgstr "<BGSS_intro_question>"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"They had me set up and ready to follow a paper trail, check up on a small "
"handful of lab projects.  Degree in computer engineering and a brief stint "
"as an officer candidate before all this."
msgstr ""
"あの時は、書類の足跡を辿っていくつかの研究施設を調べる役目を任されていた。コンピュータ工学の学位持ちで、これが起きる前は士官候補生を少しだけやっていた。"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"I was working my way through a college degree.  Computer engineering stuff, "
"and that helped get me where I am now.  I was at home actually when this "
"started, putting the final pieces on the side project that led me here."
msgstr ""
"大学の学位を取ろうと頑張っていたところだった。コンピュータ工学関係の勉強が、今の自分をここまで導いてくれた。これが始まった時は実は家にいて、後にここへ辿り着くきっかけになった個人プロジェクトの仕上げをしていたんだ。"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "How did you find out so much about the labs?"
msgstr "研究所についてそんなに詳しいなんて、どうやって知ったんだ?"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "何があったんだ?"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"I can tell you're one of us, Hunter.  I was expecting an officer, not a "
"college student."
msgstr "お前が仲間の一人だってことは分かる、ハンター。士官が来ると思っていたが、大学生とはな。"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "You seem to know a lot more than you're letting on."
msgstr "見せている以上に、色々知っているみたいだな。"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "<done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "<done_conversation_section>"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "<end_talking>"
msgstr "<end_talking>"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"Seems it's harder to conceal that than I thought.  You're right, and I "
"suppose that also confirms I can trust you with this.  Though you're wrong "
"about that last bit, didn't stay a CO for very long.  Long story, don't ask."
"  Just be careful who you reveal this information to, okay?"
msgstr ""
"思っていたより隠し通すのは難しいらしいな。その通りだ、それにこの話をお前に任せてもいいという証にもなる。ただ最後のところは外れてるぞ、指揮官として長くは続かなかった。長い話だ、聞くな。ただ、この情報を誰に明かすかは気をつけてくれ、いいか?"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"I don't know much more than what I could scrape together over a year of "
"picking apart the details.  Really not much to say."
msgstr "一年かけて細部をかき集めた以上のことは、大して知らない。本当に大した話じゃないんだ。"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "You just asked me earlier.  I'd rather not talk about it right now."
msgstr "さっきも聞かれたな。今はその話はしたくない。"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "..."
msgstr "……"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"Time, effort, and the fact that all these government projects can only do so"
" much to cover their tracks.  Eventually I had enough to go on and just "
"barely enough time to follow what information I had."
msgstr ""
"時間と労力、それに政府のプロジェクトといえども痕跡を消すのには限界があるということだ。やがて手がかりは十分揃い、掴んだ情報を追うだけの時間もぎりぎり残っていた。"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"They didn't do a great job of covering their tracks.  I mean they really "
"made me work for it, but with all the laboratories out there bits and pieces"
" slipped through the gaps."
msgstr ""
"痕跡の消し方はお世辞にも上手くなかった。もちろん散々苦労させられはしたが、あちこちに研究所がある以上、隙間から情報の断片が漏れ出すものなんだ。"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "So, what happened?"
msgstr "それで、何があったんだ?"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"I came here with one other person, just barely avoiding the crowds of undead"
" in local hotspots.  Guy was from some unit assigned to this project as "
"security, 9th something-or-other.  Lost contact with the rest of the "
"military not long after we set out, so we decided to follow our lead and "
"figure it out from there."
msgstr ""
"ここへはもう一人と一緒に来た。地元の危険地帯にひしめくアンデッドの群れを、ぎりぎりでかわしながらな。そいつはこのプロジェクトの警備担当としてどこかの部隊――第9なんとか――に所属していたやつだった。出発してすぐ他の部隊とは連絡が取れなくなって、それで手元の手がかりを追って、あとは現地で考えることにしたんだ。"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"I lived in a relatively small town, but it still wasn't long before things "
"got hectic.  I decided to pack up what I could and follow what little "
"evidence I had.  Picked up some gear along the way from a wreck, met up with"
" a guy that went AWOL, eventually followed the trail of breadcrumbs.  And "
"that's how I ended up at that lab..."
msgstr ""
"わりと小さな町に住んでいたが、それでもすぐに大混乱になった。持てるだけの荷物をまとめて、手元にわずかに残った手がかりを追うことにした。途中で残骸から装備を拾い、脱走兵の男と落ち合って、やがてパンくずの跡を辿っていった。そうしてあの研究所に辿り着いたわけだ……"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid "Was it that hectic to begin with?"
msgstr "最初からそんなに混乱していたのか?"

#: ./Npc/c_bgss.json
msgid ""
"No.  Place was fairly quiet initially, no sign of those things when we "
"arrived.  We went in to make sure it was clear, then the guy I was traveling"
" with kept watch outside.  Was maybe a day or two of turning the place "
"inside-out when a group of them swarmed the area, tore the poor bastard "
"apart.  I think he took a few with him, but even they aren't all immune to "
"this zombie thing.  I holed up in the bunker once I realized I was alone..."
msgstr ""
"いや。着いた時、あそこは結構静かで、奴らの気配もなかった。中の安全を確かめに入って、連れの男には外で見張りをさせていた。施設をひっくり返すように調べて一日か二日経った頃、奴らの群れがこの一帯に押し寄せて、あの哀れな男を引き裂いた。何体かは道連れにしたと思うが、あいつらだってこのゾンビの一件と無縁じゃない。一人だと気づいてからは、シェルターに立てこもったよ……"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Prepper"
msgstr "プレッパー"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "Just surviving, as usual."
msgstr "いつも通り、生き延びてるだけさ。"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Super Soldier"
msgstr "スーパーソルジャー"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "I am guarding this place in exchange for food and shelter."
msgstr "食料と寝床と引き換えに、ここを守っている。"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "Slave Fighter (Blue Team)"
msgstr "奴隷闘士（ブルーチーム）"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "I am free…"
msgstr "俺は自由だ……"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "Slave Fighter (Red Team)"
msgstr "奴隷闘士（レッドチーム）"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "Rip and tear!"
msgstr "切り裂け、貪り尽くせ!"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "I am protecting my people."
msgstr "俺は仲間を守っている。"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "I am fighting towards a better tomorrow…"
msgstr "俺はより良い明日のために戦っている……"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "Scientist"
msgstr "研究者"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "I'm trying to pick up the pieces of my research…"
msgstr "自分の研究の欠片を、拾い集めようとしている……"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "Bio-Weapon Hunter"
msgstr "生物兵器ハンター"

#: ./Npc/c_classes.json
msgid "I am here to find answers…"
msgstr "俺は答えを探しにここへ来た……"

#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid "Command Center Members"
msgstr "司令部の一員"

#. ~ Description for Command Center Members
#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid ""
"Members of the Command Center seeking refuge from ...something.  They have "
"intel and some connections to the Old Guard."
msgstr "何かから逃れて避難してきた、司令部の生き残りたち。情報を持ち、オールドガードとも繋がりがある。"

#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid "Super Soldiers"
msgstr "スーパーソルジャー"

#. ~ Description for Super Soldiers
#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid ""
"Ragtag branch of the military that survived the initial cataclysm.   Allied "
"to the command center, they seek leadership in this new world."
msgstr "初期の大変動を生き延びた、寄せ集めの軍事集団。コマンドセンターと手を組み、この新世界での主導権を狙っている。"

#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid "Preppers"
msgstr "プレッパー"

#. ~ Description for Preppers
#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid ""
"Survivors who had prepared for the cataclysm before the idea of it was on "
"the radar.  They possess the means to rebuild."
msgstr "大変動が意識されるよりも前から備えていた生存者たち。彼らは再建の手段を持っている。"

#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid "Bio-Weapons"
msgstr "生物兵器"

#. ~ Description for Bio-Weapons
#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid ""
"Creations of an unknown project with links to the cataclysm.  Allied to the "
"command center since they are their creation."
msgstr "大変動と関わりのある、正体不明の計画による創造物たち。生み出した司令部と手を組んでいる。"

#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid "Slave Fighters (Blue Team)"
msgstr "奴隷闘士（ブルーチーム）"

#. ~ Description for Slave Fighters (Blue Team)
#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid ""
"People who all their lives have seen nothing but fighting in a ring for the "
"amusement of the rich.  Most of the saner captives and new meat end up in "
"Blue Team, pitted against hardened and \"broken in\" combatants."
msgstr ""
"生涯、金持ちの娯楽のために闘技場で戦うことしか知らずに生きてきた者たち。分別の残る捕虜や新入りの大半はブルーチームに回され、百戦錬磨の「調教済み」の戦士たちと戦わされる。"

#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid "Slave Fighters (Red Team)"
msgstr "奴隷闘士（レッドチーム）"

#. ~ Description for Slave Fighters (Red Team)
#: ./Npc/c_factions.json
msgid ""
"People who all their lives have seen nothing but fighting in a ring for the "
"amusement of the rich. Devoid of reason they think the cataclysm is but "
"another round, barely able to tell each other apart from the other team."
msgstr ""
"生涯、金持ちの娯楽のために闘技場で戦うことしか知らずに生きてきた者たち。理性を失った彼らは、大変動さえも次の一戦だと思い込んでおり、敵味方の区別すらほとんどつかない。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Investigate Bio-Weapon Lab"
msgstr "生物兵器研究所の調査"

#. ~ Description for mission 'Investigate Bio-Weapon Lab'
#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"Explore a Bio-Weapon Lab that suffered a recent security breach.  Either "
"find whoever accessed the location and speak with them, or retrieve the RFID"
" access badge that was used and bring it back to Router."
msgstr ""
"最近セキュリティ侵害を受けた生物兵器研究所を探索する。その場所にアクセスした人物を見つけて話すか、使用されたRFIDアクセスバッジを回収してルーターの元へ持ち帰る。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "If you see this, it's a bug!"
msgstr "これが見えているならバグだ!"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Seeing this is probably also a bug."
msgstr "これもおそらくバグだろう。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "And seeing this is probably a bug too."
msgstr "そしてこれもおそらくバグだろう。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Oi, cease with these shenanigans, ye debuggers!"
msgstr "おい、いいかげんにせんか、デバッガーどもめ!"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"In fact most of this dialogue is a bug if you run into it, as this mission "
"is started purely through dialogue."
msgstr "実のところ、この任務は会話のみで開始されるため、この会話にたどり着くこと自体がほぼバグだ。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Any luck so far?"
msgstr "何か手がかりは見つかったか?"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"So this confirms that the Super Soldier project isn't quite dead yet.  I "
"hope that it wasn't too harrowing an experience, but we're dealing with some"
" extremely dangerous threats, and it's only going to get worse from there.  "
"Keep whatever you found there, it might be useful.  Come see me when you're "
"ready."
msgstr ""
"これでスーパーソルジャー計画がまだ完全には潰えていないと確認できた。あまり辛い経験でなければいいが、俺たちは極めて危険な脅威を相手にしている。これからもっと悪くなる一方だ。そこで見つけたものは何でも取っておけ、役に立つかもしれない。準備ができたら会いに来てくれ。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"Somehow I doubt that… in fact seeing this is probably another bug, given you"
" can't really bluff your way out of this mission."
msgstr "どうにも疑わしいが……いや、そもそもこの任務は嘘で誤魔化せないはずだから、これが見えているのもまたバグだろう。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"Pretty certain seeing this is a bug too, since you'd have to die to fail "
"this."
msgstr "この任務は死ななければ失敗しないはずだから、これが見えているのもほぼ間違いなくバグだろう。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Kill Bio-Weapon Apophis"
msgstr "生物兵器アポフィスの討伐"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"You seem like a capable person, so you might have a chance.  We have pieced "
"together the coordinates to the laboratory Apophis uses as its base.  I want"
" you to take it down, rid the world of Apophis!  That lab has a lot of "
"valuable equipment left inside; if you manage to kill that thing, it's all "
"yours.  I wish we could do it ourselves, but between the portal "
"breakthroughs, the bombs and the undead, the chance has been lost."
msgstr ""
"腕は立ちそうだ、それなら勝算はあるかもしれない。アポフィスが拠点にしている研究所の座標を、どうにか割り出した。あれを叩き潰し、世界からアポフィスを消し去ってほしい!あの研究所には貴重な装備がまだ大量に残っている——仕留められれば、すべて持ち帰っていい。本当は自分たちの手で片をつけたかったが、ポータルの突破、爆撃、そしてアンデッドのせいで、その機会は失われてしまった。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"You're sure about this?  Thank you… that means a lot, you know.  Be sure to "
"bring some proof, be creative.  I'll be waiting for your return.  I'd "
"suggest talking to Sigma and Lambda too, before you leave."
msgstr ""
"本当にいいのか?ありがとう……それは大きい。証拠は必ず持ち帰ってくれ、やり方は工夫していい。帰りを待っている。出発前にシグマとラムダにも話しておくといい。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"I understand.  It's practically a lost cause at this point.  I'll keep "
"trying to figure something out to stop it."
msgstr "わかった。もはやほとんど望み薄だな。あれを止める方法を、これからも探ってみる。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"Get some decent armor and weapons, this fight won't be easy.  Assemble a "
"team to make it easier.  Ask Lambda and Sigma if they want to join you, if "
"you want.  A single person can't take it on…"
msgstr ""
"まともな防具と武器を揃えておけ、簡単な戦いにはならない。楽に進めたいならチームを組め。望むならラムダとシグマに同行を頼んでみるといい。一人では手に負えない相手だ……"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Is… it dead?"
msgstr "……死んだのか?"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"Is that…you did it!  You have no idea what you have done for us!  You are "
"truly a legend among men in these dark times.  You are always welcomed here!"
msgstr ""
"それは……やってくれたのか!これがどれほど大きなことか、わかっていないだろう!この暗い時代にあって、まさに伝説だ。ここではいつでも歓迎する!"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Oh, no proof huh?.  I hope you are being truthful…"
msgstr "そうか、証拠は無しか?……嘘ではないと信じたいが……"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"At least you are alive.  I should have never told you to do something like "
"that.  I am sorry…"
msgstr "せめて生きていてよかった。あんなことを頼むべきじゃなかった。すまない……"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Reach Command Center"
msgstr "指令センターへの到達"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"I'm trying to reach a hideout built by former scientists who worked on the "
"Bio-Weapon project.  I think I have a lead on where they are, but I would "
"appreciate a helping hand.  I had someone with me, but he got caught outside"
" when company showed up."
msgstr ""
"生物兵器計画に関わっていた元研究者たちが築いた隠れ家を目指している。居場所の手がかりはあると思うが、手を貸してもらえるとありがたい。連れがいたんだが、敵が現れたときに外に取り残されてしまってな。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Thank you.  I'll follow along and maybe we'll get some answers."
msgstr "ありがとう。ついていくよ、何か答えが見つかるかもしれない。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"Oh.  I'd rather try to find the place with some help, so if you're willing "
"to later on maybe…"
msgstr "そうか。できれば助けを借りてあの場所を探したいんだ、もし後で気が向いたら……"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"I was searching this old lab for intel that might help.  Take a look for "
"yourself if you need to.  In addition, the humvee my companion and I arrived"
" in still should be parked outside, assuming those things didn't trash it…"
msgstr ""
"この古い研究所で、役立ちそうな情報を探していた。必要なら自分の目で確かめてくれ。それと、連れと乗ってきたハンヴィーがまだ外に停めてあるはずだ、あいつらに壊されていなければだが……"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Any closer to the others yet?"
msgstr "他の連中には近づけたか?"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid ""
"Excellent.  I'll go ahead and stick around for now.  Looks like they have a "
"decent little setup going on here.  Maybe asking around will get us pointed "
"in the right direction."
msgstr "上出来だ。ひとまずここに留まっておく。ここにはなかなかの拠点を築いているようだな。聞き込みをすれば、正しい方向がわかるかもしれない。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "Thanks for trying…  I guess."
msgstr "頑張ってくれてありがとう……とでも言っておくか。"

#: ./Npc/c_mission_def.json
msgid "It's all for nothing, isn't it?"
msgstr "すべて無駄だったんだな?"

#: ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Bio Hunter"
msgstr "生物兵器ハンター"

#: ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Evelynn Rose"
msgstr "エヴェリン・ローズ"

#: ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Center Leader"
msgstr "センター長"

#: ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Router"
msgstr "ルーター"

#: ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Bio Weapon"
msgstr "生物兵器"

#: ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Sigma"
msgstr "シグマ"

#: ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Lambda"
msgstr "ラムダ"

#: ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Red Team Slave Fighter"
msgstr "レッドチーム奴隷闘士"

#: ./Npc/c_npc.json
msgid "Blue Team Slave Fighter"
msgstr "ブルーチーム奴隷闘士"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "survivor's archer backpack"
msgid_plural "survivor's archer backpacks"
msgstr[0] "生存者の射手用バックパック"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's archer backpack"}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom-built backpack modified further to be an archer's best friend.  "
"Lots of storage, manageable encumbrance and a built in quiver."
msgstr "射手の相棒となるよう改造を重ねた特注のバックパックだ。収納力が高く、着用感を抑えつつ、矢筒を内蔵している。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "survivor's scout suit"
msgid_plural "survivor's scout suits"
msgstr[0] "生存者の斥候スーツ"

#. ~ Use action holster_msg for {'str': "survivor's scout suit"}.
#. ~ Use action holster_msg for {'str': "survivor's armored scout suit"}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "You sheath your %s"
msgstr "%sを鞘に収めた"

#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': "survivor's scout suit"}.
#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': "survivor's armored scout suit"}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "Sheath knife/sword"
msgstr "小刀/剣を鞘に収める"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's scout suit"}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A home-made suit built to live off the land.  Comes with ample storage, fur "
"lining, environmental and physical protection, a built-in watch, and a "
"makeshift sheath ring.  It requires a separate gas mask for full protection."
msgstr ""
"自然の中で暮らすために作られた自家製のスーツだ。収納力が高く、毛皮の裏地に環境防護と物理防護を備え、時計を内蔵し、間に合わせの鞘リングが付いている。完全な防護には別途ガスマスクが必要だ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
