#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "ACS-74 stealth cloak"
msgid_plural "ACS-74 stealth cloaks"
msgstr[0] "ACS-74ステルスクローク"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'ACS-74 stealth cloak'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "The cloak shimmers and emits an intense light-disrupting field."
msgstr "クロークが揺らめき、強烈な光学撹乱フィールドを放つ。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'ACS-74 stealth cloak'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "The cloak is out of power."
msgstr "クロークの電力が尽きている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ACS-74 stealth cloak'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"An experimental cloak with a destructive interference system that will "
"create pitch-black darkness around you when powered and worn.  Creatures "
"that can see in the dark will still spot you, but it will fool most things."
"  A network of miniature alphavolatics make it self-charging but only able "
"to sustain short bursts of use.  Activate to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"着用時に電力を入れると、破壊的干渉システムによって周囲に漆黒の闇を作り出す実験的なクロークだ。暗闇を見通せる生物には見破られるが、たいていの相手はごまかせる。微小なアルファボルタイク発電素子のネットワークにより自己充電するが、連続使用できるのは短時間だけだ。使用で起動する。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "ACS-74 stealth cloak (on)"
msgid_plural "ACS-74 stealth cloaks (on)"
msgstr[0] "ACS-74ステルスクローク（起動中）"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'ACS-74 stealth cloak (on)', 'str_pl': 'ACS-74
#. stealth cloaks (on)'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "The cloak flickers and powers down."
msgstr "クロークが明滅し、電源が落ちる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ACS-74 stealth cloak (on)', 'str_pl': 'ACS-74
#. stealth cloaks (on)'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"An experimental cloak with a destructive interference system, creating "
"pitch-black darkness around you.  Creatures that can see in the dark will "
"still spot you, but it will fool most things.  A network of miniature "
"alphavolatics make it self-charging but only able to sustain short bursts of"
" use.  It's currently on, activate to turn it back off."
msgstr ""
"破壊的干渉システムによって周囲に漆黒の闇を作り出す実験的なクロークだ。暗闇を見通せる生物には見破られるが、たいていの相手はごまかせる。微小なアルファボルタイク発電素子のネットワークにより自己充電するが、連続使用できるのは短時間だけだ。現在起動中で、使用で停止する。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
