"probably isn't good for you, by the way."
msgstr "現在、壁越しに見通せる状態だ。ちなみに、これが放っている放射線はおそらく体に良くない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "pair of radiogenic goggles"
msgid_plural "pair of radiogenic goggles"
