#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "Carapace Armor Cooling"
msgstr "外殻装甲冷却"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Carapace Armor Cooling'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is used to make salvaged carapace armor provide further cooling if "
"overheating."
msgstr "これは、過熱時に回収外殻装甲がさらに冷却するようにするために使う。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "salvaged carapace armor"
msgid_plural "salvaged carapace armors"
msgstr[0] "回収外殻装甲"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'salvaged carapace armor'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"The carapace comes to life, spiracles dilating as environmental seals close."
msgstr "外殻が息を吹き返し、気門が広がると同時に環境シールが閉じる。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'salvaged carapace armor'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "The carapace suit doesn't respond, evidently out of energy."
msgstr "外殻スーツが反応しない。どうやらエネルギー切れのようだ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged carapace armor'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A second skin of alien sinew and steel support, covered in armor plates made"
" of resin.  Salvaged using pre-cataclysm research into other living "
"weaponry, it's been practically mutilated to fit a human (or mutant) wearer."
"  Activating it will reduce the suit's encumbrance, make your attacks "
"faster, enhance strength and dexterity, protect the wearer from toxic gas, "
"serve as a rebreather, enhance stamina and carry capacity, and provide some "
"protection from outside temperature.  Recharges in sunlight, being active "
"will also gradually fatigue the user and affect healthiness, plus render "
"them more vulnerable to electric shocks."
msgstr ""
"異星生物の腱と鋼鉄の支持構造からなる第二の皮膚で、樹脂製の装甲板に覆われている。大変動以前の生体兵器研究を流用して回収されたもので、人間（あるいは変異体）の着用者に合わせるため、実質的に切り刻まれて作り直されている。起動すると、スーツの動作妨害を減らし、攻撃を速くし、筋力と器用さを強化し、着用者を毒ガスから守り、リブリーザーとして機能し、スタミナと携行容量を強化し、外気温からもある程度守ってくれる。太陽光で再充電するが、稼働中は着用者を徐々に疲労させ、健康状態にも影響を与えるほか、感電への耐性も下げてしまう。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "salvaged carapace armor (on)"
msgid_plural "salvaged carapace armors (on)"
msgstr[0] "回収外殻装甲（起動中）"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'salvaged carapace armor (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'salvaged carapace armors (on)'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "The suit's sinews go slack, releasing you from its grasp."
msgstr "スーツの腱が緩み、締め付けから解放される。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged carapace armor (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'salvaged carapace armors (on)'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A second skin of alien sinew and steel support, covered in armor plates made"
" of resin.  Salvaged using pre-cataclysm research into other living "
"weaponry, it's been practically mutilated to fit a human (or mutant) wearer."
"  Currently active, it enhances strength and dexterity, make your attacks "
"faster, protects the wearer from toxic gas, serves as a rebreather, enhances"
" stamina and carry capacity, and provides some protection from outside "
"temperature.  Recharges in sunlight, being active also gradually fatigues "
"the user and affects healthiness, plus renders them more vulnerable to "
"electric shocks."
msgstr ""
"異星生物の腱と鋼鉄の支持構造からなる第二の皮膚で、樹脂製の装甲板に覆われている。大変動以前の生体兵器研究を流用して回収されたもので、人間（あるいは変異体）の着用者に合わせるため、実質的に切り刻まれて作り直されている。現在稼働中で、筋力と器用さを強化し、攻撃を速くし、着用者を毒ガスから守り、リブリーザーとして機能し、スタミナと携行容量を強化し、外気温からもある程度守ってくれる。太陽光で再充電するが、稼働中は着用者を徐々に疲労させ、健康状態にも影響を与えるほか、感電への耐性も下げてしまう。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "set of salvaged exo-wings"
msgid_plural "sets of salvaged exo-wings"
msgstr[0] "回収外骨格翼一式"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'set of salvaged exo-wings', 'str_pl': 'sets
#. of salvaged exo-wings'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"The exo-wings whir to life, becoming a fluttering blur of green and gray."
msgstr "外骨格翼がうなりを上げて起動し、緑と灰色の羽ばたきがぼやけて見えるほどの速さで動き出す。"

#. ~ Use action need_charges_msg for {'str': 'set of salvaged exo-wings',
#. 'str_pl': 'sets of salvaged exo-wings'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "The exo-wings don't respond, evidently out of energy."
msgstr "エクソウイングは反応しない。エネルギー切れのようだ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'set of salvaged exo-wings', 'str_pl': 'sets of
#. salvaged exo-wings'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A harness from which jut thin, green iridescent wings, steel wires and "
"joints meshed with thick alien nervous cords.  Salvaged using pre-cataclysm "
"research into other living weaponry, it's been heavily altered to fit a "
"human (or mutant) wearer.  Activating it will grant limited flight and "
"vastly speed up movement.  It seems to recharge from sunlight, and being "
"active will also gradually fatigue the user."
msgstr ""
"薄く緑色に輝く翼が生えたハーネスで、スチールワイヤーと関節部には太い異星生物の神経索が絡みついている。大変動前に行われていた、他の生体兵器に関する研究の成果を流用して回収されたもので、人間（あるいはミュータント）の装着者に合わせて大幅に改造されている。起動すると限定的な飛行が可能になり、移動速度も大幅に上がる。太陽光で充電されるようで、起動中は徐々に使用者を疲労させる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "set of salvaged exo-wings (on)"
msgid_plural "sets of salvaged exo-wings (on)"
msgstr[0] "回収エクソウイング一式（起動中）"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'set of salvaged exo-wings (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'sets of salvaged exo-wings (on)'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "The exo-wings go limp as they shut down."
msgstr "エクソウイングは力なく垂れ下がり、停止した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'set of salvaged exo-wings (on)', 'str_pl': 'sets
#. of salvaged exo-wings (on)'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A set of thin, green iridescent wings, steel wires and joints meshed with "
"thick alien nervous cords.  They are currently buzzing with life, greatly "
"speeding up movement and enhancing dodge as well as allowing you to fly, in "
"exchange for increased fatigue gain."
msgstr ""
"薄く緑色に輝く翼ひとそろいで、スチールワイヤーと関節部には太い異星生物の神経索が絡みついている。今は生命力に満ちて震えており、移動速度を大幅に高め、回避力を向上させるとともに飛行を可能にするが、その代わり疲労の蓄積も早まる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "survivor cowboy hat"
msgid_plural "survivor cowboy hats"
msgstr[0] "生存者のカウボーイハット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor cowboy hat'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A wide-brimmed hat that's been modified with kevlar padding, and bandolier "
"loops sewn onto the hat band.  Perfect for holding a few cartridges "
"somewhere out of the way, its adjustable loops fitting a wide variety of "
"ammunition."
msgstr ""
"ケブラー製の詰め物で補強されたつば広の帽子で、ハットバンドには弾帯用のループが縫い付けられている。邪魔にならない場所に弾薬を数発収めるのに最適で、調節可能なループは幅広い規格の弾薬に対応する。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "survivor leg rig"
msgid_plural "survivor leg rigs"
msgstr[0] "生存者のレッグリグ"

#. ~ Use action holster_prompt for {'str': 'survivor leg rig'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "Stash item"
msgstr "アイテムを収納"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'survivor leg rig'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A custom set of low-slung adjustable straps and rings, designed to secure a "
"variety of equipment strapped to the legs.  Its straps can handle a wide "
"range of short blades, firearms, magazines, and most items that would fit on"
" a tool belt.  Activate it to store up to 4 items."
msgstr ""
"腰から低く垂らして装着する、調節可能なストラップとリングを組み合わせたカスタム装備一式で、脚にさまざまな装備を固定するために作られている。ストラップは短剣や銃器、弾倉をはじめ、ツールベルトに収まるようなほとんどの物品に対応する。起動すると最大4個のアイテムを収納できる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "makeshift hydraulic armor Noise"
msgstr "自作油圧アーマー・ノイズ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift hydraulic armor Noise'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"This is used to make the player a lot less stealthy, but also punch harder "
"on top of the armor's strength bonus."
msgstr "プレイヤーのステルス性を大幅に低下させる一方、アーマーの筋力ボーナスに加えてパンチ力も高めるためのものだ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "makeshift hydraulic armor"
msgid_plural "makeshift hydraulic armors"
msgstr[0] "自作油圧アーマー"

#. ~ Use action failure_message for {'str': 'makeshift hydraulic armor'}.
#. ~ Use action failure_message for {'str': 'makeshift superalloy hydraulic
#. armor'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "Your armor sputters but fails to start up."
msgstr "アーマーがくすぶるような音を立てるが、始動に失敗した。"

#. ~ Use action lacks_fuel_message for {'str': 'makeshift hydraulic armor'}.
#. ~ Use action lacks_fuel_message for {'str': 'makeshift superalloy hydraulic
#. armor'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "You work your armor's starter, but nothing happens."
msgstr "アーマーのスターターを操作するが、何も起こらない。"

#. ~ Use action success_message for {'str': 'makeshift hydraulic armor'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"Your makeshift hydraulic armor roars to life, servos kicking into gear!"
msgstr "自作油圧アーマーが轟音とともに始動し、サーボが唸りを上げる！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift hydraulic armor'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly heavy suit of steel and kevlar plates covering a network of "
"hydraulics, driven by pieces of a stripped-down diesel engine jury-rigged to"
" assist the wearer's movements.  Shrugs off anything up to 5.56x45mm.  When "
"running it will increase your strength and raw speed, allowing you to fire "
"heavy weapons unsupported, plus make it less encumbering to wear, but the "
"motors make things warm and make stealth harder."
msgstr ""
"スチールとケブラーのプレートが油圧機構一式を覆う、途方もなく重いスーツで、解体されたディーゼルエンジンの部品を応急的に組み込み、装着者の動作を補助する。5.56x45mmまでの弾なら何を受けても平然としている。稼働中は筋力と純粋な速度を高め、支えなしで重火器を撃てるようにするほか、着用時のかさばりも軽減するが、モーターの熱で体が温まり、ステルス行動も難しくなる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "makeshift hydraulic armor (on)"
msgid_plural "makeshift hydraulic armors (on)"
msgstr[0] "自作油圧アーマー（起動中）"

#. ~ Use action charges_extinguish_message for {'str': 'makeshift hydraulic
#. armor (on)', 'str_pl': 'makeshift hydraulic armors (on)'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "Your makeshift hydraulic armor sputters and dies!"
msgstr "自作油圧アーマーがむせるような音を立てて停止した！"

#. ~ Use action noise_message for {'str': 'makeshift hydraulic armor (on)',
#. 'str_pl': 'makeshift hydraulic armors (on)'}.
#. ~ Use action noise_message for {'str': 'makeshift superalloy hydraulic
#. armor (on)', 'str_pl': 'makeshift superalloy hydraulic armors (on)'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "Your armor whirs with activity."
msgstr "アーマーが唸りを上げて動いている。"

#. ~ Use action voluntary_extinguish_message for {'str': 'makeshift hydraulic
#. armor (on)', 'str_pl': 'makeshift hydraulic armors (on)'}.
#. ~ Use action voluntary_extinguish_message for {'str': 'makeshift superalloy
#. hydraulic armor (on)', 'str_pl': 'makeshift superalloy hydraulic armors
#. (on)'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "You shut the makeshift hydraulic armor off."
msgstr "自作油圧アーマーを停止させた。"

#. ~ Use action water_extinguish_message for {'str': 'makeshift hydraulic
#. armor (on)', 'str_pl': 'makeshift hydraulic armors (on)'}.
#. ~ Use action water_extinguish_message for {'str': 'makeshift superalloy
#. hydraulic armor (on)', 'str_pl': 'makeshift superalloy hydraulic armors
#. (on)'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "Your armor's engine floods and cuts out!"
msgstr "アーマーのエンジンが浸水し、停止した！"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift hydraulic armor (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'makeshift hydraulic armors (on)'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"An incredibly heavy suit of steel and kevlar plates covering a network of "
"hydraulics, driven by pieces of a stripped-down diesel engine jury-rigged to"
" assist the wearer's movements.  Shrugs off anything up to 5.56x45mm.  It's "
"currently active, strengthening the wearer, allowing you to fire heavy "
"weapons unsupported, increasing raw speed and making the armor less "
"encumbering, but also being warmer and making stealth more difficult."
msgstr ""
"スチールとケブラーのプレートが油圧機構一式を覆う、途方もなく重いスーツで、解体されたディーゼルエンジンの部品を応急的に組み込み、装着者の動作を補助する。5.56x45mmまでの弾なら何を受けても平然としている。現在起動中で、装着者を強化し、支えなしで重火器を撃てるようにするほか、純粋な速度を高め、着用時のかさばりを軽減するが、その分体が熱くなり、ステルス行動も難しくなる。"

