"currently active, strengthening the wearer, allowing you to fire heavy "
"weapons unsupported, increasing raw speed and making the armor less "
"encumbering, but also being warmer and making stealth more difficult."
msgstr ""
"超合金とケブラーのプレートが油圧機構一式を覆う重いスーツで、解体されたディーゼルエンジンの部品を応急的に組み込み、装着者の動作を補助する。5.56x45mmまでの弾なら何を受けても平然としている。現在起動中で、装着者を強化し、支えなしで重火器を撃てるようにするほか、純粋な速度を高め、着用時のかさばりを軽減するが、その分体が熱くなり、ステルス行動も難しくなる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "survivor's tactical shield"
msgid_plural "survivor's tactical shields"
msgstr[0] "生存者のタクティカルシールド"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's tactical shield"}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A large but fairly light plastic shield, layered with kevlar to better "
"protect the user.  Less encumbering than a proper ballistic shield, but "
"won't fully stop anything stronger than .38 Special."
msgstr ""
"大型だが比較的軽量なプラスチック製の盾で、使用者をより確実に守るためケブラーが重ねられている。本格的な防弾盾よりもかさばらないが、.38スペシャルより強力な弾は完全には防げない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "makeshift ballistic pavise"
msgid_plural "makeshift ballistic pavises"
msgstr[0] "自作防弾パビス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift ballistic pavise'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A heavy shield made from armor plates and kevlar lining rated for 5.56x45mm,"
" welded to a framework that helps distribute the weight.  It leaves you free"
" to operate two-handed weapons, even letting you brace heavy weapons to fire"
" without mounting terrain, but is still absurdly heavy and encumbering."
msgstr ""
"装甲板とケブラー内張りで作られた、5.56x45mm対応の重い盾で、重量を分散させるフレームに溶接されている。両手武器を自由に扱うことができ、地形に頼らずとも重火器を構えて撃つことすら可能だが、それでも馬鹿げたほど重くかさばる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid "makeshift superalloy ballistic pavise"
msgid_plural "makeshift superalloy ballistic pavises"
msgstr[0] "自作超合金防弾パビス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift superalloy ballistic pavise'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_armor.json
msgid ""
"A shield made from superalloy plates and kevlar lining rated for 5.56x45mm, "
"welded to a framework that helps distribute the weight.  It leaves you free "
"to operate two-handed weapons, even letting you brace heavy weapons to fire "
"without mounting terrain, but is still very heavy and encumbering."
msgstr ""
"超合金板とケブラー内張りで作られた、5.56x45mm対応の盾で、重量を分散させるフレームに溶接されている。両手武器を自由に扱うことができ、地形に頼らずとも重火器を構えて撃つことすら可能だが、それでもかなり重くかさばる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "laser gatling arm"
msgid_plural "laser gatling arms"
msgstr[0] "レーザーガトリングアーム"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your left arm is currently transformed into a ups powered laser gatling gun."
"  Fire it as if it was any other gun."
msgstr "左腕は現在、UPS駆動のレーザーガトリングガンに変化している。通常の銃と同様に発砲できる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Laser Gatling Arm"
msgstr "レーザーガトリングアーム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Laser Gatling Arm'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Laser Gatling Arm CBM'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"Your left arm has been outfitted with a complex array of rotating laser "
"projectors.  Or in layman's terms, a laser gatling gun!  You may use your "
"energy banks to fire a barrage of lasers."
msgstr ""
"左腕には、回転式レーザー投射機を複雑に組み合わせた装置が組み込まれている。平たく言えばレーザーガトリングガンだ！ "
"体内のエネルギーバンクを使って、レーザーの弾幕を放つことができる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Laser Gatling Arm CBM"
msgid_plural "Laser Gatling Arm CBMs"
msgstr[0] "レーザーガトリングアームCBM"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "monomolecular sword"
msgid_plural "monomolecular swords"
msgstr[0] "単分子ソード"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'monomolecular sword'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"A yard-long sword made from high-tech alloy and edged with bonded "
"nanocrystals."
msgstr "1ヤード程の長さの剣で、ハイテク合金製の刀身にナノ結晶を結合させた刃が付いている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Monomolecular Sword"
msgstr "単分子ソード"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Monomolecular Sword'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Monomolecular Sword CBM'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"A deadly yard-long blade made of advanced material now resides inside your "
"forearm, capable of being extended through the back of your wrist at the "
"cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will "
"prevent you from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr ""
"前腕の中には、先端技術素材でできた必殺の刃──長さ1ヤードほどのブレードが仕込まれている。わずかなエネルギーを消費して、手首の甲から展開できる。並外れた切れ味を誇るが、展開中は他の物を持てなくなる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Monomolecular Sword CBM"
msgid_plural "Monomolecular Sword CBMs"
msgstr[0] "単分子ソードCBM"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "dual-hand flamethrower"
msgid_plural "dual-hand flamethrowers"
msgstr[0] "デュアルハンド・フレイムスロワー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dual-Hand Flamethrower'}
#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Dual-Hand Flamethrower CBM'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"Implanted in the palms of your hands lie a compact flamethrower system that "
"uses bionic power and oxygen in the air as ignition, use as any other gun."
msgstr ""
"両手の掌には、バイオニックパワーと空気中の酸素を使って点火する、コンパクトな火炎放射システムが埋め込まれている。通常の銃と同様に使用できる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Dual-Hand Flamethrower"
msgstr "デュアルハンド・フレイムスロワー"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Dual-Hand Flamethrower CBM"
msgid_plural "Dual-Hand Flamethrower CBMs"
msgstr[0] "デュアルハンド・フレイムスロワーCBM"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Plasma Pulse Cell"
msgstr "プラズマパルスセル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Plasma Pulse Cell'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"Implanted in your chest is a small, advanced hydrogen fuel cell.  Designed "
"to produce a spike of power production for cutting-edge military "
"cybernetics, it burns compressed hydrogen canisters normally used by plasma "
"weapons.  Each pulse vents a jet of intense heat, making it dangerous in "
"confined spaces."
msgstr ""
"胸部に埋め込まれた、小型の先進的水素燃料電池だ。最新鋭の軍用サイバネティクスに瞬間的な出力を供給するよう設計されており、プラズマ兵器に使われる圧縮水素カートリッジを燃焼させて稼働する。作動のたびに高熱のジェットを噴出するため、閉所での使用は危険だ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Plasma Pulse Cell CBM"
msgid_plural "Plasma Pulse Cell CBMs"
msgstr[0] "プラズマパルスセルCBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Plasma Pulse Cell CBM'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"This implant provides an experimental military hydrogen cell, able to "
"produce large spikes of power for intense usage.  Able to load up to 10 "
"rounds of dense hydrogen canisters used in plasma weaponry.  The label "
"advises not to use it in confined spaces, and to keep moving if used during "
"a military operation, due to hazardous levels of waste heat."
msgstr ""
"実験段階の軍用水素電池を内蔵した生体強化パーツだ。高負荷用途に向けて瞬間的な大出力を生み出せる。プラズマ兵器用の高密度水素カートリッジを最大10発まで装填できる。ラベルには、閉所での使用を避けること、また軍事作戦中に使用する場合は排熱量が危険域に達するため、使用後は移動し続けることが推奨されている、と書かれている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Hazard Stabilizer System CBM"
msgid_plural "Hazard Stabilizer System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "有害物質安定化システムCBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hazard Stabilizer System CBM'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"A network of specialized medical equipment, implanted just under the skin.  "
"Activating it will induce temporary changes in body chemistry, providing "
"immunity to acid and biological damage, and preventing exposure to contact "
"toxins and venom."
msgstr ""
"皮下に埋め込まれた、専用医療機器のネットワークだ。起動すると体内の化学反応に一時的な変化を引き起こし、酸ダメージと生物学的ダメージへの耐性を得られるほか、接触性の毒素や毒液への曝露を防ぐ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Hazard Stabilizer System"
msgstr "有害物質安定化システム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Hazard Stabilizer System'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"Installed throughout your body, just under the skin, is a network of "
"specialized medical equipment.  When activated, it will synthesize "
"antitoxins and catalyze temporary chemical reactions in the muscles and "
"skin.  While active, you will be immune to acid and biological damage, "
"keeping the body relatively stable even if severely poisoned.  It will also "
"prevent, but not cure, the effects of contact and injected hazards, such as "
"venom.  Food poisoning and toxic gas will still affect you, but you will not"
" take damage-over-time from them."
msgstr ""
"全身の皮下に埋め込まれた、専用医療機器のネットワークだ。起動すると解毒剤を合成し、筋肉と皮膚に一時的な化学反応を引き起こす。作動中は酸ダメージと生物学的ダメージへの耐性を得るため、重度の中毒状態でも身体を比較的安定させられる。また、毒液のような接触性・注入性の有害物質の影響を防ぐが、治療はできない。食中毒や有毒ガスの影響は依然として受けるが、それによる継続ダメージは受けない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Hazard Stabilization"
msgstr "有害物質安定化"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Hazard Stabilization'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"Immunity to acid and biological damage.  Prevents, but does not cure, "
"exposure to contact and injected hazards, such as venom.  Food poisoning and"
" toxic gas will still affect you, but you will not take damage-over-time "
"from them."
msgstr ""
"酸ダメージと生物学的ダメージへの耐性を得る。毒液のような接触性・注入性の有害物質の影響を防ぐが、治療はできない。食中毒や有毒ガスの影響は依然として受けるが、それによる継続ダメージは受けない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Cutting Torch"
msgstr "内蔵切断トーチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Integrated Cutting Torch'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"A deployable plasma cutter now resides in your right arm.  Activate it from "
"your inventory to use it as a cutting torch and destroy metal barriers.  "
"More energy intensive than a conventional welder, but can be used for "
"welding if needed."
msgstr ""
"右腕に展開式のプラズマカッターが内蔵されている。インベントリから起動すれば切断トーチとして使用でき、金属製の障害物を破壊できる。通常の溶接機よりエネルギー消費は大きいが、必要であれば溶接にも使用可能だ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Integrated Cutting Torch CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Cutting Torch CBMs"
msgstr[0] "内蔵切断トーチCBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Integrated Cutting Torch CBM'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"A deployable plasma cutter implanted in the right arm, that can be used to "
"destroy metal barriers.  Can also be used for welding if needed."
msgstr "右腕に埋め込む展開式のプラズマカッターだ。金属製の障害物を破壊するのに使用できる。必要であれば溶接にも使用可能。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "integrated cutting torch"
msgid_plural "integrated cutting torchs"
msgstr[0] "内蔵切断トーチ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'integrated cutting torch'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"A bionic plasma cutter.  Activate it to destroy metal barriers, as you would"
" a cutting torch."
msgstr "バイオニック式のプラズマカッターだ。起動すると、通常の切断トーチと同様に金属製の障害物を破壊できる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Biopattern Distortion CBM"
msgid_plural "Biopattern Distortion CBMs"
msgstr[0] "生体パターン撹乱CBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Biopattern Distortion CBM'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"A network of implant that can disguise subtle cues that give away a person's"
" presence to wildlife.  While it doesn't seem effective against the undead, "
"it's enough to fool most wildlife when activated, letting the user approach "
"them without detection."
msgstr ""
"野生動物に気配を悟らせる微細な兆候を隠蔽する、インプラントのネットワークだ。アンデッドには効果がないようだが、起動すればほとんどの野生動物の目をごまかし、気づかれずに接近できるようになる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Biopattern Distortion"
msgstr "生体パターン撹乱"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Biopattern Distortion'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"An advanced network of implants subtly alters your scent, disguises the "
"sound of your heartbeat, and disrupts other subtle cues.  It won't work on "
"the undead or other unnatural threats, but it will allow you to approach "
"most wildlife unhindered, including mutant animals."
msgstr ""
"高度なインプラントのネットワークが、体臭をわずかに変化させ、心音を聞こえにくくし、その他の微細な兆候を撹乱する。アンデッドやその他の異形の脅威には効果がないが、変異動物を含むほとんどの野生動物には気づかれずに近づけるようになる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Biopattern Distortion'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"Earthly wildlife, mutant or otherwise, will currently ignore your presence."
msgstr "地球産の野生動物は、変異体か否かにかかわらず、今のところ気配を察知しない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Sentinel Power Storage"
msgstr "センチネル蓄電システム"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Sentinel Power Storage'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"An experimental and rare Compact Bionics Module that increases your power "
"capacity by 1000 kJ."
msgstr "最大電力容量を1000 kJ増加させる、実験的で希少なCBMだ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid "Sentinel Power Storage CBM"
msgid_plural "Sentinel Power Storage CBM"
msgstr[0] "センチネル蓄電システムCBM"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Sentinel Power Storage CBM'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_bionics.json
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module developed by Omnitech Labs for military "
"applications based on the highly successful Power Storage CBM.  Increases "
"the user's power capacity by 1000 units."
msgstr ""
"高い実績を誇る蓄電システムCBMをベースに、オムニテック研究所が軍事用途向けに開発したCBMだ。使用者の最大電力容量を1000ユニット増加させる。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Rebuilding Civilization: Mechanics'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_books.json
msgid ""
"The mechanics volume of the Rebuilding Civilization encyclopedia.  This book"
" contains everything from simple machines to the inner workings of submarine"
" engines in extremely fine detail.  This book is so technical, longwinded "
"and dry that even bookworms and fast readers would find it hard to read.  "
"Literally any other book on the subject would be a more efficient way to "
"learn but if the books you have are missing specific information then this "
"is a good substitute until you find something better."
msgstr ""
"『文明再建』百科事典の機械工学編だ。単純機械から潜水艦エンジンの内部構造まで、あらゆる内容が極めて詳細に記されている。あまりに専門的で冗長かつ無味乾燥な文章のため、読書家や速読家でさえ読みづらく感じるだろう。この分野については他のどんな本を読んでも、より効率的に学べるのは間違いないが、手持ちの本に特定の情報が欠けている場合には、より良い本が見つかるまでの代用品として役立つ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Rebuilding Civilization: Computers'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_books.json
msgid ""
"The computer volume of the Rebuilding Civilization encyclopedia.  This book "
"contains everything from basic programming to cyber security algorithms in "
"fine detail.  This book is so technical, longwinded and dry that even "
"bookworms and fast readers would find it hard to read.  Literally any other "
"book on the subject would be a more efficient way to learn but if the books "
"you have are missing specific information then this is a good substitute "
"until you find something better."
msgstr ""
"『文明再建』百科事典のコンピューター編だ。基礎的なプログラミングからサイバーセキュリティのアルゴリズムまで、あらゆる内容が詳細に記されている。あまりに専門的で冗長かつ無味乾燥な文章のため、読書家や速読家でさえ読みづらく感じるだろう。この分野については他のどんな本を読んでも、より効率的に学べるのは間違いないが、手持ちの本に特定の情報が欠けている場合には、より良い本が見つかるまでの代用品として役立つ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_books.json
msgid "introduction packet - classified"
msgid_plural "introduction packets - classified"
msgstr[0] "入門資料（機密）"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'introduction packet - classified', 'str_pl':
#. 'introduction packets - classified'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_books.json
msgid ""
"This is a journal with what seems to be an invitation of some sort from some"
" unknown organization.  While its contents are rather boring to read, some "
"bits offer promises of 'forbidden knowledge' and that said contents are "
"'just a taste of true power'…  Science has definitely gone too far…"
msgstr ""
"正体不明の組織からの、何らかの招待状のようなものが記された手記だ。内容自体はかなり退屈だが、一部には『禁断の知識』を約束する文言や、記された内容は『真の力のほんの一端に過ぎない』といった記述がある……科学は明らかに一線を越えてしまったようだ……"

#: ./Surv_help/c_books.json
msgid "Omnitech UPS conversion manual"
msgid_plural "Omnitech UPS conversion manuals"
msgstr[0] "オムニテックUPS変換マニュアル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Omnitech UPS conversion manual'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_books.json
msgid ""
"This is a booklet dealing the instructions on how to convert an Omnitech "
"laser weapon from using atomic batteries to use UPS power.  If you can find "
"one of the kits mentioned, you could replicate the steps on this booklet."
msgstr ""
"オムニテック製レーザー兵器の電源を原子力電池からUPS電源に改造する手順を記した小冊子だ。本書に記載されているキットを入手できれば、この手順を再現できる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_books.json
msgid "printed note"
msgid_plural "printed notes"
msgstr[0] "印刷されたメモ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'printed note'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_books.json
msgid "A scrap of paper.  Something's been printed on it."
msgstr "紙切れだ。何かが印刷されている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_books.json
msgid "folded note"
msgid_plural "folded notes"
msgstr[0] "折りたたまれたメモ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'folded note'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_books.json
msgid ""
"A scrap of paper, hastily folded up.  Something's been scribbled on it."
msgstr "急いで折りたたまれた紙切れだ。何かが走り書きされている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_comestibles.json
msgid "gasoline synthesizing blob glob"
msgid_plural "gasoline synthesizing blob globs"
msgstr[0] "ガソリン合成ブロブのしずく"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gasoline synthesizing blob glob'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A piece of glob that has begun to create gasoline when exposed to the sun.  "
"The gasoline it creates is too mixed up with the glob to be extracted but is"
" still flammable."
msgstr "日光に当たるとガソリンを生成し始めた、ブロブの一片だ。生成されたガソリンはブロブと混ざり合っていて抽出はできないが、可燃性は保たれている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_comestibles.json
msgid "nano-mutagenic serum"
msgid_plural "nano-mutagenic serum"
msgstr[0] "ナノ変異原血清"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'nano-mutagenic serum'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A experimental, super-concentrated cocktail of mutagen and nanomachines.  "
"Vanishingly rare and potentially quite potent in effect.  You need a syringe"
" to inject it… if you really want to?"
msgstr ""
"変異原とナノマシンを超高濃度で配合した、実験的なカクテルだ。極めて希少であり、効果はかなり強力になる可能性がある。注射するには注射器が必要だ……本当にやるつもりなら。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "Exertion"
msgstr "疲労困憊"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Exertion'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "You feel worn out and empty inside."
msgstr "疲れ果て、虚しさを感じている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "Bloodlust"
msgstr "血の渇望"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Bloodlust'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "You thirst for blood!"
msgstr "血に飢えている！"

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Exertion, Bloodlust'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "You feel an unnatural surge of adrenaline!"
msgstr "アドレナリンが異常なほど込み上げてくるのを感じる！"

#. ~ Miss message for effect(s) 'Exertion, Bloodlust'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "Your weariness throws you off."
msgstr "疲労のせいで体勢が崩れる。"

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Exertion, Bloodlust'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "Your bloodlust wears off.  You feel AWFUL!"
msgstr "血の渇望が薄れていく。ひどい気分だ！"

#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json ./Surv_help/c_spells.json
msgid "Biostim"
msgstr "バイオスティム"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Biostim'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "Your muscles feel abnormally tense and it's hard to sit still."
msgstr "筋肉が異常なほど張り詰めていて、じっとしているのが難しい。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "Biostim Overdose"
msgstr "バイオスティム過剰摂取"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Biostim Overdose'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid ""
"Your heart feels like it's going a mile a minute, and every muscle in your "
"body is sore."
msgstr "心臓が猛烈な速さで脈打っているように感じられ、全身の筋肉が痛む。"

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Biostim, Biostim Overdose'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "You feel your muscles tensing up with a surge of abnormal energy!"
msgstr "異常なエネルギーの高まりとともに、筋肉が張り詰めていくのを感じる！"

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Biostim, Biostim Overdose'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid ""
"The tension in your body finally fades back to some degree of normalcy."
msgstr "体の緊張が、ようやくある程度正常な状態へと戻っていく。"

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Biostim, Biostim Overdose'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "The pain in your muscles goes back to just a dull tension."
msgstr "筋肉の痛みは、鈍い張りへと落ち着いていく。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid "Powering Beam Weapon"
msgstr "ビーム兵器への電力供給"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Powering Beam Weapon'.
#: ./Surv_help/c_effects.json
msgid ""
"The salvaged stun emitter is wearing your body down a bit, presumably that's"
" what powers it."
msgstr "回収したスタン・エミッターが体力を少しずつ消耗させている――おそらくそれが動力源になっているのだろう。"

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Survivor Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "You steady yourself, prepared for the fights ahead."
msgstr "気を引き締め、これから始まる戦いに備える。"

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Survivor Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s prepares for the fights ahead."
msgstr "%sが、これから始まる戦いに備える。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "Active Defense"
msgstr "積極防御"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Active Defense' for martial art '{'str': 'Survivor
#. Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid ""
"The best defense is a good offense.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempts, damage blocked increased by 100% of Intelligence.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns, stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"最良の防御は、最良の攻撃だ。\n"
"\n"
"ブロック回数+1、ブロックで軽減するダメージ量が知力の100%分増加する。\n"
"2ターン持続、2回まで重複する。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "Fluid Motion"
msgstr "流動体勢"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Fluid Motion' for martial art '{'str': 'Survivor
#. Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You've learned to move with a purposeful efficiency.  Movement speed "
"increased by 25% of Intelligence."
msgstr "無駄のない効率的な動きを身につけた。移動速度が知力の25%分上昇する。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "Elusiveness"
msgstr "神出鬼没"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Elusiveness' for martial art '{'str': 'Survivor
#. Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Quick and fluid movements make you harder to catch, and better able to roll with the punches.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts, Dodge skill increased by 25% of Intelligence, bash damage taken reduced by 25% of Intelligence, immunity to knockdown.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns, stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"素早く滑らかな動きが、捕まりにくさと、打撃をいなす力を与える。\n"
"\n"
"回避回数+1、回避技能が知力の25%分上昇、被打撃ダメージが知力の25%分軽減、ノックダウン無効。\n"
"3ターン持続、2回まで重複する。"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Post-Human Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid ""
"You've learned a number of tricks to take advantage of the potential that "
"abandoning your humanity can offer.  Focused on heavy, powerful weapons or "
"mutant limbs, a supernaturally strong post-human can use their abilities to "
"great effect."
msgstr ""
"人間性を捨てることで得られる可能性を活かす技を、数多く身につけた。重く強力な武器や変異した四肢を主体とし、超人的な力を持つポストヒューマンはその能力を存分に発揮する。"

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Post-Human Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "Your loosen your footwork and let your instincts take over."
msgstr "足運びを緩め、本能に身を委ねる。"

#. ~ Initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Post-Human Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s enters a loose, animalistic stance."
msgstr "%sが、緩やかで野性的な構えを取る。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "Brutal Efficiency"
msgstr "非情の効率"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Brutal Efficiency' for martial art '{'str': 'Post-
#. Human Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid ""
"One powerful blow makes the follow-up that much easier.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy, armor penetration increased by 25% of strength.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns, stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"強烈な一撃が、次の一撃をより容易なものにする。\n"
"\n"
"命中+2、装甲貫通力が筋力の25%分上昇する。\n"
"2ターン持続、2回まで重複する。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "Large And In Charge"
msgstr "巨躯制圧"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Large And In Charge' for martial art '{'str': 'Post-
#. Human Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Your stance makes better use of your might to compensate for poor footwork.\n"
"Accuracy increased by 15% of strength, -10% move cost."
msgstr ""
"拙い足運びを膂力で補う構えだ。\n"
"命中が筋力の15%分上昇、行動コスト-10%。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "Bull Rush"
msgstr "猛牛突進"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Bull Rush' for martial art '{'str': 'Post-Human
#. Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid ""
"When you get enough momentum going, they're going to feel it.\n"
"\n"
"Movement speed increased by 45% of strength, damage increased by 15% of strength.  Enables \"Battering Ram\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns, stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"勢いが十分につけば、相手はそれを思い知ることになる。\n"
"\n"
"移動速度が筋力の45%分上昇、ダメージが筋力の15%分上昇する。「破城槌」の技が使用可能になる。\n"
"3ターン持続、3回まで重複する。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid "Hit and Run"
msgstr "ヒットアンドラン"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Hit and Run' for martial art '{'str': 'Post-Human
#. Combatives'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_martialarts.json
msgid ""
"Get in, hit hard, get back out.\n"
"\n"
"Movement speed increased by 30% of strength, armor penetration increased by 20% of strength.  Enables \"Foe-Tossing Charge\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns, stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"踏み込み、叩き、離脱する。\n"
"\n"
"移動速度が筋力の30%分上昇、装甲貫通力が筋力の20%分上昇する。「敵投げ突撃」の技が使用可能になる。\n"
"3ターン持続、3回まで重複する。"

