#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"JOINT RESEARCH PROJECT TO INCREASE JOBS: A recent announcement confirmed "
"rumors of a joint research project between several commercial and military "
"research firms, with the stated goal of collaborating to advance several "
"cutting-edge fields.  Though details are still sparse at this time, the "
"project is expected to open thousands of employment opportunities in various"
" fields and departments."
msgstr ""
"雇用拡大へ共同研究プロジェクト：複数の民間企業と軍関連の研究機関が共同研究プロジェクトを進めているとの噂が、先日の発表により裏付けられた。目的は最先端分野における共同研究の推進だという。詳細はまだ明らかにされていないが、このプロジェクトにより様々な分野・部門で数千人規模の雇用が生まれると見込まれている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"BLOOD SPORT STING: Police and Federal officials have uncovered the latest "
"lead on a series of underground \"gladiator games\" involving kidnapped "
"victims forcibly augmented and pitted against each other.  The latest sting "
"has led to the rescue of several victims, but no suspects have been "
"identified or arrested thus far."
msgstr ""
"闘技場摘発作戦：警察および連邦当局は、誘拐された被害者を強制的に身体強化した上で互いに戦わせる、地下「剣闘士競技」に関する一連の事件の新たな手がかりを掴んだ。今回の摘発により数名の被害者が救出されたが、容疑者の特定・逮捕には至っていない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid "\"I'm in awe of the size of that one shambler I saw.  Absolute UNIT\""
msgstr "\"「見かけたシャンブラーのデカさには驚いた。とんでもない図体してたよ」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Saw a whole fuckton of the big ones the other day.  The live ones, "
"followin' an even bigger fucker covered in armor.  Just walked through a "
"horde like nothing.\""
msgstr ""
"\"「この前、でかいやつをクソほど見たぜ。生きてる連中が、鎧をまとったもっとでかい化け物についていってた。群れの中を平然と突っ切ってきやがった」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid "\"they look like the dead but they SHOOT LIKE MEN\""
msgstr "\"「見た目は死人なのに、撃つ腕は人間そのものだ」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"The great wheel turns, I got lasers for days!  Or until my arms fall "
"off.\""
msgstr "\"「運命の輪は回る、レーザーなら何日でも撃てる！ まあ、腕がもげるまでの話だがな」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Had a nice little place out innawoods until my dumb shit friends had the "
"nerve to die on me.  Place turned into a mess in a hurry.\""
msgstr "\"「森の中にいい感じの拠点があったんだが、バカな連中がよりによって死にやがってな。あっという間にめちゃくちゃになっちまった」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid "\"MANKIND IS OBSOLETE\""
msgstr "\"「人類は時代遅れだ」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"The director has confirmed positive ID on local research sites also "
"connected to Project Mesektet, with further contacts linking them to "
"commercial and military research directives across the tri-county area.\""
msgstr ""
"\"「所長は、メセケト計画に連なる地元の研究施設について身元確認を完了した。さらなる接触により、これらが三郡一帯の民間・軍事研究指令と結びついていることが判明している」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"We've tracked down the primary rehabilitation and disposal sites used by "
"the other project assets.  The director has expressed interest in securing "
"them after Unit One is brought online.\""
msgstr ""
"\"「他のプロジェクト資産が使用していた主要な更生・処分施設の所在を突き止めた。所長は、ユニット・ワンの稼働後にこれらを確保することに関心を示している」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Unit One is to remain in standby mode in case the \"disturbance\" causes "
"us any difficulty.  Contingency plan for on-site activation shall be "
"provided to the research director.\""
msgstr "\"「『騒動』により支障が生じた場合に備え、ユニット・ワンは待機状態を維持すること。現地での起動に関する緊急時対応計画は研究所長に提供される」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"3-XII is dispatching a squad to this site, with a unit from 4-VII in tow "
"to secure against hostile action.  Cooperate as best as you are able, but do"
" not allow them into the lab complex itself.\""
msgstr ""
"\"「3-XIIが当施設に部隊を派遣する。敵対行動への備えとして4-VIIからも一隊が同行する。可能な限り協力せよ、ただし研究施設内部への立ち入りは断じて許すな」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"We've received confirmation that they're onto us.  Orders are to delay the"
" security dispatch as long as possible, while the director gets Unit One "
"online.\""
msgstr "\"「我々の動きが察知されたとの確認を得た。所長がユニット・ワンを稼働させる間、警備部隊の到着を可能な限り遅らせよとの命令が下っている」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Boss came down to show our supplier around.  Professional-looking person, "
"would look more at home teaching college kids than working with the "
"Organization.  Didn't seem even the least bit squeamish about the animals "
"though.  Given she works for wherever we get our mutagen and CBMs, I don't "
"want to even think about the shit they must be used to.  Didn't even fucking"
" flinch when one of the freaks in Red Team broke its jaw gnawing on the "
"bars, when she and the boss walked past its cell.\""
msgstr ""
"\"「ボスが下に来て、仕入れ先を案内してた。見た目はきっちりした感じで、組織で働いてるってより大学で教えてそうな女だった。それでも動物どもを見て眉一つ動かさなかったな。うちのミュータゲンやCBMの出所で働いてる女なんだから、普段どんなもん見慣れてるのか考えたくもねえ。レッドチームの化け物の一匹が檻の格子を噛みすぎて顎を折った時も、ボスとその女が独房の前を通り過ぎたが、女はぴくりとも怯まなかった」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Got another fresh shipment, couple CBMs, along with the fresh meat to get "
"Blue Team back up to full roster.  Boss is worried that vetting clients is "
"going to make the next show a complete waste of time.  Told him we shouldn't"
" have given up on streaming in favor of hosting fights on-site, but boss "
"won't budge on that.\""
msgstr ""
"\"「また新しい荷が届いた。CBMが数個と、ブルーチームの頭数を揃えるための新入りだ。ボスは客の身元確認のせいで次の興行がまるごと無駄になるんじゃないかって心配してる。配信をやめて現地開催一本にしたのは失敗だったって言ってやったが、ボスはその方針を変える気はないらしい」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"One of the long-runners on Red Team's getting a bit too smart for its own "
"good.  It's figured out the bars won't give, so instead trashed the toilet "
"in its cell.  Think it knows we have to move it to another cell while we "
"replace the shitter.  The boss is also looking to get his supplier to get "
"their hands on some PE065, that should make it a bit easier to keep "
"contained like the rest.  Might make the next show more fun too.\""
msgstr ""
"\"「レッドチームの古株の一匹が、賢くなりすぎて厄介なことになってきた。格子が壊せないと分かると、代わりに独房のトイレを叩き壊しやがった。便器を交換する間は別の独房に移すしかないと、あいつは分かってるんだと思う。ボスも仕入れ先からPE065を手に入れようとしてる、それがあれば他の連中と同じように拘束しやすくなるはずだ。次の興行がもっと面白くなるかもな」\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"Fight was a complete no-show, none of the clients even called in.  "
"Something's going down back in town, can't get ahold of the boss either.  "
"Going to lock primary access and hit full cell unlock, let the animals have "
"fun tearing each others throats out.  Oughta keep them distracted so I can "
"try and find out what the fuck is going on up there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"「興行は完全な空振りだった、客は一人も連絡してこなかった。町の方で何かが起きてるらしく、ボスとも連絡がつかない。主要出入口を封鎖して、独房を全部解錠してやる。動物どもに好きに殺し合わせておけばいい。それで気を逸らしてる間に、上で一体何が起きてるのか探ってみる」\""

