#. torches'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "You need a source of fire to light this."
msgstr "これに火をつけるには火種が必要だ。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'solar torch', 'str_pl': 'solar torches'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A mysterious torch that uses the power of the sun (and blob goo) to light "
"itself.  Somehow, the gasoline synthesized goo produces gasoline when in the"
" sun continuously soaking the rag making it \"rechargeable\" in a sense.  "
"You need a lighter to turn it on.  Once lit, it can't be turned off until "
"all fuel is used."
msgstr ""
"太陽の力（とブロブの粘液）を利用して自ら火を灯す、謎めいたトーチだ。ガソリンを合成する粘液が日光を浴び続けることで、なぜかガソリンを生成し布に染み込ませ続け、ある意味で「充電」可能になっている。点火にはライターが必要だ。一度火をつけると、燃料を使い切るまで消すことはできない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "solar torch (lit)"
msgid_plural "solar torches (lit)"
msgstr[0] "ソーラートーチ（点火）"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'solar torch (lit)', 'str_pl': 'solar
#. torches (lit)'}.
