msgstr "消火"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'solar torch (lit)', 'str_pl': 'solar torches
#. (lit)'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "The torch is extinguished."
msgstr "トーチの火が消えた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'solar torch (lit)', 'str_pl': 'solar torches
#. (lit)'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A mysterious torch that uses the power of the sun (and blob goo) to light "
"itself.  Somehow, the gasoline synthesized goo produces gasoline when in the"
" sun continuously soaking the rag making it \"rechargeable\" in a sense.  It"
" is burning, producing plenty of light until it runs out of fuel."
msgstr ""
"太陽の力（とブロブの粘液）で自ら火を灯す不思議なトーチだ。ガソリンを合成するその粘液が、太陽光を浴び続けることで布にガソリンを染み込ませ続け、ある意味「再充填可能」になっているらしい。燃えており、燃料が尽きるまで明るい光を放つ。"

