msgid_plural "survivor's tazer dual blades (on)"
msgstr[0] "生存者のテイザーデュアルブレード（オン）"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': "survivor's tazer dual blades (on)", 'str_pl':
#. "survivor's tazer dual blades (on)"}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "You press a button and the blades turns off."
msgstr "ボタンを押すと、両刃の電源が切れた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's tazer dual blades (on)", 'str_pl':
#. "survivor's tazer dual blades (on)"}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"Two makeshift blades with knuckle guards that double as a tazer, or can be "
"activated to electrify your attacks.  They're currently on, crackling with "
"electricity."
msgstr ""
"ナックルガード付きの即席の刃が二本あり、テイザーとしても使え、起動すれば攻撃に電気を纏わせられる。現在オンになっており、バチバチと音を立てて帯電している。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "can forge"
msgid_plural "can forges"
msgstr[0] "空き缶炉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'can forge'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a portable forge with improvised air intake and insulating lining.  "
"It can be used for light metalworking, repairing items, and reheating food, "
"but its utility is limited by its small size and capacity."
msgstr ""
"即席の空気取り入れ口と断熱ライニングを備えた携帯用の炉だ。軽い金属加工やアイテムの修理、食品の温め直しに使えるが、小型で容量が小さいため用途は限られる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "molded hammer"
msgid_plural "molded hammers"
msgstr[0] "鋳造ハンマー"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'molded hammer'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a hammer molded from cast iron.  While a bit brittle if extensively "
"used for combat, it holds up well enough to serve as a tool, though lacks "
"enough of a claw to pry with."
msgstr "鋳鉄から鋳造されたハンマーだ。戦闘で酷使するとやや脆いが、道具として使う分には十分もつ。ただしバールとして使うには爪の部分が足りない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "molded knife"
msgid_plural "molded knives"
msgstr[0] "鋳造ナイフ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'molded knife', 'str_pl': 'molded knives'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a sharp knife molded from cast iron.  A bit brittle and heavy to be "
"extensively used as a weapon, but adequate as a cutting tool.  Works better "
"than sharpening any old metal, at least."
msgstr ""
"鋳鉄から鋳造された鋭いナイフだ。武器として酷使するにはやや脆く重いが、刃物としては十分に使える。少なくとも、そこらの金属を研いだだけのものよりはましだ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "molded pot"
msgid_plural "molded pots"
msgstr[0] "鋳造鍋"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'molded pot'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "A metal molded pot.  Works as intended."
msgstr "金属を鋳造して作った鍋だ。用途通りに機能する。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "molded shovel"
msgid_plural "molded shovels"
msgstr[0] "鋳造シャベル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'molded shovel'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a shovel molded out of cast iron.  Rather heavy and brittle, but "
"does its job at least."
msgstr "鋳鉄から鋳造されたシャベルだ。かなり重く脆いが、少なくとも仕事はこなす。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "molded axe"
msgid_plural "molded axes"
msgstr[0] "鋳造斧"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'molded axe'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is an axe molded from cast iron.  Stands up well enough if used as "
"intended, but is too heavy and brittle to make a good weapon."
msgstr "鋳鉄から鋳造された斧だ。本来の用途で使う分には十分もつが、武器にするには重すぎて脆い。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "fishing string"
msgid_plural "fishing strings"
msgstr[0] "釣り糸"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fishing string'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A long string with a hook attached to the end.  Useful as a crude fishing "
"tool.  Requires bait as lure and sinker."
msgstr "先端に釣り針を付けた長い糸だ。粗末な釣り道具として使える。ルアーとしての餌とおもりが必要になる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "full auto receiver case"
msgid_plural "full auto receiver cases"
msgstr[0] "フルオートレシーバーケース"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'full auto receiver case'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"An adjustable drop-in sear and parts for fitting it to a firearm.  Bulky and"
" custom made, it would require further work to make a functioning receiver."
msgstr ""
"調整可能なドロップインシアと、銃器に取り付けるための部品一式だ。かさばる自作品で、実際に機能するレシーバーにするにはさらなる加工が必要になる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "collapsed fighting bow"
msgid_plural "collapsed fighting bows"
msgstr[0] "折りたたみ戦闘弓"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'collapsed fighting bow'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "Unfold"
msgstr "展開"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'collapsed fighting bow'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "You unfold your bow, locking the arms into place."
msgstr "弓を広げ、アームをしっかり固定した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'collapsed fighting bow'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "A collapsed fighting bow for easy storage.  Activate to arm the bow."
msgstr "収納しやすいよう折りたたまれた戦闘弓だ。起動すると弓を展開できる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "Encampment Project Reminder"
msgid_plural "Encampment Project Reminders"
msgstr[0] "野営地計画のメモ"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'Encampment Project Reminder'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "You read the back of the note and plan your next move."
msgstr "メモの裏を読み、次の行動を思案した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Encampment Project Reminder'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A note describing a group of people creating prepper settlements.  You try "
"to remember if there are any of them nearby.  Maybe the back of the note has"
" coordinates to their settlements."
msgstr ""
"プレッパーの入植地を築く集団について記したメモだ。近くに彼らの拠点がないか思い出そうとする。もしかするとメモの裏に入植地の座標が書かれているかもしれない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "hammer multi-tool"
msgid_plural "hammer multi-tools"
msgstr[0] "ハンマー・マルチツール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hammer multi-tool'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A multi-tool combining a small hammer and pliers with a number of other "
"small tools.  Small and practical, the survivor's mini-tool-kit."
msgstr "小型のハンマーとペンチ、その他いくつかの小道具を組み合わせたマルチツールだ。小さく実用的な、生存者のためのミニ工具セットだ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "Survivor's Cookbook"
msgid_plural "Survivor's Cookbooks"
msgstr[0] "生存者のレシピ帳"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "Survivor's Cookbook"}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A notebook filed with ideas for lots of makeshift gadgets and gizmos.  Once "
"the ideas of mad-man with too much free time, now invaluable knowledge."
msgstr "即席のガジェットや装置のアイデアが詰まったノートだ。かつては暇を持て余した狂人の思いつきに過ぎなかったが、今では貴重な知識となっている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "scout's tool"
msgid_plural "scout's tools"
msgstr[0] "スカウトツール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "scout's tool"}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a bulky electronic wrist mounted tool, designed to provide an "
"accurate topographical map of your surroundings when used.  It also comes "
"with digital clock and alarm features, and can receive targeting data from "
"friendly drones.  The battery is integral to the device, and requires "
"sunlight or a recharging station to charge."
msgstr ""
"かさばる電子式の腕装着型ツールで、使用すると周囲の正確な地形図を得られるよう設計されている。デジタル時計とアラーム機能も備え、味方のドローンから目標データを受信することもできる。バッテリーは本体に内蔵されており、充電するには日光か充電ステーションが必要だ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "bioinjector"
msgid_plural "bioinjectors"
msgstr[0] "バイオインジェクター"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bioinjector'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"An odd, organic-looking auto-injector that slowly secretes some sort of red,"
" blood-like substance.  From what you can understand from the label, it's an"
" experimental stimulant that stabilizes minor wounds and increases "
"performance at the cost of inflicting pain.  The label additionally warns "
"against using it more than once every two hours."
msgstr ""
"奇妙な、有機的な見た目のオートインジェクターで、赤い血のような物質をじわじわと分泌している。ラベルから読み取れる限りでは、これは軽傷を安定させ、痛みを引き起こす代わりにパフォーマンスを向上させる実験的な興奮剤らしい。ラベルにはさらに、2時間に1回以上使用しないよう警告が記されている。"

#. ~ Relic recharge message for TOOL '{'str': 'bioinjector'}'
#. ~ Relic recharge message for TOOL '{'str': 'organic infusion set'}'
#. ~ Relic recharge message for TOOL '{'str': 'organic diffusion set'}'
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "The device draws a sample of your blood."
msgstr "装置が血液のサンプルを採取した。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "organic infusion set"
msgid_plural "organic infusion sets"
msgstr[0] "オーガニック輸液セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'organic infusion set'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A strange infusion set with several organic-looking parts.  It has multiple "
"tubes for simultaneous extraction and infusion of blood.  Its label refers "
"to something called XE037 as the main active component."
msgstr ""
"有機的な見た目のパーツをいくつも持つ、奇妙な輸液セットだ。血液の採取と注入を同時に行うための複数のチューブが付いている。ラベルには、主成分としてXE037と呼ばれるものが記載されている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "organic diffusion set"
msgid_plural "organic diffusion sets"
msgstr[0] "オーガニック拡散セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'organic diffusion set'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A strange infusion set with several organic-looking parts.  It has multiple "
"tubes for simultaneous extraction and infusion of blood.  Its label refers "
"to it as a rapid stem cell treatment, replicating the user's own genetic "
"structure."
msgstr ""
"有機的な見た目のパーツをいくつも持つ、奇妙な輸液セットだ。血液の採取と注入を同時に行うための複数のチューブが付いている。ラベルには、使用者自身の遺伝子構造を複製する急速幹細胞治療だと記載されている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "Map To Unknown Lab"
msgid_plural "Maps To Unknown Lab"
msgstr[0] "未知の研究所への地図"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'Map To Unknown Lab', 'str_pl': 'Maps To
#. Unknown Lab'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "You read the map.  You gulp and realize what must be done…"
msgstr "地図を読み、ごくりと喉を鳴らしながら、なすべきことを悟った…"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Map To Unknown Lab', 'str_pl': 'Maps To Unknown
#. Lab'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a map made by a former scientist of the Bio-Weapon project.  It "
"marks the location of an abandoned laboratory, where a great enemy resides."
msgstr "これは生物兵器計画の元科学者が作った地図だ。放棄された研究所の場所が記されており、そこには強大な敵が潜んでいる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "mysterious note"
msgid_plural "mysterious notes"
msgstr[0] "謎めいたメモ"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'mysterious note'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "Looking down at the note, you memorize the location shown."
msgstr "メモに目を落とし、示された場所を記憶した。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mysterious note'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"\"We have to move away from this place, now.  That thing is coming, and if "
"we don't get out in time, we're all dead.  Grab what you can and head to "
"this location - we'll be establishing a temporary hideout there.\""
msgstr ""
"\"今すぐここを離れなければならない。あれが近づいている。間に合わなければ、全員死ぬ。持てるだけ持って、この場所へ向かってくれ――そこに仮の隠れ家を作る。\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "hand-drawn map"
msgid_plural "hand-drawn maps"
msgstr[0] "手書きの地図"

#. ~ Use action message for {'str': 'hand-drawn map'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"The directions on the map catch your interest.  You wonder if going there is"
" a good idea."
msgstr "地図に記された道順に興味を引かれる。そこへ向かうのが得策かどうか迷う。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'hand-drawn map'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"\"Finally.  I've figured out the coordinates of that lab the terminal "
"records referred to.  From what I can tell, there must be some things of "
"value left inside, and I don't think there's anyone left to care if I take a"
" look.\""
msgstr ""
"\"ついに突き止めた。端末の記録にあったあの研究所の座標が分かった。察するに、中にはまだ価値のあるものが残っているはずだ。それに、俺が覗いたところで文句を言う者はもう残っていないだろう。\""

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "mil-surp weapons pack"
msgid_plural "mil-surp weapons packs"
msgstr[0] "軍払い下げ武器セット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mil-surp weapons pack'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A box sold in military surplus store targeted to the civilian market.  "
"Offers a military surplus rifle, shoulder strap, ammo, basic maintenance "
"kit, and pocket guide book.  This contains the Mosin Nagant 1891/30 rifle."
msgstr ""
"軍払い下げ品を扱う店で民間向けに販売されていた箱だ。軍払い下げのライフル、肩掛けストラップ、弾薬、基本整備キット、携帯ガイドブックが入っている。このセットにはMosin"
" Nagant 1891/30ライフルが入っている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mil-surp weapons pack'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A box sold in military surplus store targeted to the civilian market.  "
"Offers a military surplus rifle, shoulder strap, ammo, basic maintenance "
"kit, and pocket guide book.  This contains the SKS rifle."
msgstr ""
"軍払い下げ品を扱う店で民間向けに販売されていた箱だ。軍払い下げのライフル、肩掛けストラップ、弾薬、基本整備キット、携帯ガイドブックが入っている。このセットにはSKSライフルが入っている。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'mil-surp weapons pack'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A box sold in military surplus store targeted to the civilian market.  "
"Offers a military surplus rifle, shoulder strap, ammo, basic maintenance "
"kit, and pocket guide book.  This contains the M1903 Springfield rifle"
msgstr ""
"軍払い下げ品を扱う店で民間向けに販売されていた箱だ。軍払い下げのライフル、肩掛けストラップ、弾薬、基本整備キット、携帯ガイドブックが入っている。このセットにはM1903"
" Springfieldライフルが入っている。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "paracord survival watch"
msgid_plural "paracord survival watches"
msgstr[0] "パラコードサバイバル腕時計"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'paracord survival watch', 'str_pl': 'paracord
#. survival watches'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A simple wristwatch on a plastic band, wrapped with a paracord bracelet with"
" a thermometer, magnifying glass, and compass attached.  Tells the time and "
"has an alarm clock feature."
msgstr ""
"プラスチックバンドのシンプルな腕時計に、温度計・拡大鏡・コンパスを取り付けたパラコードブレスレットが巻き付けられている。時刻表示に加え、目覚まし機能もある。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "paracord bracelet"
msgid_plural "paracord bracelets"
msgstr[0] "パラコードブレスレット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'paracord bracelet'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "A simple bracelet made out of paracord.  Disassemble for some string."
msgstr "パラコードで作られたシンプルなブレスレットだ。分解すれば紐が手に入る。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "biological weapon conversion kit"
msgid_plural "biological weapon conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "生物兵器転換キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biological weapon conversion kit'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A suspicious box containing many parts, tools and… flesh?  A manual inside "
"the box, giving minimal information on how to use the contents of the box.  "
"It says to see the introductory information packet for more information, "
"whatever that may be."
msgstr ""
"怪しげな箱で、大量の部品や工具、それに……肉片らしきものまで入っている。箱の中にはマニュアルがあり、中身の使い方について最低限の情報しか書かれていない。詳しくは「導入用情報パケット」とやらを参照しろとのことだが、それが何なのかは分からない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "Omnitech UPS conversion kit"
msgid_plural "Omnitech UPS conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "オムニテックUPS転換キット"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Omnitech UPS conversion kit'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A box containing many tools and a few electronic components.  It has the "
"Omnitech logo and the name of device.  On the back there is a description "
"saying you could use this to convert a battery powered Omnitech weapon to "
"use UPS power, if you have the manual for it."
msgstr ""
"多数の工具といくつかの電子部品が入った箱だ。オムニテックのロゴと機器名が記されている。裏面の説明書きによれば、マニュアルさえあれば、これを使って電池式のオムニテック製武器をUPS電源対応に改造できるという。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "inductive CBM charger"
msgid_plural "inductive CBM chargers"
msgstr[0] "誘導式CBM充電器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'inductive CBM charger'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A prototype device giving off noticeable heat, housing a compact "
"radioisotope thermoelectric generator.  Capable of serving as a UPS, but its"
" main purpose is its inductive charging system designed specifically for CBM"
" power storage.  Activating it will dump 50 kJ of power directly into your "
"bionic power reserves, producing a burst of waste heat and radiation."
msgstr ""
"目に見えて熱を発する試作機器で、小型の放射性同位体熱電発電機を内蔵している。UPSとしても使えるが、本来の目的はCBMの電力タンクに特化した誘導充電システムだ。起動すると50"
" kJの電力をバイオニック電力タンクに直接注入するが、その際に大量の廃熱と放射線が放出される。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "makeshift thermal lance"
msgid_plural "makeshift thermal lances"
msgstr[0] "即席サーマルランス"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift thermal lance'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"An improvised welding tool that relies on the pyrophoric nature of steel, "
"plus a supply of oxygen, to create a cutting tool hot enough to melt metal."
"  It can be used as an improvised and inefficient metalworking tool, or you "
"can activate it to destroy metal barriers."
msgstr ""
"鋼の自然発火性と酸素供給を利用した即席の溶接道具で、金属を溶かせるほどの高熱切断具として使える。効率は悪いが即席の金属加工道具として使えるほか、起動すれば金属製の障壁を破壊することもできる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "molded crowbar"
msgid_plural "molded crowbars"
msgstr[0] "鋳造バール"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'molded crowbar'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"This is a hefty prying tool, molded from cast iron.  A bit brittle and heavy"
" to be extensively used as a weapon, but adequate for prying open locked "
"doors.  Not exactly ideal, but it's an improvement over makeshift tools."
msgstr ""
"鋳鉄で鋳造された、ずっしりと重いこじ開け道具だ。武器として使い込むには少々脆く重いが、施錠されたドアをこじ開けるには十分だ。理想的とは言えないが、間に合わせの道具よりはましだ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "makeshift autoclave"
msgid_plural "makeshift autoclaves"
msgstr[0] "即席オートクレーブ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift autoclave'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"This oversized pressure cooker uses diesel or other readily-available fuels "
"to power a high-pressure sterilization chamber.  Less efficient than a "
"commercial battery-powered autoclave and incompatible with a vehicle power "
"grid, it does the job if nothing else is available."
msgstr ""
"この特大の圧力鍋は、ディーゼルなど手に入りやすい燃料を使って高圧滅菌室を稼働させる。市販の電池式オートクレーブより効率は劣り、車両の電源網とも互換性がないが、他に手段がなければ役目は果たす。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "surgical claw"
msgid_plural "surgical claws"
msgstr[0] "外科用鉤爪"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'surgical claw'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A cluster of wiry tissue and irregular structures of alien resin, from which"
" juts an eighteen-inch long blade.  It seems to be made partly of the same "
"green glassy resin, fading gradually into the off-white synthetic bone or "
"keratin forming the edge.  It is still razor-sharp and makes for an awkward "
"cutting tool, but was not built (or grown) with human ergonomics in mind, "
"making it currently ineffective as a weapon."
msgstr ""
"針金のような組織といびつな形状の異星樹脂が絡み合った塊から、18インチほどの長さの刃が突き出している。刃の部分は同じ緑がかったガラス質の樹脂でできているようで、次第にオフホワイトの合成骨、あるいはケラチン質の刃先へと変化していく。今なお剃刀のように鋭いが、扱いにくい切断具であり、人間の身体に合わせて作られた(あるいは育てられた)ものではないため、現状では武器として役に立たない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "biological lens"
msgid_plural "biological lenss"
msgstr[0] "生体レンズ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biological lens'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A relatively small oblong object mostly made out of strange glassy resin.  "
"One end has an opening covered by an almost perfectly clear surface of this "
"material, while the other devolves into a tangled mess of severed tendons "
"and tattered flesh.  A weapon of this sort might be useful, though the "
"fleshy end of it seems ill-suited for human operation."
msgstr ""
"奇妙なガラス質の樹脂でできた、比較的小さな楕円形の物体だ。一方の端にはほぼ完全に透明なこの素材で覆われた開口部があり、もう一方の端は切断された腱と裂けた肉片が絡み合った塊になっている。この種の武器は何かの役に立つかもしれないが、肉質の端は人間が扱うようにはできていないようだ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "resin projector"
msgid_plural "resin projectors"
msgstr[0] "樹脂投射機"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'resin projector'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A long barrel of alien resin blended in with a jumble of iridescent, "
"chitinous flesh and torn muscles.  It clearly seems to be a projectile "
"weapon, but the ruined mess on the other end makes it difficult to tell how "
"the weapon is supposed to function nor if it'd be useful in human hands.  It"
" certainly looks like it wasn't designed with limbs in mind, let alone human"
" hands."
msgstr ""
"異星樹脂でできた長い筒に、虹色に光る甲殻質の肉片と裂けた筋肉が入り混じっている。明らかに投射武器のようだが、もう一方の端がぐちゃぐちゃに損壊しているため、どう機能するのか、人間の手で使い物になるのかは判然としない。四肢――ましてや人間の手――を想定して設計されたものではないのは間違いなさそうだ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "carapace husk"
msgid_plural "carapace husks"
msgstr[0] "甲殻の抜け殻"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carapace husk'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A shell made of multiple plates of strange resin and iridescent flesh, held "
"together by a network of sinew.  It resembles a biological suit of armor for"
" a distinctly inhuman creature more than an actual body part, though the "
"frayed organic wiring lining the inside paints a much more fleshy picture of"
" how it was operated.  It almost seems like it could still be used, although"
" its shape and function clearly never had humans in mind."
msgstr ""
"奇妙な樹脂と虹色の肉片からなる複数のプレートが、腱の網目で繋ぎ合わされた殻だ。体の一部というより、明らかに人間離れした生物のための生体装甲のように見える。とはいえ内側を覆うすり切れた有機配線を見ると、どのように動かしていたのか、より生々しい様子が窺える。今なお使えそうにも見えるが、その形状と機能は明らかに人間を想定したものではない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "alien spinneret"
msgid_plural "alien spinnerets"
msgstr[0] "異星の紡糸器"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'alien spinneret'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A fist-sized clump of gore and torn muscle fibers, from which jut three thin"
" spines of what seems to be synthetic bone, or possibly keratin.  In between"
" the spines are countless thin strands of what looks like brilliant green "
"fiberglass, most likely alien resin.  This seems to be used for either "
"producing or shaping this strange substance, potentially useful but right "
"now it's of little use to anyone like this, human or alien."
msgstr ""
"拳大の血肉と裂けた筋繊維の塊から、合成骨、あるいはケラチン質と思われる三本の細い棘が突き出している。棘の間には、鮮やかな緑色のガラス繊維のような細い繊維が無数に絡み合っており、おそらく異星樹脂だろう。この奇妙な物質を生成、あるいは成形するために使われていたようだ。潜在的には有用かもしれないが、今のこの状態では人間にも異星生物にもほとんど役に立たない。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "set of iridescent wings"
msgid_plural "sets of iridescent wings"
msgstr[0] "虹色の翅"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'set of iridescent wings', 'str_pl': 'sets of
#. iridescent wings'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"Several pairs of glossy insect-like wings, thin green iridescent flesh "
"flushed with congealed fluid in what seem to be veins, weaving a spider-web "
"pattern of pale grey all throughout.  They blend together into a mangled "
"cluster of chitinous plates covering off-white nervous cords, provoking "
"rather strong convulsions when pulled the wrong way.  Whether they fly "
"through the void of space on these or use them for something else, it's "
"evident these wings were manufactured as much as evolved."
msgstr ""
"艶やかな昆虫のような翅が数対あり、薄緑色の虹色の肉に、血管らしきものに凝固した体液が滲み、そこかしこに淡い灰色の蜘蛛の巣模様が走っている。それらは絡み合い、オフホワイトの神経索を覆う甲殻質のプレートの塊となっており、間違った向きに引っ張るとかなり強い痙攣を引き起こす。これで宇宙空間を飛ぶのか、それとも別の用途があるのか分からないが、この翅が進化したのと同じくらい、製造されたものでもあるのは明らかだ。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "salvaged resin extruder"
msgid_plural "salvaged resin extruders"
msgstr[0] "回収樹脂押出機"

#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'salvaged resin extruder'}.
#. ~ Use action menu_text for {'str': 'salvaged resin extruder (alternate
#. mode)', 'str_pl': 'salvaged resin extruders (alternate mode)'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "switch mode"
msgstr "モード切替"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'salvaged resin extruder'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "You switch the %s to weaving mode"
msgstr "%sを織り込みモードに切り替えた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged resin extruder'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A strange device made of alien flesh blended with technology.  Three thin "
"spines of synthetic ivory surround some sort of nozzle, its contents "
"steadily regenerating.  It can be activated to produce shards of resin, for "
"whatever use you may have for such a thing.  Activate it will set it to "
"apply resin more slowly, letting it be used for repairing salvaged mi-go "
"biotechnlogy."
msgstr ""
"異星の肉と技術が融合した奇妙な装置だ。合成象牙質の細い棘が三本、何らかのノズルを取り囲んでおり、中身は絶えず再生している。起動すると樹脂の破片を生成でき、何らかの用途に使えるだろう。起動すると樹脂をよりゆっくり塗布するモードに切り替わり、回収したミ・ゴの生体技術の修理に使えるようになる。"

#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "salvaged resin extruder (alternate mode)"
msgid_plural "salvaged resin extruders (alternate mode)"
msgstr[0] "回収樹脂押出機(代替モード)"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'salvaged resin extruder (alternate mode)',
#. 'str_pl': 'salvaged resin extruders (alternate mode)'}.
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid "You switch the %s to its normal mode"
msgstr "%sを通常モードに切り替えた。"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged resin extruder (alternate mode)',
#. 'str_pl': 'salvaged resin extruders (alternate mode)'}
#: ./Surv_help/c_tools.json
msgid ""
"A strange device made of alien flesh blended with technology.  Three thin "
"spines of synthetic ivory surround some sort of nozzle, its contents "
"steadily regenerating.  It's currently set to apply resin more slowly, "
"letting it be used for repairing salvaged mi-go biotechnlogy.  Activate it "
"to switch back to its normal mode, for creating larger shards of resin for "
"other purposes."
msgstr ""
"異星の肉と技術が融合した奇妙な装置だ。合成象牙質の細い棘が三本、何らかのノズルを取り囲んでおり、中身は絶えず再生している。現在は樹脂をよりゆっくり塗布するモードになっており、回収したミ・ゴの生体技術の修理に使える。起動すると通常モードに戻り、他の用途に使える大きめの樹脂片を生成できるようになる。"

#: ./Terrain/c_construction.json
msgid "Place survivor's station"
msgstr "生存者用ステーションを設置"

#: ./Terrain/c_construction.json
msgid ""
"Will only work if constructed in/on a building that has an electric grid "
"with a mounted battery."
msgstr "電源網とバッテリーが設置された建物内、またはその上に建設した場合のみ機能する。"

#: ./Terrain/c_furniture.json
msgid "grid survivor's station"
msgstr "配電網生存者ステーション"

#. ~ Description for grid survivor's station
#: ./Terrain/c_furniture.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift vehicle mountable station comprised of many utilities, all "
"compressed into a single unit.  Draws power from the electrical grid, "
"combining the functions of a kitchen unit, forge, welding rig, FOODCO "
"kitchen buddy, and a chemistry lab.  Has no cargo space due to all the "
"components it is made out of."
msgstr ""
"多くの機能を一つのユニットに詰め込んだ、車両搭載可能な即席ステーションだ。電源網から電力を得て、調理ユニット・鍛冶炉・溶接装置・FOODCOキッチンバディ・化学実験室の機能を兼ね備えている。構成部品が多いため、貨物スペースはない。"

