"A makeshift vehicle mountable station comprised of many utilities, all "
"compressed into a single unit.  Combines the functionality of a vehicle "
"kitchen unit, forge, welder, chemistry set, and all of the myriad functions "
"of the FOODCO kitchen buddy.  As a consequence, it leaves no space left for "
