msgstr "電気ダイナモ"

#: ./Vehicles/c_vehicle_parts.json
msgid "large electric dynamo"
msgstr "大型電気ダイナモ"

#. ~ Description for large electric dynamo
#: ./Vehicles/c_vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"An electric motor improvised to serve as an electric generator, to be "
"attached to an internal combustion engine.  It would need a fairly powerful "
"engine to effectively generate power, and it's much less efficient compared "
"to its normal application as a motor."
msgstr ""
"内燃機関に取り付けて発電機として使えるよう即席で改造した電気モーターだ。効果的に発電させるにはかなり強力なエンジンが必要であり、モーターとして通常使用する場合に比べ効率はかなり劣る。"

#: ./Vehicles/c_vehicle_parts.json
msgid "enhanced electric dynamo"
msgstr "強化型電気ダイナモ"

#. ~ Description for enhanced electric dynamo
#: ./Vehicles/c_vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"An electric motor improvised to serve as an electric generator, to be "
"attached to an internal combustion engine.  It requires a rather powerful "
"engine to operate, at reduced efficiency compared to its normal application "
"as a motor."
msgstr ""
"内燃機関に取り付けて発電機として使えるよう即席で改造した電気モーターだ。作動させるにはそれなりに強力なエンジンが必要で、モーターとして通常使用する場合に比べ効率は低下する。"

#: ./Vehicles/c_vehicle_parts.json
msgid "super electric dynamo"
msgstr "スーパー電気ダイナモ"

#. ~ Description for super electric dynamo
#: ./Vehicles/c_vehicle_parts.json
msgid ""
"An electric motor improvised to serve as an electric generator, to be "
"attached to an internal combustion engine.  Even being less effective like "
"this, its power output is immense.  You would need one hell of an engine to "
"use this as a generator!"
msgstr ""
"内燃機関に取り付けて発電機として使えるよう即席で改造した電気モーターだ。効率は落ちているとはいえ、その出力は凄まじい。これを発電機として使うには、とてつもなく強力なエンジンが必要になるだろう！"

