#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid "paper Minie ball cartridge"
msgid_plural "paper Minie ball cartridges"
msgstr[0] "紙製ミニエー弾薬包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'paper Minie ball cartridge'}
#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing black powder and a Minie ball.  A paper "
"enclosed version of the historic projectile of the USA Civil war.  The Minie"
" ball is still as deadly and accurate as ever."
msgstr "黒色火薬とミニエー弾を収めた紙製薬包。南北戦争で使われた実弾を紙包みにした再現品だ。ミニエー弾は今でも十分な威力と命中精度を誇る。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json ./Weapons/c_ammo_types.json
msgid "bio-ampoule"
msgid_plural "bio-ampoules"
msgstr[0] "生体アンプル"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'bio-ampoule'}
#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A thin-walled capsule formed of strange resin filled with a strange liquid, "
"used by exotic autoinjector mechanisms."
msgstr "奇妙な樹脂でできた薄壁のカプセルで、中には奇妙な液体が満たされている。特殊な自動注入機構に使われる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid "resin projector bullet"
msgid_plural "resin projector bullets"
msgstr[0] "樹脂製プロジェクター弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'resin projector bullet'}
#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A glassy green pellet of alien resin, molded in a shape resembling an "
"elongated rifle bullet.  Designed for an exotic pneumatic weapon."
msgstr "細長いライフル弾に似た形状に成形された、ガラス質の緑色をした異星樹脂の弾丸だ。特殊な空気圧兵器用に設計されている。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid "molded projector bullet"
msgid_plural "molded projector bullets"
msgstr[0] "成形プロジェクター弾"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'molded projector bullet'}
#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A molded metal projectile for an exotic pneumatic weapon, resembling an "
"elongated rifle bullet.  Inferior to purpose-built resin bullets, but easier"
" to make."
msgstr "細長いライフル弾に似た、特殊な空気圧兵器用の成形金属弾だ。専用の樹脂弾に劣るが、作るのは容易い。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid ".36 paper overpressure cartridge"
msgid_plural ".36 paper overpressure cartridges"
msgstr[0] ".36 紙製増装薬包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.36 paper overpressure cartridge'}
#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing an increased measure of any available powder, "
"and a .36 projectile for the Colt M1861 Navy.  A bit more powerful but less "
"accurate, and potentially unreliable."
msgstr "Colt M1861 Navy用の.36口径弾と、通常より多めの火薬を詰めた紙製薬包だ。威力はやや高いが命中精度は低く、不発の恐れもある。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid ".44 paper overpressure cartridge"
msgid_plural ".44 paper overpressure cartridges"
msgstr[0] ".44 紙製増装薬包"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.44 paper overpressure cartridge'}
#: ./Weapons/c_ammo.json
msgid ""
"A paper cartridge containing an increased measure of any available powder, "
"and a .44 projectile for the Colt M1860 Army.  A bit more powerful but less "
"accurate, and potentially unreliable."
msgstr "Colt M1860 Army用の.44口径弾と、通常より多めの火薬を詰めた紙製薬包だ。威力はやや高いが命中精度は低く、不発の恐れもある。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ammo_types.json
msgid "resin pellets"
msgstr "樹脂弾"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's .223 magazine"
msgid_plural "survivor's .223 magazines"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.223弾倉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's .223 magazine"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"A magazine built for the survivor's .223 assault rifle.  A well-made but "
"still makeshift imitation of STANAG designs."
msgstr "生存者の.223アサルトライフル用に作られた弾倉。出来は良いが、STANAG規格を模した急造品であることに変わりはない。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's 7.62x39 magazine"
msgid_plural "survivor's 7.62x39 magazines"
msgstr[0] "生存者の7.62x39弾倉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's 7.62x39 magazine"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"A magazine built for the survivor's 7.62x39 assault rifle.  A rough "
"simplification of the AKM magazine pattern."
msgstr "生存者の7.62x39アサルトライフル用に作られた弾倉。AKM弾倉のパターンを粗く簡略化したものだ。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's .308 magazine"
msgid_plural "survivor's .308 magazines"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.308弾倉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's .308 magazine"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"A magazine built for the survivor's .308 battle rifle.  Based on the design "
"of the venerable M14's magazine."
msgstr "生存者の.308バトルライフル用に作られた弾倉。由緒あるM14の弾倉設計を元にしている。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's 7.62x54 magazine"
msgid_plural "survivor's 7.62x54 magazines"
msgstr[0] "生存者の7.62x54弾倉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's 7.62x54 magazine"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"A magazine built for the survivor's 7.62x54 battle rifle.  Vaguely based off"
" the magazine design used by the SVT-40, its handmade design makes it "
"incompatible with any production firearm."
msgstr ""
"生存者の7.62x54バトルライフル用に作られた弾倉。SVT-40が用いた弾倉設計を漠然と参考にしているが、手作りゆえに市販の銃器とは互換性がない。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's .30-06 magazine"
msgid_plural "survivor's .30-06 magazines"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.30-06弾倉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's .30-06 magazine"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"A magazine built for the survivor's .30-06 battle rifle.  A rough copy of "
"the Browning Automatic Rifle's standard magazine."
msgstr "生存者の.30-06バトルライフル用に作られた弾倉。Browning Automatic Rifleの標準弾倉を大まかに模したものだ。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's 12 gauge magazine"
msgid_plural "survivor's 12 gauge magazines"
msgstr[0] "生存者の12ゲージ弾倉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's 12 gauge magazine"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"A magazine built for the survivor's full auto shotgun.  A well-made "
"simplification of the Saiga 12's variant of the AK pattern."
msgstr "生存者のフルオートショットガン用に作られた弾倉。Saiga 12のAKパターン派生型を、よくできた形で簡略化したものだ。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's 9mm magazine"
msgid_plural "survivor's 9mm magazines"
msgstr[0] "生存者の9mm弾倉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's 9mm magazine"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"A magazine built for the survivor's 9mm SMG.  Uses a simplified design as "
"seen by handmade magazines for the STEN submachine gun."
msgstr "生存者の9mmサブマシンガン用に作られた弾倉。STENサブマシンガン向けの手製弾倉に見られる簡易設計を採用している。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's .45 magazine"
msgid_plural "survivor's .45 magazines"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.45弾倉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's .45 magazine"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"A magazine built for the survivor's .45 SMG.  Roughly modeled after the "
"MAC-10 magazine in design."
msgstr "生存者の.45サブマシンガン用に作られた弾倉。MAC-10の弾倉デザインを大まかに手本にしている。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's .22 magazine"
msgid_plural "survivor's .22 magazines"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.22弾倉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's .22 magazine"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"A magazine built for the survivor's .22 SMG.  Although well-made, it isn't "
"compatible with any production firearm."
msgstr "生存者の.22サブマシンガン用に作られた弾倉。出来は良いが、市販の銃器とは互換性がない。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's .223 ammo belt"
msgid_plural "survivor's .223 ammo belts"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.223弾薬ベルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's .223 ammo belt"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"An ammo belt for the survivor's .223 LMG, using canvas and steel wire to "
"form non-disintegrating links.  Not as effective as factory-made ammunition "
"belts, and more awkward to reload too."
msgstr ""
"生存者の.223軽機関銃用の弾薬ベルト。キャンバス地と鋼線で非分解式リンクを形成している。工場製の弾薬ベルトほどの性能はなく、装填の手間も大きい。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's 7.62x39 ammo belt"
msgid_plural "survivor's 7.62x39 ammo belts"
msgstr[0] "生存者の7.62x39弾薬ベルト"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's 7.62x39 ammo belt"}
