#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "survivor's .50 magazine"
msgid_plural "survivor's .50 magazines"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.50弾倉"

#. ~ Description for {'str': "survivor's .50 magazine"}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"A magazine built for the survivor's .50 automatic AMR.  Well-made but "
"makeshift, vaguely resembling the magazine from the Barrett M107A1."
msgstr ""
"生存者の.50口径オートマチック対物ライフル用に作られた弾倉。出来は良いが急造品であり、Barrett M107A1の弾倉に漠然と似ている。"

#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid "crank rifle capacitor bank"
msgid_plural "crank rifle capacitor banks"
msgstr[0] "手回しライフル用コンデンサバンク"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'crank rifle capacitor bank'}
#: ./Weapons/c_magazines.json
msgid ""
"This is a homemade power cell made from household batteries along with a "
"series of capacitors, designed to translate mechanical force into enough "
"voltage to more efficiently power a survivor's crank rifle.  It's a wonder "
"this thing isn't an electrocution hazard."
msgstr ""
"家庭用電池と複数のコンデンサを組み合わせて作られた手製の電源で、機械的な力を電圧に変換し、生存者の手回しライフルをより効率的に動かすために作られている。感電事故を起こしていないのが不思議なくらいだ。"

#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid "repurposed monomolecular knife"
msgid_plural "repurposed monomolecular knifes"
msgstr[0] "転用された単分子ナイフ"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'repurposed monomolecular knife'}
#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid ""
"A foot-long knife made from high-tech alloy and edged with bonded "
"nanocrystals, salvaged from a CBM.  A welded metal handle and handguard "
"allow you to hold it without slicing your hand open."
msgstr ""
"CBMから回収した、ハイテク合金製の刃にボンド加工したナノクリスタルを付けた30cmほどのナイフだ。溶接された金属製のハンドルとハンドガードのおかげで、手を切らずに握ることができる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid "repurposed monomolecular sword"
msgid_plural "repurposed monomolecular swords"
msgstr[0] "転用された単分子剣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'repurposed monomolecular sword'}
#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid ""
"A yard-long sword made from high-tech alloy and edged with bonded "
"nanocrystals, salvaged from a CBM.  A welded metal handle and handguard "
"allow you to hold it without slicing your hand open."
msgstr ""
"CBMから回収した、ハイテク合金製の刀身にボンド加工したナノクリスタルを付けた90cmほどの剣だ。溶接された金属製のハンドルとハンドガードのおかげで、手を切らずに握ることができる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid "repurposed bionic claws"
msgid_plural "repurposed bionic claws"
msgstr[0] "転用されたバイオニック鉤爪"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'repurposed bionic claws'}
#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid ""
"Short and sharp claws made from a high-tech metal edged with bonded "
"nanocrystals, salvaged from a CBM and welded to metal knuckles.  Lightweight"
" and fast, wielding them feels as if you were bare-handed."
msgstr ""
"CBMから回収したハイテク金属製で、ボンド加工したナノクリスタルを刃先に持つ、短く鋭い鉤爪をメタルナックルに溶接したものだ。軽量で素早く、素手で戦っているかのような感覚で振るえる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid "repurposed bionic whip"
msgid_plural "repurposed bionic whips"
msgstr[0] "転用されたバイオニック鞭"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'repurposed bionic whip'}
#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid ""
"A long, sharp thread of high-tech material with a small counterweight at the"
" end, salvaged from a CBM.  A metal handle has been welded on to make it "
"actually feasible to use without being more of a danger to the wielder."
msgstr ""
"CBMから回収した、先端に小さなカウンターウェイトを付けたハイテク素材製の長く鋭い糸だ。使い手自身への危険を減らし実用的に扱えるよう、金属製のハンドルが溶接されている。"

#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid "biological blade"
msgid_plural "biological blades"
msgstr[0] "生体刃"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biological blade'}
#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid ""
"A foot-long knife made from metal enclosed with flesh and bone.  Its blade "
"consists of razor sharp saw-like protrusions, with a bone handle that fits "
"well in the hand.  Holding it brings strange whispers to the back of your "
"mind, as though it has a will of its own."
msgstr ""
"肉と骨に包まれた金属で作られた、30cmほどのナイフだ。刃はカミソリのように鋭いノコギリ状の突起から成り、握りやすい骨製のハンドルが付いている。手にすると、まるで意志を持つかのような奇妙な囁きが頭の奥に響いてくる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid "biological sword"
msgid_plural "biological swords"
msgstr[0] "生体剣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biological sword'}
#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid ""
"A yard-long sword of metal, enclosed in flesh and bone, including a "
"protective hilt framed with tough sinews.  Grown from a smaller sample, "
"holding it brings a strange sense of power beyond what it used to.  It feels"
" almost like a living being with a mind of its own, one that lusts for "
"blood."
msgstr ""
"肉と骨に包まれた金属製の、90cmほどの剣だ。頑丈な腱で縁取られた保護用の柄も備えている。より小さな検体から育てられたもので、手にすると以前とは違う奇妙な力の感覚を覚える。まるで血に飢えた、意志を持つ生き物であるかのようだ。"

#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid "salvaged claw blade"
msgid_plural "salvaged claw blades"
msgstr[0] "回収された鉤爪刃"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'salvaged claw blade'}
#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid ""
"A mesh of steel and alien resin gripped in the palm, from which juts a "
"razor-sharp eighteen-inch blade.  The exotic green glass-like material fades"
" into a hardened edge of some off-white synthetic material.  Wielded similar"
" to tiger claws, with its single blade between two fingers.  Salvaged using "
"pre-cataclysm research into other living weaponry, it now works as well for "
"dissection (or vivisection) in human hands as it once did in the clutches of"
" the mi-go."
msgstr ""
"掌で握る鋼鉄と異星樹脂の網状の柄から、カミソリのように鋭い45cmほどの刃が突き出している。異質な緑色のガラス状素材は、乳白色の合成素材でできた硬化した刃先へと変化していく。タイガークロウのように、二本の指の間に一枚の刃を挟んで扱う。大変動以前の生体兵器研究を利用して回収されたもので、かつてミ・ゴの鉤爪の中でそうであったように、人間の手の中でも解剖(あるいは生体解剖)に十分な性能を発揮する。"

#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid "makeshift greatsword"
msgid_plural "makeshift greatswords"
msgstr[0] "即席の大剣"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift greatsword'}
#: ./Weapons/c_melee.json
msgid ""
"A heavy blade made from part of a vehicle frame, sawed down to a single long"
" piece of steel that's been bent to shape and sharpened.  While crude and "
"too bulky to fit in a scabbard, it packs one hell of a punch, and offers "
"decent reach."
msgstr ""
"車両フレームの一部から作られた重い刃だ。一本の長い鋼材に切り出し、曲げて形を整え、研ぎ上げてある。粗雑で鞘に収まらないほどかさばるが、凄まじい一撃を放てるうえ、リーチもそれなりに長い。"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "survivor's auxiliary flamethrower"
msgid_plural "survivor's auxiliary flamethrowers"
msgstr[0] "生存者の補助火炎放射器"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid ""
"A miniature, custom-built flamethrower that can be attached to all sorts of "
"weapons.  It can use a wide range of fuels and is relatively fuel-efficient."
"  It is less effective than a proper flamethrower however, and pressurizing "
"the integral tank takes time."
msgstr ""
"あらゆる種類の武器に装着できる、小型のカスタムメイド火炎放射器だ。幅広い燃料を使用でき、燃費も比較的良い。ただし本格的な火炎放射器ほどの効果はなく、内蔵タンクの加圧には時間がかかる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "underbarrel"
msgstr "銃身下部"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "survivor's auxiliary .22 pistol"
msgid_plural "survivor's auxiliary .22 pistols"
msgstr[0] "生存者の補助.22ピストル"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid ""
"A common .22 LR semi-automatic pistol, modified to attach to another firearm"
" under the barrel at the expense of the base weapon's handling.  Its "
"magazine well has been permanently, almost crudely altered to allow it to "
"use various magazines from similar weapons, at the expense of accuracy and "
"ease of reloading."
msgstr ""
"ごく一般的な.22 "
"LRセミオートピストルを改造し、母体となる銃の取り回しを犠牲にして銃身下部に装着できるようにしたものだ。マガジンウェルは恒久的に、ほとんど粗雑と言えるほど改造されており、類似武器の各種弾倉を使用できる代わりに、命中精度と装填のしやすさが犠牲になっている。"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "survivor's auxiliary 9mm pistol"
msgid_plural "survivor's auxiliary 9mm pistols"
msgstr[0] "生存者の補助9mmピストル"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid ""
"A common 9x19mm semi-automatic pistol, modified to attach to another firearm"
" under the barrel at the expense of the base weapon's handling.  Its "
"magazine well has been permanently, almost crudely altered to allow it to "
"use various magazines from similar weapons, at the expense of accuracy and "
"ease of reloading, plus its purpose makes some high-capacity magazines "
"unusable."
msgstr ""
"ごく一般的な9x19mmセミオートピストルを改造し、母体となる銃の取り回しを犠牲にして銃身下部に装着できるようにしたものだ。マガジンウェルは恒久的に、ほとんど粗雑と言えるほど改造されており、類似武器の各種弾倉を使用できる代わりに、命中精度と装填のしやすさが犠牲になっているうえ、その用途上、一部の大容量弾倉は使用できない。"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "survivor's auxiliary .45 pistol"
msgid_plural "survivor's auxiliary .45 pistols"
msgstr[0] "生存者の補助.45ピストル"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid ""
"A common .45 ACP semi-automatic pistol, modified to attach to another "
"firearm under the barrel at the expense of the base weapon's handling.  Its "
"magazine well has been permanently, almost crudely altered to allow it to "
"use various magazines from similar weapons, at the expense of accuracy and "
"ease of reloading."
msgstr ""
"ごく一般的な.45 "
"ACPセミオートピストルを改造し、母体となる銃の取り回しを犠牲にして銃身下部に装着できるようにしたものだ。マガジンウェルは恒久的に、ほとんど粗雑と言えるほど改造されており、類似武器の各種弾倉を使用できる代わりに、命中精度と装填のしやすさが犠牲になっている。"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "survivor's laser sight"
msgid_plural "survivor's laser sights"
msgstr[0] "生存者のレーザーサイト"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid ""
"A sight made for maximum target acquisition.  It is composed of a small "
"makeshift red dot sight that emits a laser beam at what it targets.  The "
"reticle in the sight allows proper aiming while the laser beam allows for "
"quick target aim."
msgstr ""
"目標捕捉を最大限に高めるために作られた照準器だ。狙った相手にレーザービームを照射する、小型の即席ドットサイトで構成されている。サイト内のレティクルで正確な照準が可能なうえ、レーザービームによって素早い目標捕捉もできる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "sights"
msgstr "照準器"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "survivor's LMG recoil handle"
msgid_plural "survivor's LMG recoil handles"
msgstr[0] "生存者のLMGリコイルハンドル"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid ""
"A side-mounted handle designed for machine guns, to help in hip fire.  Makes"
" aiming easier and greatly reduces recoil, but hinders the use of the "
"weapon's sights and makes it slower to wield."
msgstr ""
"腰だめ撃ちを補助するために設計された、機関銃用のサイドマウントハンドルだ。照準を容易にし反動を大幅に軽減するが、銃の照準器の使用を妨げ、構えるのも遅くなる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "grip"
msgstr "グリップ"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "hydrogen density converter"
msgid_plural "hydrogen density converters"
msgstr[0] "水素密度コンバーター"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid ""
"An ad-hoc conversion kit designed by Omnitech for experimental plasma "
"weaponry.  Its purpose is to reconfigure the emitter to function with much "
"lower compression rates, allowing it to use commercial-grade hydrogen "
"instead of now-irreplaceable compressed hydrogen canisters.  This will give "
"the weapon reduced power, range, and accuracy."
msgstr ""
"オムニテック研究所が実験的なプラズマ兵器向けに設計した、急ごしらえの改造キットだ。エミッターをはるかに低い圧縮率で機能するよう再構成し、今や代替不能となった圧縮水素缶の代わりに、市販グレードの水素を使用できるようにすることを目的としている。これにより武器の出力、射程、命中精度は低下する。"

#: ./Weapons/c_mods.json
msgid "emitter"
msgstr "エミッター"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "bio laser pistol"
msgid_plural "bio laser pistols"
msgstr[0] "バイオレーザーピストル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"Finger Laser CBM turned into a pistol.  Still very accurate, but not "
"particularly damaging."
msgstr "指レーザーCBMをピストルに改造したものだ。依然として非常に高精度だが、さほどダメージは大きくない。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "pistol"
msgstr "拳銃"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"Rifle built with parts salvaged from a Chain Lightning CBM.  Fires bolts of "
"electricity that jump between nearby enemies."
msgstr "チェーンライトニングCBMから回収した部品で組み立てられたライフルだ。付近の敵の間を伝う電撃を発射する。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "biological pistol"
msgid_plural "biological pistols"
msgstr[0] "生体ピストル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A pistol made out of fleshy material enclosed by metal.  Whatever it fires "
"seems to be solid enough to do damage along with immolating victims.  "
"Wielding it gives you a strange sense of focus, though the occasional twitch"
" and unnerving sound from this thing leaves you uneasy.  Hopefully it's not "
"sentient."
msgstr ""
"金属に包まれた肉質の素材で作られたピストルだ。何を発射しているのかは不明だが、対象にダメージを与えつつ焼き尽くすには十分な威力を持っているようだ。構えると不思議な集中力を感じるが、時折ぴくりと動いたり不穏な音を立てたりするため、落ち着かない気分にさせられる。意志を持っていないことを祈るばかりだ。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "semi"
msgstr "単発"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "2-rd. burst"
msgstr "2点バースト"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "biological sub-machinegun"
msgid_plural "biological sub-machineguns"
msgstr[0] "生体サブマシンガン"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A sub-machinegun made out of fleshy material enclosed by metal.  Whatever "
"the hell it fires seems to have an incendiary effect on targets.  Wielding "
"it gives you a strange sense of focus, though the occasional twitch and "
"unnerving sound from this thing leaves you uneasy.  Hopefully it's not "
"sentient."
msgstr ""
"金属に包まれた肉質の素材で作られたサブマシンガンだ。一体何を発射しているのか知らないが、対象に対して焼夷効果があるようだ。構えると不思議な集中力を感じるが、時折ぴくりと動いたり不穏な音を立てたりするため、落ち着かない気分にさせられる。意志を持っていないことを祈るばかりだ。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "burst"
msgstr "バースト"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "smg"
msgstr "短機関銃"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "biological rifle"
msgid_plural "biological rifles"
msgstr[0] "生体ライフル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A rifle made out of fleshy material enclosed by metal.  It fires something "
"seemingly alive, over quite a long range in fact, horribly burning and "
"stunning whatever it hits.  Wielding it gives you a strange sense of focus, "
"though the occasional twitch and unnerving sound from this thing leaves you "
"uneasy.  Hopefully it's not sentient."
msgstr ""
"金属に包まれた肉質の素材で作られたライフルだ。生きているとしか思えない何かを、かなりの長射程で発射し、命中した相手を恐ろしく焼き焦がし怯ませる。構えると不思議な集中力を感じるが、時折ぴくりと動いたり不穏な音を立てたりするため、落ち着かない気分にさせられる。意志を持っていないことを祈るばかりだ。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "biological machinegun"
msgid_plural "biological machineguns"
msgstr[0] "生体マシンガン"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A light machinegun made out of fleshy material enclosed by metal.  It fires "
"unnatural, presumably-living rounds that daze and immolate almost anything "
"hit by sustained fire.  Wielding it gives you a strange sense of focus, "
"though the occasional twitch and unnerving sound from this thing leaves you "
"uneasy.  Hopefully it's not sentient."
msgstr ""
"金属に包まれた肉質の素材で作られた軽機関銃だ。おそらく生きていると思われる異様な弾を発射し、継続射撃で命中したほぼ全てのものを怯ませ焼き尽くす。構えると不思議な集中力を感じるが、時折ぴくりと動いたり不穏な音を立てたりするため、落ち着かない気分にさせられる。意志を持っていないことを祈るばかりだ。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "low auto"
msgstr "低速オート"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "high auto"
msgstr "高速オート"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "biological scattergun"
msgid_plural "biological scatterguns"
msgstr[0] "生体スキャッターガン"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"An automatic shotgun made out of fleshy material enclosed by metal.  It's "
"hard to tell what this thing even fires, but it appears to have a powerful "
"stunning and incendiary effect on targets.  Wielding it gives you a strange "
"sense of focus, though the occasional twitch and unnerving sound from this "
"thing leaves you uneasy.  Hopefully it's not sentient."
msgstr ""
"金属に包まれた肉質の素材で作られたオートショットガンだ。一体何を発射しているのか判然としないが、対象に強力な怯み効果と焼夷効果を与えるようだ。構えると不思議な集中力を感じるが、時折ぴくりと動いたり不穏な音を立てたりするため、落ち着かない気分にさせられる。意志を持っていないことを祈るばかりだ。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "shotgun"
msgstr "散弾銃"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's pneumatic LMG"
msgid_plural "survivor's pneumatic LMGs"
msgstr[0] "生存者の空気圧LMG"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A high-powered, multistroke pneumatic rifle with a basic magazine hopper.  "
"While handcrafted, it is higher in quality than most homemade weapons, using"
" a hand crank and cam to power its air compressor, allowing for a modest "
"volume of fire."
msgstr ""
"基本的なホッパー式弾倉を備えた、高出力のマルチストローク式空気圧ライフルだ。手作りではあるが、大半の自家製武器よりも品質が高く、ハンドクランクとカムでエアコンプレッサーを駆動し、そこそこの連射速度を実現している。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's UPS rifle"
msgid_plural "survivor's UPS rifles"
msgstr[0] "生存者のUPSライフル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift, albeit advanced, laser rifle.  Relatively potent but less "
"efficient than proper models.  Reasonably reliable and can be mounted on a "
"vehicle."
msgstr ""
"即席ではあるが、高度な作りのレーザーライフルだ。比較的高威力だが、正規のモデルほど効率は良くない。信頼性はそれなりに高く、車両に搭載することもできる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's crank rifle"
msgid_plural "survivor's crank rifles"
msgstr[0] "生存者のクランクライフル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"Further building on the developments that went into the UPS rifle, this "
"integrates a hand crank and capacitors to charge a custom-made power cell.  "
"Infinite ammo at the cost of reliability.  Use it to deploy the crank "
"charger."
msgstr ""
"UPSライフルの開発をさらに発展させ、ハンドクランクとコンデンサーを組み込んでカスタムメイドのパワーセルを充電できるようにしたものだ。信頼性と引き換えに無限の弾薬を得られる。使用するとクランク充電器が展開する。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's battery pistol"
msgid_plural "survivor's battery pistols"
msgstr[0] "生存者のバッテリーピストル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A simple electronic pistol, using batteries from common household "
"electronics to power a low-yield electrolaser.  Not very powerful, but can "
"shock targets."
msgstr ""
"一般的な家電製品用の電池を使って低出力のエレクトロレーザーを駆動する、単純な電子ピストルだ。威力はあまり高くないが、対象に電撃を与えられる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's battery rifle"
msgid_plural "survivor's battery rifles"
msgstr[0] "生存者のバッテリーライフル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A simple electronic rifle, using batteries from common power tools to power "
"a low-yield electrolaser.  A bit more potent than its pistol variant, but "
"still quite an inefficient use of power."
msgstr ""
"一般的な電動工具用の電池を使って低出力のエレクトロレーザーを駆動する、単純な電子ライフルだ。ピストル型よりもやや高威力だが、それでも電力効率はかなり悪い。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's .223 assault rifle"
msgid_plural "survivor's .223 assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.223突撃銃"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade assault rifle built from a full auto receiver.  While "
"still lower quality than most pre-cataclysm rifles, it's superior to many "
"other homemade weapons.  Takes the .223 cartridge via its custom-made "
"magazine, and can accept certain STANAG magazines of equal or lesser "
"capacity."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから組み立てられた、(ほぼ)自家製の突撃銃だ。大変動以前の大半のライフルよりは品質が劣るものの、他の多くの自家製武器よりは優れている。専用に作られた弾倉で.223カートリッジを使用し、同等以下の容量を持つ一部のSTANAGマガジンも使用できる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's .22 SMG"
msgid_plural "survivor's .22 SMGs"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.22 SMG"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade SMG built from a full auto receiver.  While still lower "
"quality than most pre-cataclysm SMGs, it's superior to many other homemade "
"weapons.  Takes the .22 cartridge via its custom-made magazine."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから組み立てられた、(ほぼ)自家製のSMGだ。大変動以前の大半のSMGよりは品質が劣るものの、他の多くの自家製武器よりは優れている。専用に作られた弾倉で.22カートリッジを使用する。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's 9mm SMG"
msgid_plural "survivor's 9mm SMGs"
msgstr[0] "生存者の9mm SMG"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade SMG built from a full auto receiver.  While still lower "
"quality than most pre-cataclysm SMGs, it's superior to many other homemade "
"weapons.  Takes the 9mm cartridge via its custom-made magazine, or can "
"accept lower-capacity makeshift STEN magazines."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから作られた（ほぼ）自作のサブマシンガン。大変動以前のサブマシンガンの大半よりは品質が劣るものの、他の自作武器の多くよりは優れている。自作の弾倉で9mm弾を使用するほか、より小容量の自作STEN弾倉も使用できる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's .45 SMG"
msgid_plural "survivor's .45 SMGs"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.45口径サブマシンガン"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade SMG built from a full auto receiver.  While still lower "
"quality than most pre-cataclysm SMGs, it's superior to many other homemade "
"weapons.  Takes the .45 cartridge via its custom-made magazine, and can "
"accept lower-capacity makeshift variants of the MAC-10 magazine."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから作られた（ほぼ）自作のサブマシンガン。大変動以前のサブマシンガンの大半よりは品質が劣るものの、他の自作武器の多くよりは優れている。自作の弾倉で.45口径弾を使用するほか、より小容量の自作MAC-10弾倉の派生型も使用できる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's .308 battle rifle"
msgid_plural "survivor's .308 battle rifles"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.308口径バトルライフル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade automatic rifle built from a full auto receiver.  While "
"still lower quality than most pre-cataclysm rifles, it's superior to many "
"other homemade weapons.  Takes the .308 cartridge via its custom-made "
"magazine, and compatible with magazines from the old M14 rifle."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから作られた（ほぼ）自作の自動小銃。大変動以前のライフルの大半よりは品質が劣るものの、他の自作武器の多くよりは優れている。自作の弾倉で.308口径弾を使用するほか、旧型M14ライフルの弾倉にも対応する。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's 7.62x39 assault rifle"
msgid_plural "survivor's 7.62x39 assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "生存者の7.62x39mmアサルトライフル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade assault rifle built from a full auto receiver.  While "
"still lower quality than most pre-cataclysm rifles, it's superior to many "
"other homemade weapons.  Takes the 7.62x39mm cartridge via its custom-made "
"magazine, and can accept any AK-pattern magazine of equal or lesser "
"capacity."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから作られた（ほぼ）自作のアサルトライフル。大変動以前のライフルの大半よりは品質が劣るものの、他の自作武器の多くよりは優れている。自作の弾倉で7.62x39mm弾を使用するほか、同等以下の容量のAKパターン弾倉であればどれでも使用できる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's 7.62x54 battle rifle"
msgid_plural "survivor's 7.62x54 battle rifles"
msgstr[0] "生存者の7.62x54mmバトルライフル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade automatic rifle built from a full auto receiver.  While "
"still lower quality than most pre-cataclysm rifles, it's superior to many "
"other homemade weapons.  Takes the 7.62x54mmR cartridge via its custom-made "
"magazine."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから作られた（ほぼ）自作の自動小銃。大変動以前のライフルの大半よりは品質が劣るものの、他の自作武器の多くよりは優れている。自作の弾倉で7.62x54mmR弾を使用する。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's .30-06 battle rifle"
msgid_plural "survivor's .30-06 battle rifles"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.30-06口径バトルライフル"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade automatic rifle built from a full auto receiver.  While "
"still lower quality than most pre-cataclysm rifles, it's superior to many "
"other homemade weapons.  Takes the .30-06 cartridge via its custom-made "
"magazine, and can accept magazines from the BAR of comparable capacity."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから作られた（ほぼ）自作の自動小銃。大変動以前のライフルの大半よりは品質が劣るものの、他の自作武器の多くよりは優れている。自作の弾倉で.30-06弾を使用するほか、同程度の容量のBAR用弾倉も使用できる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's full-auto shotgun"
msgid_plural "survivor's full-auto shotguns"
msgstr[0] "生存者のフルオートショットガン"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade full auto shotgun built from a full auto receiver.  "
"While still lower quality than most pre-cataclysm shotguns, it's superior to"
" many other homemade weapons.  Takes the 12 gauge cartridge via its custom-"
"made magazine, and can accept lower-capacity variants of the Saiga 12 "
"magazine."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから作られた（ほぼ）自作のフルオートショットガン。大変動以前のショットガンの大半よりは品質が劣るものの、他の自作武器の多くよりは優れている。自作の弾倉で12番径弾を使用するほか、より小容量のSaiga"
" 12弾倉の派生型も使用できる。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's .308 GPMG"
msgid_plural "survivor's .308 GPMGs"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.308口径汎用機関銃"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade GPMG built from a full auto receiver.  Although well-"
"made, its high volume of fire makes reliability and accuracy an issue.  "
"Takes the .308 cartridge via a belt feed."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから作られた（ほぼ）自作の汎用機関銃。作りは良いものの、発射速度の高さが信頼性と命中精度の面で難点となっている。ベルト給弾で.308口径弾を使用する。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's 7.62x39 LMG"
msgid_plural "survivor's 7.62x39 LMGs"
msgstr[0] "生存者の7.62x39mm軽機関銃"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid ""
"A (mostly) homemade LMG built from a full auto receiver.  Although well-"
"made, its high volume of fire makes reliability and accuracy an issue.  "
"Takes the 7.62x39 cartridge via a belt feed."
msgstr ""
"フルオートレシーバーから作られた（ほぼ）自作の軽機関銃。作りは良いものの、発射速度の高さが信頼性と命中精度の面で難点となっている。ベルト給弾で7.62x39mm弾を使用する。"

#: ./Weapons/c_ranged.json
msgid "survivor's .223 LMG"
msgid_plural "survivor's .223 LMGs"
msgstr[0] "生存者の.223口径軽機関銃"

